 KAC LAMG","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/gun/kac-lamg","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/337s7lgdoheldl53b35tr3r2mx3z/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/LAMG_Render1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/337s7lgdoheldl53b35tr3r2mx3z/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/LAMG_Render1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/gun/kac-lamg","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"military","subcategorySlug":"gun","categoryTitle":"Military","subcategoryTitle":"Gun","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6772974/181db637c7/kac-lamg-3d-model-181db637c7.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4112932","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4112932,"title":"Atlantic Ocean Cliff Coast Line Scan PBR","price":120.0,"description":"Captured in neutral lighting conditions, decimated and with** PBR **textures for easier use.\n\nAll pictures are rendered in Cycles with displacement and adaptive subdivision.\n\nThe cliffs where scanned all in the same area and will fit well together!\n\n**16K/8K** material:\n\n- Albedo\n- Roughness\n- Normal\n- Displacement\n- Ambient Occlusion 8K\n\n\n Model Informations: \n\n- .blend\n- .obj\n- .fbx\n\nScanned at the coast of the atlantic ocean in Spain.\n\n*the ocean, vegetation in the preview pictures are not included","imageAlt":"3D asset Atlantic Ocean Cliff Coast Line Scan PBR","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/atlantic-ocean-cliff-coast-line-scan-pbr","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/6xgsQPfq4Wm3WC5h8Lus2YBW/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/thumbnail1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/6xgsQPfq4Wm3WC5h8Lus2YBW/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/thumbnail1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/atlantic-ocean-cliff-coast-line-scan-pbr","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"scanned","subcategorySlug":"various","categoryTitle":"Scanned 3D Models","subcategoryTitle":"Various","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4112932/abfa7f6ffe/atlantic-ocean-cliff-coast-line-scan-pbr-3d-model-abfa7f6ffe.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5851850","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5851850,"title":"Dubai City 3D model","price":970.0,"description":"\n\n-Dubai skyscraper with High detailed model of shaikh zayed road and dubai downtown area.\n\n-dubai satellite map more than 30k reseliotion\n\n-The scene is done by 3ds Max 2021 rendered in corona\n\n-This 3d models was made with care in every particular.\n\n-only the cars removed from the file\n\n-the images from the render buffer only adding color correction \n\n-Rhere is a hiding ground plan under shaikh zayed road you can use it for the close shots only\n\n-Real world scale ( 90%) \n\nNote:\nIf you will use another programs and expect to get the same result from first click so dont buy this model, the file will open properly with 3ds max and corona\n\nThank you","imageAlt":"Dubai City 3D model corona","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/dubai-c