and background are not included in the product. The model is clean and centred at the origin with real-world scale.","imageAlt":"Lime - Green 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/lime-green-76844696-8af2-4454-a841-432b39ae3f3f","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1Rygt1KFUGkkaX5xV8mhJnEx/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/limePreview.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1Rygt1KFUGkkaX5xV8mhJnEx/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/limePreview.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/lime-green-76844696-8af2-4454-a841-432b39ae3f3f","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"food","subcategorySlug":"fruit","categoryTitle":"Food","subcategoryTitle":"Fruit","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3578197/d66563911e/lime-green-3d-model-d66563911e.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6738116","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6738116,"title":"Mercedes-Benz Sprinter Detailed interior Long High Roof 2023","price":49.0,"description":"Mercedes-Benz Sprinter Detailed interior. Long High Roof 2023\n\nMercedes-Benz Sprinter of the third generation (2018-…).  W907. All-metal van.\n\nThe 3D model matches the dimensions of the actual vans but is not an accurate CAD engineering model. This should be taken into account if you work in industrial design. \n\nMercedes-Benz Sprinter Long High Roof 3500kg RWD. L3H2.\n\nDimensions: 6967 mm (length) x 2616 mm (height) x 2345 mm \n\nWheelbase: 4325 mm\n\nPolys: 414056 Verts: 441557\n\nModel features:\n\nDetailed exterior. Detailed interior. Detailed cargo area.\nEach object has a material name, you can easily change or apply materials.\nIt is easy to separate sub-objects from the object into separate elements.\nAll objects are georeferenced to a point with zero coordinates.\nIn the model are applied simple Materials that do not require textures.\nThe preview is obtained using the Corona renderer and with these materials.\nUse files with extension (.FBX) to import this model into other graphic editors, if they support importing (.FBX) files.\n\nFormats:\n\n1) max (2021 + Corona 12),\n\n2) fbx (2016 Corona),\n\n3) obj,\n\n4) blend 3.6 (materials require customization)\n\nRender: Corona\n\nHappy renders! See other models on my profile.\n","imageAlt":"3D model Mercedes-Benz Sprinter Detailed interior Long 2","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/mercedes-benz-sprinter-detailed-interior-long-high-roof-2023","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/8hc9ivjmtpyzknithfttlql25cmt/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/00.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/8hc9ivjmtpyzknithfttlql25cmt/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/00.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/mercedes-benz-sprinter-detailed-interior-long-high-roof-2023","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"vehicle","subcategorySlug":"truck","categoryTitle":"Vehicle","subcategoryTitle":"Truck","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6738116/1c975f2227/mercedes-benz-sprinter-detailed-interior-long-high-roof-2023-3d-model-1c975f2227.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5534465","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5534465,"title":"Archmodels vol 295 - factory and warehouse equipment","price":149.0,"description":"Archmodels vol.295 brings you over 130 detailed models combined in 37 sets of factory and warehouse elements and equipment. You will find models like walls, floors, poles and stairs as well as various factory machinery and warehouse interior equipment. Models are prepared in modular approach so you can use them to build your scene quickly and be able to create multiple versions of your project and with various props and devices you can fill it really efficiently. We put every effort to prepare it with attention to small detail. The collection is made in PBR material system. \n\n**In addition, you will also get the warehouse scene. This scene is available only in such formats: 3ds Max 2021 with Corona 12 or V-ray 6 and Blender 4.2 with Cycles.**\n\nThe files are packed into 7zip format, you need to follow these steps to extract them properly:\n\n1. Download all files to one folder\n2. Use WinRAR or 7-zip for unpacking.\n3. Unpack only the first file from each archive (the file with .001 extension). The rest of the files will be unpacked automatically.","imageAlt":"Archmodels vol 295 - factory and warehouse equipment 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/industrial/other/archmodels-vol-295-factory-and-warehouse-equipment","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/oA9ynYx6pVrU7YGKTqcqWbFu/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/AM295_Cover_001_render_001_2560x1440.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/oA9ynYx6pVrU7YGKTqcqWbFu/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/AM295_Cover_001_render_001_2560x1440.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/industrial/other/archmodels-vol-295-factory-and-warehouse-equipment","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":207,"name":".usd","is_native":false},{"id":108,"name":".mdl","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"industrial","subcategorySlug":"other","categoryTitle":"Industrial","subcategoryTitle":"Other","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5534465/44f3c7a9b9/archmodels-vol-295-factory-and-warehouse-equipment-3d-model-44f3c7a9b9.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6481095","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6481095,"title":"Workers Modular Character","price":65.0,"description":"**A Game-Ready, lowpoly, modular character with PBR textures.**\n- The character is integrated into the third-person Unreal Engine and Unity game project.\n- The character has Epic skeleton (UE5 -Manny skeleton) and Humanoid skeleton (Unity).\n- Asset contains 58 modular skeletal meshes, with 4 to 10 skin, for each module.\n- 18 static meshes. Separate workers instruments devices and tools.\n- Modules allow you to assemble different characters.\n- 10 ready-made characters, to speed up the creation of your own characters.\n\n_Vertex/Tris counts of characters:_\n- Minimum modules: 6195 / 12268\n- Average modules: 7666 / 15184\n- Maximum: 11019 / 21417\n\n_Package contains:_\n- Rigged \u0026 skinned character, file format: mb, max, fbx, blend, c4d, dae.\n- Textures, resolution: 2048x2048, PNG-Format (Color, Normal, Roughness, Metalness, AO)\n- UnrealEngine package, ready to import into UnrealEngine project.\n- Unitypackage, ready to import into Unity project content folders.\n- Demo animations.","imageAlt":"Workers Modular Character 3D model animated","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/workers-modular-character","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/xqbmsjk5ni24wh0p99woal1zx1l7/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/a2_3.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/xqbmsjk5ni24wh0p99woal1zx1l7/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/a2_3.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/workers-modular-character","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":25,"name":".dae","is_native":false},{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"man","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Man","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6481095/c800031176/workers-modular-character-3d-model-c800031176.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"48618","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":48618,"title":"Animated Horses v5","price":399.0,"description":"Realistic animated horses including saddle, reins and horseshoes. \n_**Unicorn variation included.**_\n\n- 3 Different hair styles and 25 skin materials\n- Clean topology and high resolution textures (4k to 8k)\n- Texture based muscle system (3ds Max only)\n\n- Fully rigged and animated (100-1500) including the following loopable animations:\n\n1. \tWalk (loop 155-181)\n2. \tTrot (loop  212-232)\n3. \tCanter (loop 274-286)\n4. \tGallop (loop 325-338)\n5. \tJump (340-440)\n6. \tBite attack (441-520)\n7. \tStand breathing (521-620)\n8. \tShrugging head (621-750)\n9. \tWaving tail (751-865)\n10. \tScratching ground (866-1005)\n11. \tFeeding (1006-1200)\n12. \tRise and Stand on back legs (1201-1350)\n13. \tDeath (rise and fall to ground) (1370-1500)\n\n\n**SOFTWARE**\n\n- 3ds Max - Vray,  Arnold \u0026 Standard\n- Maya – Arnold \u0026 Vray\n- Cinema 4D - Standard Render\n- Blender - Cycles - Polygonal Hair\n- Alembic (Animation, Velocity, UV's, Polygonal Hair, Spline/NURBS Hair Guides) Ogawa format\n- FBX (Rig, Animation, Polygonal Hair \u0026 Spline Hair Guides)\n- OBJ (Static Geometry, UV´s, Textures)\n\n\n**TEXTURES / SHADERS**\n-\tHi-res and very detailed textures, up to 8K \n-\tPBR Materials \u0026 Textures included for Black, Brown, Brown Dark, Brown Light, Brown Light Mottled, Brown Pale Dark, Brown Pale Light, Champagne, Chestnut, Chestnut Mottled, Chestnut White, Cream, Light Gray, Mottled Gray, Pale, Pearl Dark, Pearl Mottled, Percheron, Pinto, Pinto Black, Pinto Bright, Pinto Light and White.\n-\tBlack, Blonde, Brown, Red and White Hair included with Long \u0026 Short styles (Caches included).\n\n\n**POLYCOUNT (Quads - Vertex):**\n\n- Horse 5.396 -  5.406  \n- Saddle 19.278 -  18.138\n- Reins 15.418 -  14.378\n\n","imageAlt":"Animated Horses v5 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/mammal/animated-horses-v2","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/M5zA94jUdfSPhgxtAEvdMRdA/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Horse_Vray_00.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/M5zA94jUdfSPhgxtAEvdMRdA/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Horse_Vray_00.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/mammal/animated-horses-v2","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":185,"name":".mat","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"mammal","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Mammal","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/48618/a393924e0a/animated-horses-v5-3d-model-a393924e0a.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4344177","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4344177,"title":"Riyadh King Abdullah Financial District","price":980.0,"description":"\n\nThis is Riyadh's 3dmax model.\n\nMade in 2014max  \n\nShow textures only in 3dmax\n Format:\n 3dmax\n FBX\n OBJ\n Blender\n Rhino\n\nUnit: cm\n\nRenderer: Corona","imageAlt":"3D model Riyadh King Abdullah Financial District","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/skyscraper/riyadh-225db2c8-574e-44fe-b0c6-30ab42bdfd15","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/c7ln6rbtg1ht0bnfjqn2vucwaosl/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/11.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/c7ln6rbtg1ht0bnfjqn2vucwaosl/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/11.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/skyscraper/riyadh-225db2c8-574e-44fe-b0c6-30ab42bdfd15","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":13,"name":".3dm","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"skyscraper","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Skyscraper","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4344177/d073dbaf3f/riyadh-king-abdullah-financial-district-3d-model-d073dbaf3f.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6621470","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6621470,"title":"Minerva - Spaceship with Interior","price":199.99,"description":"Free Playable Demos: https://mega.nz/folder/xtFkGC5L#CLFPu_9PDMj70oZVQcFPyQ\n\n**1.2 Update for Unity version:**\n- URP support\n- Includes \"Hyperspace Effects\" Package for free (with ship demo integration)\n(To see new hyperspace effects see the above download link and download Minerva and HyperspaceEffects demos!)\n\n**Package includes:**\n- All the models and textures so you can import this asset into any 3d software (Plus a short text guide to help you assemble it and set up the materials)\n- Unity package with the interactive scene from the video including all the assets (models, textures, materials, sfx, scripts)\n- Unreal project\n\nA large spaceship complete with fully detailed interior and included playable demo scene in which you can explore and pilot the Minerva Corvette (just sit center seat on the bridge). This versatile package is suitable for a wide variety of Sci-Fi games/experiences. It can be your hero ship with which you explore the galaxy, set dressing for a sci-fi level in which you do gameplay activities in the landed/derelict ship interior. Or use the ship as your backdrop for your animated story. The various interior rooms together with the customizability of materials and atmosphere offer countless gameplay opportunities.\n\nThe ship has 10 rooms across 2 decks, as follows:\n- Bridge [1 to 5 seats (customizable) and a holo-table]\n- Captain's Quarters\n- Crew Quarters [7 bunks]\n- Main Deck Lounge \u0026 Corridor (combination of meeting room, kitchen and lounge)\n- Engineering Room\n- Medbay\n- Bathroom\n- Storage Room\n- Cargo Hold\n- Airlock that also serves as the cargo ramp.\n\nSuper optimized texturing: This asset uses the trimsheet texturing approach, which means a single PBR texture set (5 textures) is used to texture almost everything.\nThis optimizes build size, memory allocation, draw calls, and allows for added customization by mixing and matching the various color variants of the main material in the different rooms / hull of the ship.\n\n**MATERIALS:** The majority of surfaces are textured using a single texture set. (a collection of opaque/transparent materials that reference the same base textures). This is to reduce package size and number of textures. A .PSD file is also included with which you can change the color scheme of the interior/exterior (Color changes can be applied everywhere or on a room-by-room basis. Or even on a panel by panel basis where mesh sub-ojects are separated and permit for separate material assignment)\n\n**Triangle count:**\nEntire scene, interior + exterior: 819.692 tris\nExterior only: 179.034 tris","imageAlt":"3D asset Minerva - Spaceship with Interior","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/space/spaceship/minerva-spaceship-with-interior","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/0fcapr1cnicag9wp8yafx1y2lvyz/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CGTrader_Thumb.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/0fcapr1cnicag9wp8yafx1y2lvyz/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CGTrader_Thumb.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/space/spaceship/minerva-spaceship-with-interior","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":217,"name":".psd","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":222,"name":".mp4","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"space","subcategorySlug":"spaceship","categoryTitle":"Space","subcategoryTitle":"Spaceship","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6621470/9b931308e6/minerva-spaceship-with-interior-3d-model-9b931308e6.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4559180","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4559180,"title":"Apple 2023 M2 MacBook Pro - 14 and 16 Inch - 2023 - HQ 3D Model","price":15.99,"description":"**Apple M2 MacBook Pro - 14 Inch \u0026 16 Inch - Silver \u0026 Space Grey - 2023**\n\nThis Model is intended as a high quality resource for photo realistic vizualisation.\nIncluding the 14 Inch and 16 Inch version, as well as the 'Silver' and 'Space Grey' colorway.\n\n1:1 Scale, base model created in Rhino (included)\n\nComes fully textured and ready to render for:\n\n**- Cinema 4D 2023 + Redshift**\nNative high quality Redshift materials, custom textures and a basic stage.\n\n**- Blender 3.2.0**\nNative high quality materials, custom textures and a basic stage. Mainly created for use with Cycles.\n\nFurther formats that come with mesh/ surfaces only:\n\n\n- **FBX**\n- **OBJ** \n- **STP (NURBS)**\n- **RHINO 6 (NURBS)**\n\n\nMore info:\n- C4D and BLEND files allow easy modification of all materials\n- Properly sorted and grouped\n- Unit: mm\n\nEnjoy!","imageAlt":"Apple 2023 M2 MacBook Pro - 14 and 16 Inch - 2023 - HQ 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/computer/apple-2023-m2-macbook-pro-14-and-16-inch-2023-hq-3d-model","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/Bu5qCDbB5cr1sWS5JDfav3B2/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/APPLE_2023%20M2%20MacBook%20Pro_Hero%2002.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/Bu5qCDbB5cr1sWS5JDfav3B2/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/APPLE_2023%20M2%20MacBook%20Pro_Hero%2002.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/computer/apple-2023-m2-macbook-pro-14-and-16-inch-2023-hq-3d-model","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":72,"name":".stp","is_native":false},{"id":13,"name":".3dm","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"electronics","subcategorySlug":"computer","categoryTitle":"Electronics","subcategoryTitle":"Computer","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4559180/2bbafefe20/apple-2023-m2-macbook-pro-14-and-16-inch-2023-hq-3d-model-3d-model-2bbafefe20.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5499548","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5499548,"title":"Dragon ","price":79.0,"description":"**Vyrethorn Dragon | Rigged \u0026 Animated 3D Model**\n- Formats: Blender Project file (with fully rigged armature \u0026 animations), Substance Painter (v7.1.1), Zbrush (v2023), animated FBX.\n- Software requirement: Blender (version 4.2 - higher version).\n- Render engine: Cycles \u0026 EEVEE\n- Polycount: 60627 polygons\n- Textures: 07 UDIM - 4096 resolution (BaseColor, Ambient Occlusion, Roughness, Normal Map, Displacement Map, Subsurface Scattering)\n- Model size: 26.7m x 31.3m x 8.97m\n- Addons requirement: No\n- Animations list:  Idling, Crawling, Crawling Left, Crawling Right, Roar, Breathing Fire, Hit React, Take off, Landing, Flying, Flying Left, Flying Right, Gliding, Hovering.\n- Concept designed by me - HuyKhoi2407.\n- If you encounter any problems or errors with this product, please contact me, I am always happy to assist you. Sometimes I can reply a little late due to time zone difference, so please forgive me, and sorry if my English is not good.\n\n- _NOTE: The fire effects shown in the preview images and demo video are not included in this product, as fire simulations are always created uniquely for each animation and scene. Additionally, VDB files are extremely large, making them impractical to package, difficult for most standard computer setups to handle, and exceeding the storage limits of the marketplace. Therefore, they are not provided with this product_","imageAlt":"3D model animated game-ready Dragon fantasy","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/dragon-d91e97ed-01ce-4b04-a793-767b480b2238","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ekdnikdmr4yzj3injrb8lrygc3by/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/vyrethorn%20dragon.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ekdnikdmr4yzj3injrb8lrygc3by/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/vyrethorn%20dragon.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/dragon-d91e97ed-01ce-4b04-a793-767b480b2238","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false},{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"dinosaur","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Dinosaur","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5499548/e93f31f1d6/dragon-3d-model-e93f31f1d6.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5356124","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5356124,"title":"Raspberries - 3 Variations","price":34.2,"description":"You will receive raspberries and leaves with 8k texture maps. It has organized non-overlapping uvs and a decent topology which supports further editing and a lot of detail. With the 3D model (formats: fbx, obj) there is a diffuse, roughness, sss, displacement, opacity and normal map.\n\n- Model Formats: OBJ / FBX\n- Model Details: Subdivision-ready / organized non-overlapping uv\n- Texture Maps: Diffuse / Roughness / Normal / Displacement / SSS/ Opacity\n- Texture Resolution: 8192x8192px\n\nThe lights, cameras, and background are not included in the product. The model is clean and centred at the origin with real-world scale.\n\n** You will also find separate redshift proxy (ver: 3.5.23) and  fbx files for the fine hairs to use as it is or to export as proxy.","imageAlt":"3D asset Raspberries - 3 Variations","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/raspberries-3-variations","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/XbbuaqU8B3eam5ksRsa16aRL/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/raspberry_preview_0001.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/XbbuaqU8B3eam5ksRsa16aRL/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/raspberry_preview_0001.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/raspberries-3-variations","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"food","subcategorySlug":"fruit","categoryTitle":"Food","subcategoryTitle":"Fruit","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5356124/083561f05d/raspberries-3-variations-3d-model-083561f05d.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6876654","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6876654,"title":"Astronaut Characters","price":169.0,"description":"**KEY HIGHLIGHTS**  \n\n90 prepared 3D characters of different genders and skin tones, 300+ clothing assets, customization tool, movement controller, animations, facial expressions, 100+ props, animals, vehicles, icons.           \n\n### **KEY FEATURES**  \n\n- **90 unique 3D characters:** 30 EVA Suit Characters and 60 Base Suit Characters. Each character has an individual index, making it easy to locate any model.       \n- **Character Customization** tool allows you to quickly and easily generate a character based on selected parameters.   \n- **300 Unique Clothing Assets.** All clothing items are separate 3D models, allowing you to freely replace, remove, or mix them (helmets, tops, bottoms, gloves, shoes, backpacks, etc.).    \n- **Movement Controller.** Start the game mode and use WASD to move the model.     \n- **Animations.** 50 basic and themed animations for characters - movement, interaction with other characters, use of interactive objects. Mixamo Support.     \n- **30 Facial Expressions** for use in facial animation.    \n- **80+ Props:** interactive tools (wrenches, PDAs, repair gear, leisure items) and environment assets (tables, chairs, barrels, crates, portable modules, drones, a vehicle, and a tent).     \n- **Companion Animals:** 9 animal models dressed in astronaut-themed costumes to match your crew. Each has basic animations.     \n- **2D Icons.** All demo characters and assets have icons.      \n- **Works on URP, HDRP, and Built-in (Unity)**. Separate files for versions 2021+ and 6000+.     \n- **Designed for performance:** optimized meshes, minimal textures and simple shaders – runs smoothly on mobile, VR/AR, PC and consoles.      \n- **Ready for any pipeline.** Source files available on request in native formats (.blend, .c4d, .ma, .max) and an Unreal Engine .uproject, plus universal exports (FBX, GLB, USDZ, OBJ, STL) for easy integration.     \n- **Free updates and technical support** available in our Discord Community.    \n\n### **FILES**       \nYou’ll be able to download formats such as Unity Package, UE, Blender, C4D, Maya, 3DSMax, FBX, OBJ, GLTF, and STL.      \n\n### **COMPATIBILITY**  \n\n- Blender 3.6+   \n- Unity 2021.3+    \n- Unity 6000+      \n- Unreal Engine 4.20+   \n- Unreal Engine 5.0+   \n- Godot Engine 3.4+   \n\n### **TECHNICAL INFO**  \n\nGeometry: 520 unique assets, 296K triangles (entire pack).    \nCharacter Polygons: ~6.8K    \nScale: Real-world size   \nMaterials: 7 total   \nTextures: 4 total   \nRig: Humanoid (Mixamo-compatible)   \nAnimations: Yes   \nCollision: Yes   \n\n### **SUPPORT**   \n\nFree updates and technical support: https://discord.com/invite/jxrQM8hXnd  \n\nWe would love to hear from you: support@ithappystudios.com    \nWe aim to respond within 24 hours.  \n\n*Leave a review to help us improve and expand this character pack further! Your projects are the reason we create 3D models. We genuinely care about how you use our work, and we'd love to hear your thoughts on the pack.*  \n\n---  \n\n### **FOLLOW US**  \n\nNew packs coming out, updates, promotions, tutorials:  \nDISCORD - https://discord.com/invite/jxrQM8hXnd  \nYOUTUBE - https://www.youtube.com/@ithappystudios","imageAlt":"Astronaut Characters 3D asset","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/astronaut-characters-ee107f80-5958-451c-81af-465f881b38d1","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1cx57mn2pjnav146bk94yqb61vks/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CGT%20Modular%20City%20Characters%20Preview.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1cx57mn2pjnav146bk94yqb61vks/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CGT%20Modular%20City%20Characters%20Preview.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/astronaut-characters-ee107f80-5958-451c-81af-465f881b38d1","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":true},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":228,"name":".json","is_native":false},{"id":119,"name":".py","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"cityscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Cityscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6876654/ab4c8cbca4/astronaut-characters-3d-model-ab4c8cbca4.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6731383","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6731383,"title":"Baseball Stadium","price":48.8,"description":"This is a high-quality 3D model of a modern baseball stadium, perfect for sports arena visualization, VR, and game development projects.\n\nThe scene features a typical baseball field, including seating areas, billboards, the field, and complete spectator stands. Suitable for architectural visualization, event venue presentations, and related application development.\n\n\nAll models and OBJ files were created using 3ds Max 2020 VR rendering.\nThank you for purchasing my model.","imageAlt":"Baseball Stadium 3D asset","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/stadium/baseball-stadium-a42e688c-f93e-4db9-84f6-75dc20bad9ca","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/4ydopj2hd6h8ac04hcm3i2fairg0/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/000_%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA_001.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/4ydopj2hd6h8ac04hcm3i2fairg0/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/000_%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA_001.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/stadium/baseball-stadium-a42e688c-f93e-4db9-84f6-75dc20bad9ca","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"stadium","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Stadium","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6731383/3877810417/baseball-stadium-3d-model-3877810417.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6503712","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6503712,"title":"Adidas Trionda Ball World Cup 2026 Low-poly 3D model","price":29.0,"description":"High-quality 3D model of the Adidas Trionda official match ball for the 2026 FIFA World Cup.\nIdeal for close-up renders, product visualization, and sports-related scenes.\nThe model is highly detailed, and I used Substance software to create high-resolution 8K textures.\n\n**Features:**\n\n- Clean topology and UVs\n- PBR-ready materials\n- 8K textures for 3ds Max (Diffuse, Glossiness, IOR, Normal, Reflection)\n- 8K textures for Blender (AO, BaseColor, Metallic, Normal, Roughness)\n- Available formats: MAX (Corona / V-Ray)_Blender_OBJ_FBX_3DS\n- Polygon count: 7,056\n- Ready for animation and rendering\n- Units: Centimeters\n- Dimension: 21.81 x 21.77 x 21.8","imageAlt":"Adidas Trionda Ball World Cup 2026 Low-poly 3D low-poly","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/sports/equipment/adidas-trionda-ball-world-cup-2026-low-poly-3d-model","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/mseuk4v4yo5o7iu4b1u69wr174hv/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Preview_01.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/mseuk4v4yo5o7iu4b1u69wr174hv/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Preview_01.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/sports/equipment/adidas-trionda-ball-world-cup-2026-low-poly-3d-model","isCg