22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/anient%20egypt%20jpg.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/SSxoMRpBFwbhet9XPVnh3uhz/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/anient%20egypt%20jpg.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/greatest-ancient-egypt-desert-arab-city-aaa-builder-collection","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"historic-exterior","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Historic","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4630446/58e933606e/greatest-ancient-egypt-desert-arab-city-aaa-builder-collection-3d-model-58e933606e.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6963090","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6963090,"title":"Nu Stadium - Inter Miami - USA","price":379.0,"description":"Important: Before buying the 3D model, be well informed of the Product License. Once purchased Genius\u0026Gerry is not responsible. (!) Images with copyright, personal and commercial use prohibited.\n\nNu Stadium is a soccer-specific stadium in Miami, Florida. Opened in April 2026, the 26,700-seat stadium is the home field of Inter Miami CF of Major League Soccer (MLS), replacing the interim Chase Stadium in Fort Lauderdale. Nu Stadium hosted its inaugural match on April 4, 2026, against Austin FC, with the match ending in a draw of 2–2 and Guilherme Biro scoring the first goal in stadium history, Lionel Messi scoring the second. 26,412 fans were in attendance.\n\nStarter model.Approximate dimensions. Bleachers and seats in 2D texture. Render setup not included.\n\nFormats: .3ds | .skp | .obj | .dwg | .dxf | .dae | .fbx | .wrl\n\nThis 3D model is not a commercially exploitable model in any digital platform, so called Metaverse and NFT's. It is the buyer's responsibility not to infringe illegalities with our models. You can get more information by contacting us.","imageAlt":"3D model Nu Stadium - Inter Miami - USA","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/stadium/nu-inter-miami-usa-3d-model","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ec8ktngx0fzg0j04z320ttsdpq6y/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/%C2%A9Nu_Stadium_Inter_Miami_USA_nfl_3d_geniusandgerry_2.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ec8ktngx0fzg0j04z320ttsdpq6y/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/%C2%A9Nu_Stadium_Inter_Miami_USA_nfl_3d_geniusandgerry_2.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/stadium/nu-inter-miami-usa-3d-model","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":14,"name":".skp","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":188,"name":".wrl","is_native":false},{"id":4,"name":".dwg","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":2,"name":".3ds","is_native":false},{"id":25,"name":".dae","is_native":false},{"id":7,"name":".dxf","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"stadium","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Stadium","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6963090/272ddeae9d/nu-stadium-inter-miami-usa-3d-model-272ddeae9d.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6852581","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6852581,"title":"F1 2026 Car - RK26 Ver 1","price":49.99,"description":"F1 2026 Car - RK26 Ver 1\n\nHigh-detail 2026 Formula 1 car concept built strictly according to the official FIA 2026 regulations, based on aerodynamic and engineering references.\n\nImportant:\n\nCannot be used for mods, games, or redistribution.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Detailed exterior\n- Clean topology\n- UDIM tiles on key visible sections for high-quality textures(main body)\n- Ideal for visualization, rendering, or studio projects\n\nTextures:\n\nPNG","imageAlt":"3D F1 2026 Car - RK26 Ver 1","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/racing-car/f1-2026-concept-car-rk26-ver-1-b2885c81-e9c8-46f4-b8f5-fba29265b198","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/9rkoy246zfniokmu79ffc9bt7rnx/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/0001-2.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/9rkoy246zfniokmu79ffc9bt7rnx/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/0001-2.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/racing-car/f1-2026-concept-car-rk26-ver-1-b2885c81-e9c8-46f4-b8f5-fba29265b198","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"car","subcategorySlug":"racing-car","categoryTitle":"Car","subcategoryTitle":"Racing","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6852581/0306180011/f1-2026-car-rk26-ver-1-3d-model-0306180011.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4793468","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4793468,"title":"Prehistoric Animal Dinosaur","price":129.0,"description":"**Collection models list**\n1. Tyrannosaurus Rex\n2. Triceratops\n3. Spinosaurus\n4. Dilophosaurus\n5. Brachiosaurus\n6. Mosasaurus\n7. Zarafasaura\n8. Dimetrodon\n9. Quetzalcoetlus\n10. Dunkleosteus\n11. Stegosaurus\n12. Hallucigenia\n13. Tullimonstrum\n\n- File formats: blend, fbx, obj, spp, ztl, zpr.\n- 1 UDIM texture maps, resolution: 4096x4096px (Substance Painter file attached for edit and export other resolutions).\n- Already has basic rigged and has animations like the preview video (.fbx and .blend files).\n- The rigged amature need Wiggle Bone add-ons for wiggle effect of some bones (You can download it free here: https://blender-addons.org/wiggle-bones-addon/ and it would be great if you donate to them) You need to install the add-on before open the animated Blender file.\n- Suitable for both realtime and raytracing render.\n- Preview videos and images rendered by Blender Eevee realtime render engine and Blender Cycle raytracing render engine.\n- Detailed information can be found in the site of each product.\n- If my product not as good as you expected, please send me a message for feedback so I can give you a warranty and improve the quality of the store.","imageAlt":"3D model animated Prehistoric Animal Dinosaur","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/prehistoric-animal-dinosaur","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/u1psW9xB7G3jVDkarg85jJAD/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/prehistoric-animal-dinosaur-3d-model-4c6ef543db.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/u1psW9xB7G3jVDkarg85jJAD/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/prehistoric-animal-dinosaur-3d-model-4c6ef543db.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/prehistoric-animal-dinosaur","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"dinosaur","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Dinosaur","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4793468/4c6ef543db/prehistoric-animal-dinosaur-3d-model-4c6ef543db.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6745672","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6745672,"title":"Mercedes Sprinter Detailed interior Standard High Roof 2023","price":49.0,"description":"Mercedes Sprinter Detailed interior Standard High Roof 2023\n\nMercedes-Benz Sprinter of the third generation (2018-…).  W907. All-metal van.\n\nThe 3D model matches the dimensions of the actual vans but is not an accurate CAD engineering model. This should be taken into account if you work in industrial design. \n\nMercedes-Benz Sprinter Standard  High Roof 3500kg RWD. L2H2.\n\nDimensions: 5932 mm (length) x 2613 mm (height) x 2345 mm \n\nWheelbase: 3665 mm\nPolys: 421328 Verts: 449220\n\nModel features:\n\nDetailed exterior. Detailed interior. Detailed cargo area.\n\nEach object has a material name, you can easily change or apply materials.\n\nIt is easy to separate sub-objects from the object into separate elements.\n\nAll objects are georeferenced to a point with zero coordinates.\n\nIn the model are applied simple Materials that do not require textures.\n\nThe preview is obtained using the Corona renderer and with these materials.\n\nUse files with extension (.FBX) to import this model into other graphic editors, if they support importing (.FBX) files.\n\n\nFormats:\n\n1) max (2021 + Corona 12),\n\n2) fbx (2016 Corona),\n\n3) obj,\n\n4) blend 3.6 (materials require customization)\n\nRender: Corona\n\nHappy renders! See other models on my profile.\n\n","imageAlt":"3D model Mercedes Sprinter Detailed interior Standard 2","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/mercedes-sprinter-detailed-interior-standard-high-roof-2023","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/6lqjgmwd1syst44i6m28h3takm97/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/00.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/6lqjgmwd1syst44i6m28h3takm97/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/00.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/mercedes-sprinter-detailed-interior-standard-high-roof-2023","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"vehicle","subcategorySlug":"truck","categoryTitle":"Vehicle","subcategoryTitle":"Truck","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6745672/ac3841da10/mercedes-sprinter-detailed-interior-standard-high-roof-2023-3d-model-ac3841da10.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"1904772","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":1904772,"title":"SPACESUIT Silver Mercury Navy Mark IV","price":40.0,"description":"3D Mercury Navy Mark IV ( 4 )  modeled in high precision.   \nWorn by the famous mercury seven, the first Seven astronauts.\nthis is a mix between several references i found. this model has been accurately recreated in 3d High poly to keep every details.\n\n\nThe Quality you need :  \nFirst of all, this model was based on a several pictures and close up of the real product to provide you the best quality in terms of texture references and proportions.\n\nThe entire model was textured with its accessories relying on references and actual products.\nTextures may need to be relocate after uncompressing the Texture file. \n\nincluded :\n\n- High poly Model.\n- 4K Textures.\n- 3ds MAX, V-ray ( Textured )\n- 3ds MAX, Corona ( Textured )\n- Blender, Cycles ( Textured )\n- FBX ( Mesh Only )\n- OBJ ( Mesh Only )\n- ABC ( Mesh Only ) \n\nReselling Any parts, modified parts, baked Geometry or texture, or any ressources or modified ressources from this model in any form is not allowed. \n5 3d Print per license ( One buy = One License )\n\nFor Blender Unpacked Textures files.\nOnce the textures zip file is uncompressed, Open the Blend file and go to File \u003e External data \u003e find missing files \u003e and select the texture folder. Blender will reload automatically all textures.","imageAlt":"3D model SPACESUIT Silver Mercury Navy Mark IV","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/mercury-navy-mark-iv-space-suit","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/7yh1SYXLuSyaMQnfb9Pgimu1/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Thumbnail.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/7yh1SYXLuSyaMQnfb9Pgimu1/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Thumbnail.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/mercury-navy-mark-iv-space-suit","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"sci-fi-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Sci-Fi","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/1904772/e58007f657/spacesuit-silver-mercury-navy-mark-iv-3d-model-e58007f657.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3348427","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3348427,"title":"Orange ACES Spacesuit Rigged","price":60.0,"description":"3D Advanced crew escape suit inspired astronaut spacesuits modeled in high precision.   \nInspired by various space shuttle and orbiter programs.\nThis is a mix between several references i found. this model has been accurately recreated in 3d High poly to keep every details.\n\nThis model is Rigged and Skinned as shown on the product preview pictures and video. \n( no animation included, the video shows the Rig with a mixamo motion capture sequence )\n**UDIM **UVs industry standard workflow.\n\n**The Quality you need :** \nFirst of all, this model was based on a several pictures and close up products to provide you the best quality in terms of texture and proportions.\n\nThe entire model was textured with its accessories relying on references, concepts and designs.\n\nTextures may need to be relocate after uncompressing the Texture file into your production folder.\nIf you are using another software, you'll need to recreate a PBR metallic roughness based shader and connect the UDIM textures into it.\n\n**4K Textures**. (PBR Metallic Roughness, UDIM uvs ) compressed in the ZIP file\nNo mission patch.\n\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED Rigify, Texture Packed\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED Mocap, Texture Packed\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, UNREAL 4 Mannequin RIGGED\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, UNREAL 5 Mannequin RIGGED\n- ABC, UDIM Uvs\n- OBJ, UDIM Uvs\n- FBX, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED Mocap\n- FBX, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED UNREAL 4 Mannequin \n- FBX, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED UNREAL 5 Mannequin \n\n\nReselling Any parts, modified parts, baked Geometry or texture, or any ressources or modified ressources from this model in any form is not allowed. \n5 3d Print per license ( One buy = One License )\n\nFor Blender Unpacked Textures files.\nOnce the textures.zip file is uncompressed, Open the Blend file and go to File \u003e External data \u003e find missing files \u003e and select the texture folder. Blender will reload automatically all textures.","imageAlt":"3D model VR / AR ready Orange ACES Spacesuit Rigged","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/nasa-aces-spacesuit-rigged","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/rYuCY6EEDWXJ4YRmjJ7RYVEJ/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/ACES_Spacesuit_Render_rigged.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/rYuCY6EEDWXJ4YRmjJ7RYVEJ/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/ACES_Spacesuit_Render_rigged.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/nasa-aces-spacesuit-rigged","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"sci-fi-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Sci-Fi","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3348427/4e39109ec6/orange-aces-spacesuit-rigged-3d-model-4e39109ec6.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5824606","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5824606,"title":"A set of equipment for a photo studio","price":35.0,"description":"A detailed set of equipment for a photo studio.\n\nFour monoblocks and softboxes manufactured by ProFoto.\nA photo zone produced by ProFoto.\nBallu floor fan BV175710 fan.\nTunnel Fan on a tripod Rekam TWT-500.\nThe Falcon Eyes LHP-328Q illuminator.\nThe Andoer EX60III flash.\nThe Godox S30 illuminator.\nSony Cyber-shot DSC-RX10M4 camera.\nFalcon Eyes racks.\n\nThe models are designed for smoothing.\nSoftbox lights turn off in Corona Light MTL","imageAlt":"3D model bracket A set of equipment for a photo studio","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/various/various-models/a-set-of-equipment-for-a-photo-studio","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/TtVbysVw3Zw8hftPkXLR8xow/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/%D0%BF%D1%80%D1%80.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/TtVbysVw3Zw8hftPkXLR8xow/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/%D0%BF%D1%80%D1%80.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/various/various-models/a-set-of-equipment-for-a-photo-studio","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"various","subcategorySlug":"various-models","categoryTitle":"Various","subcategoryTitle":"Various models","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5824606/da172383b8/a-set-of-equipment-for-a-photo-studio-3d-model-da172383b8.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2787225","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2787225,"title":"THE MEGA COLLECTION  SCIFI KITBASH CITYSCAPE","price":55.0,"description":"This collection contains all of the **MEGA** models released to date.\n\nOur royalty free models can be duplicated endlessly to create massive, endless modern cityscapes\n\nThese 3D models can be mixed and matched with any other models in the **MEGA** series by **TENZERO** and will scale perfectly! The style and design fits perfectly with the **MEGA** series.","imageAlt":"3D THE MEGA COLLECTION SCIFI KITBASH CITYSCAPE","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/the-mega-collection-scifi-kitbash-cityscape","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wm14eHw6WtPnpNx8ruthV7Qm/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/the-mega-collection-scifi-kitbash-cityscape-3d-model-max-obj-fbx.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wm14eHw6WtPnpNx8ruthV7Qm/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/the-mega-collection-scifi-kitbash-cityscape-3d-model-max-obj-fbx.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/the-mega-collection-scifi-kitbash-cityscape","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"cityscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Cityscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2787225/aa1b4aa5da/the-mega-collection-scifi-kitbash-cityscape-3d-model-aa1b4aa5da.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6622474","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6622474,"title":"V-ARM 01 Realistic Muscular Male Hands","price":34.99,"description":"# V-ARM 01 - Realistic Male Hands \u0026 Arms for Blender\n\nRealistic male hands and arms 3D model for Blender, built for close-up renders where believable hands matter. V-ARM 01 combines photoreal skin detail, muscular definition, 8K PBR textures, UDIM UVs, and a full AXIS Rig (Rigify-based) for cinematic shots, product visualization, and jewelry close-ups.\n\n---\n\nBlender-native and ready to pose, the model includes quad-only topology, UDIM UVs, and a subdivision-ready mesh previewed up to Level 3. PBR textures up to 8K EXR cover displacement, normal, base color, roughness, and subsurface scatter. The included AXIS Rig adds IK/FK switching and driver-driven deformation, with FBX, GLB, USDZ, and multi-LOD OBJ exports for broader pipeline support.\n\n## Geometry\n\n- Base mesh: **9,002 vertices / 17,952 triangles** (subdivision not applied)\n- Quad-only topology, subdivision-ready, previewed at Subdivision Level 3\n- UDIM UV layout\n\n## Textures (PBR)\n\n- **8K 32-bit EXR**: Displacement map, Normal map\n- **4K**: Base Color, Roughness\n- **2K**: Subsurface / Scatter\n- All textures packed into the .blend file\n\n## AXIS Rig (Rigify-based)\n\n- IK/FK switching per limb, bone layers panel, driver-driven muscle and joint deformation\n- Built on Rigify - no extra addons required beyond what ships with Blender\n- Pose-ready for character animation, product visualization, and cinematic renders\n- Compatible with the AXIS Core addon for retargeting animation from Mixamo, ActorCore, Unreal, HumanIK, and DAZ (sold separately - https://superhivemarket.com/products/axis-core-addon-for-blender)\n\n## AXIS Panel (free with every AXIS model)\n\n- IK/FK switching and snap (transfer poses between IK and FK without visual displacement)\n- Pose tools: reset, copy, paste, mirror, bilateral flip\n- Viewport simplify toggle with subdivision and particle density controls\n- Rig selector for multi-character scenes\n- Bone group visibility toggles, auto-update checker\n\n## Hair\n\n- Particle Hair with Children (.blend only)\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Blender 4.0 or higher\n- Rigify (included with Blender)\n\n---\n\n## Files Included\n\n- `.blend` - Blender-native, self-contained, all PBR textures packed, preview HDRI included\n- `FBX / GLB / USDZ` - deform bones rig, Base Color, Roughness, Normal map embedded\n- `OBJ pack` - right arm, 4 LOD levels (LOD0-LOD3), mesh and UVs only\n- `Backup_Files.zip` - raw texture files + AXIS_Panel.py addon backup\n\n**Note:** The `.blend` file includes the full AXIS Rig (Rigify-based) with IK/FK controls, bone layers panel, driver-driven deformation, and Particle Hair. FBX, GLB, and USDZ exports include deform bones and shapekeys only - no IK/FK controls, no panel, no drivers, and no hair. These are Blender-native features.\n\nPart of the **VERSA** series. Browse the full series on my profile.\n\nDocumentation: https://www.axisproject.co/documentation","imageAlt":"3D asset V-ARM 01 Realistic Muscular Male Hands","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/human-anatomy/hyper-realistic-muscular-arms","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/uhrrxxkf6ffdgmsmjie36br9stow/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CGTrader.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/uhrrxxkf6ffdgmsmjie36br9stow/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CGTrader.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/human-anatomy/hyper-realistic-muscular-arms","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":127,"name":".usdz","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":119,"name":".py","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"human-anatomy","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Anatomy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6622474/ed8743075e/v-arm-01-realistic-muscular-male-hands-3d-model-ed8743075e.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3663758","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3663758,"title":"Xfrog World","price":599.0,"description":"**Xfrog World includes 650+ species from below libraries:**\n\nEach species contains up to 6 high-res variations (differnt ages and seasons) in 16 popular 3D formats \n\n\u003e - AFRICAN TREES\n- AGRICULTURE\n- AMERICAS TREES\n- ASIAN TREES\n- BONSAI\n- CACTI \u0026 SUCCULENTS\n- EUROPEAN TREES\n- FLOWERS\n- GRASS \u0026 GROUNDCOVER\n- HOME GARDEN\n- HOUSEPLANTS\n- LANDSCAPING\n- OCEANIA TREES\n- PREHISTORIC\n- RED SEA\n- SHRUBS \u0026 VINE\n\n\n**Xfrog World - What's New?**\n\nOur plants are now better quality than ever, featuring High Resolution Geometry, Season and age variants, and textures of the utmost quality. These High Resolution PBR Textures have highly advanced shaders, individually created for and approved by the manufacturer of every renderer format (not translated, they are actually handcrafted shader networks specific to each renderer.) This means 2021 Shaders are all inspected and approved by each 3D Software manufacturer. Textures are included in an attached zip and formats included are: **.3DS**, 3DS MAX ARNOLD, 3DS MAX FOREST PACK, 3DS MAX FSTORM, 3DS MAX CORONA, 3DS MAX OCTANE, 3DS MAX REDSHIFT, 3DS MAX STANDARD SHADER, 3DS MAX VRAY, ALEMBIC, BLENDER, CINEMA 4D, CLARISSE, **.FBX**, LIGHTWAVE, MAYA REDSHIFT, MAYA STANDARD SHADER, MAYA VRAY, MODO, **.OBJ**, RHINO MAXWELL, TERRAGEN, SKETCHUP THEA, VUE\n\nSome plants with * asterisk are created by the very experienced modeler _Konstantin Kim_ and sold exclusively by Xfrog. _Kim (aka 3d Mentor)_ works in 3ds max GrowFX, and sets up shaders for Corona, VRay, and FStorm. ALL plants, for the first time EVER, have GrowFX (gfx) files included, and WIND, and all models and wind can be procedurally edited! Polycounts range from 100k to 600k.\n\n\n**The complete species list as below:**\n\n\u003e- AFRICAN TREES\n\u003e\n1. Acacia tortilis - Umbrella Acacia\n2. Acokanthera venenata / oppositifolia - Arrow Poison\n3. Adansonia digitata - Baobob\n4. Bismarckia nobilis - Bismarck Palm*\n5. Carissa edulis - Egyptian Carissa\n6. Cedrus Atlantica - Atlas Cedar\n7. Cedrus libani - Lebanon Cedar\n8. Dalbergia tonkinensis - Sua*\n9. Dombeya kirkii - River Wild Pear\n10. Dovyalis caffra / Aberia caffra - Kei Apple\n11. Dracaena draco - Dragon Tree\n12. Encephalartos altensteinii - Bushmans River Cycad\n13. Ficus carica - Fig Tree\n14. Fraxinus ornus - Manna Ash\n15. Hyphaene thebaica - African Doum Palm\n16. Juniperus chinensis - Chinese Juniper*\n17. Juniperus oxycedrys ssp macrocarpa - Prickly Juniper\n18. Khaya ivorensis - African Mahogany\n19. Kiggelaria africana - Wild peach\n20. Laurus nobilis - Laurel\n21. Myrsine africana - African Boxwood\n22. Myrtus communis - Myrtle\n23. Neodypsis decaryi - Triangle Palm\n24. Nerium oleander - Oleander\n25. Pachypodium geayi - Large Bottle Tree\n26. Phoenix reclinata - Senegal Date Palm\n27. Pinus halepensis - Aleppo Pine\n28. Pinus pinaster - Sea Pine\n29. Pinus pinea - Italian Stone Pine\n30. Pistacia lentiscus - Lentisk\n31. Podocarpus falcatus - Yellowwood\n32. Populus pyramidalis - poplar*\n33. Quercus cerris - Turkey Oak\n34. Quercus Ilex - Holm Oak\n35. Quercus suber - Cork Oak\n36. Salix Vitellina - Golden willow*\n37. Sorbus aucuparia - European Mountain Ash\n38. Strelitzia nicolai - White (Giant) Bird Of Paradise\n39. Tamarindus indica - Tamarind\n40. Tamarix gallica - French Tamarisk\n41. Taxus baccata - English Yew\n42. Ulmus minor - Smooth-leaved Elm\n43. Ulmus minor - Smooth-leaved Elm, European Field Elm*\n44. Vachellia tortilis - Umbrella Thorn Tree, Israeli Babool*\n\n\u003e- AGRICULTURE\n\u003e\n1. Camellia