ryTitle":"Architectural","subcategoryTitle":"Decoration","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4521004/90718a029c/ornament-brushes-alpha-and-3d-model-vol-01-02-03-04-05-3d-model-90718a029c.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6761789","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6761789,"title":"Apple iPhone 17 Pro 2025 - 3 Colors - HQ 3D Model","price":17.99,"description":"**Apple iPhone 17 Pro - 3 Colors - 2025**\n\nThis Model is intended as a high quality resource for photo realistic vizualisation.\nIncluding all 3 current colorways: Cosmic Orange, Deep Blue and Silver.\n\n1:1 Scale, base model created in Rhino (included)\n\nComes fully textured and ready to render for:\n\n**- Cinema 4D 2026 + Redshift**\nNative high quality Redshift materials, custom textures and a basic stage.\n\n**- Blender 5.0.1**\nNative high quality materials, custom textures and a basic stage. Mainly created for use with Cycles.\n\nFurther formats that come without textures:\n\n\n- **FBX**\n- **OBJ** \n- **STP (NURBS)**\n- **RHINO 6 (NURBS)**\n\n\nMore info:\n- C4D and BLEND files allow easy modification of all materials\n- Properly sorted and grouped\n- Unit: mm\n\nEnjoy!","imageAlt":"Apple iPhone 17 Pro 2025 - 3 Colors - HQ 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/phone/apple-iphone-17-pro-2025-3-colors-hq-3d-model","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/y4oint6uciiqvqgaj6a0il53bx8c/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/APPLE_iPhone%2017%20Pro_HERO%2001.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/y4oint6uciiqvqgaj6a0il53bx8c/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/APPLE_iPhone%2017%20Pro_HERO%2001.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/phone/apple-iphone-17-pro-2025-3-colors-hq-3d-model","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":72,"name":".stp","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":13,"name":".3dm","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"electronics","subcategorySlug":"phone","categoryTitle":"Electronics","subcategoryTitle":"Phone","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6761789/832dcef628/apple-iphone-17-pro-2025-3-colors-hq-3d-model-3d-model-832dcef628.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2337562","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2337562,"title":"Pilot man in racing suit on metal ball","price":89.0,"description":"Important! For Ior/gloss/normal use gamma 1\n\nIncluded :\n\n- 3dsMax 2013 Corona \u0026 V-ray files with CAT rig\n-  8K (suit, helmet) and 4K (gloves, shoes) Textures for 3dsMax \u0026 PBR (metal-roughness)\n- Substance painter files for all\n- FBX (mesh+skin)\n- OBJ (mesh)\n- ABC (mesh)","imageAlt":"3D Pilot man in racing suit on metal ball","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/pilot-bcc73f3f-a0c3-46bc-bc46-7f7967836a83","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/7waWJawQdwffuSUi5Vn1Ms1E/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/pilot_ren_CoronaCamera004.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/7waWJawQdwffuSUi5Vn1Ms1E/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/pilot_ren_CoronaCamera004.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/pilot-bcc73f3f-a0c3-46bc-bc46-7f7967836a83","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false},{"id":140,"name":".zpac","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"man","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Man","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2337562/bf96597d79/pilot-man-in-racing-suit-on-metal-ball-3d-model-bf96597d79.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"1865888","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":1865888,"title":"SPACESUIT Orange ACES","price":40.0,"description":"3D Advanced crew escape inspired astronaut spacesuits modeled in high precision.   \nInitially from the space shuttle nasa program ( atlantis, endeavor, dicovery, challenger, columbia, enterprise )\nthis is a mix between several references i found. this model has been accurately recreated in 3d High poly to keep every details.\n\nThe Quality you need :  \nFirst of all, this model was based on a several pictures and close up products to provide you the best quality in terms of texture and proportions.\n\nThe entire model was textured with its accessories relying on references, concepts and designs.\n\nTextures may need to be relocate after uncompressing the Texture file. \n\nincluded :\n\n- 4K Textures.\n- 3ds MAX, V-ray 2017 \u0026 2014 ( Textured )\n- 3ds MAX, Corona 2017 \u0026 2014 ( Textured )\n- 3ds MAX, Legacy Physical shader 2017 \u0026 2014 ( Textured )\n- Blender, Cycles 2.79 \u0026 2.8( Textured )\n- FBX ( Mesh Only )\n- OBJ ( Mesh Only )\n- ABC ( Mesh Only ) \n\nReselling Any parts, modified parts, baked Geometry or texture, or any ressources or modified ressources from this model in any form is not allowed. \n5 3d Print per license ( One buy = One License )\n\nFor Blender Unpacked Textures files. Once the textures zip file is uncompressed, Open the Blend file and go to File \u003e External data \u003e find missing files \u003e and select the texture folder. Blender will reload automatically all textures.","imageAlt":"pilot 3D SPACESUIT Orange ACES","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/aces-nasa-space-suit","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/Eyd4S8qsDeUMaKAdA9PjYdZw/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/RENDER_Thumbnail.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/Eyd4S8qsDeUMaKAdA9PjYdZw/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/RENDER_Thumbnail.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/aces-nasa-space-suit","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"sci-fi-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Sci-Fi","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/1865888/b3b76339eb/spacesuit-orange-aces-3d-model-b3b76339eb.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6592665","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6592665,"title":"Phoenix ","price":65.0,"description":"**PHOENIX DRAGON 3D MODEL**\n- Formats: Blender Project file (with fully rigged armature \u0026 animations), animated FBX.\n- Software requirement: Blender (version 4.2 - higher version).\n- Render engine: Cycles \u0026 EEVEE\n- Polycount: 205708 polygons (include Feather Alpha Cards.\n- Feather format: Alpha Cards, optimized for render speed, no particles system requirement.\n- Textures: 8 Materials, 2048 - 4096 resolution (Base Color, Ambient Occlusion, Roughness, Normal Map, Subsurface Scattering, Opacity)\n- Model size: 2.45m wingspan x 2m length x 0.5m height\n- Addons requirement: No\n- Animations list:  Idling, Take Off, Landing, Intimidate, Hit React, Flying, Flying Left, Flying Right, High Speed Flying, Gliding, Gliding Left, Gliding Right, Hovering.\n- Note: The render quality depends on each user’s render engine when used outside of Blender. In addition, when importing into other software, you may need to set up the materials again using the texture maps I provided, due to differences in material systems between softwares.\n- Concept: designed by me - HuyKhoi2407.\n- If you encounter any problems or errors with this product, please contact me, I am always happy to assist you. Sometimes I can reply a little late due to time zone difference, so please forgive me, and sorry if my English is not good.","imageAlt":"3D asset animated Phoenix","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/bird/phoenix-dragon","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/hzdwt9g1mde05kuwt7ki73pof4o3/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/phoenix%20thumbnail.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/hzdwt9g1mde05kuwt7ki73pof4o3/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/phoenix%20thumbnail.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/bird/phoenix-dragon","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"bird","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Bird","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6592665/5c012ce42b/phoenix-3d-model-5c012ce42b.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3785268","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3785268,"title":"Blueberries - 4 Variations","price":33.2,"description":"You will receive 4 photorealistic blueberreis with 8k texture maps. It has organized non-overlapping uv's and a decent topology which supports further editing and a lot of detail. With the 3D model (formats: fbx, obj) there is a diffuse, roughness, displacement and normal map.\n\n- Model Formats: OBJ / FBX\n- Model Details: Subdivision-ready / organized non-overlapping uv's\n- Texture Maps: Diffuse / Roughness / Normal / Displacement\n- Texture Resolution: 8192x8192px\n\nThe lights, cameras, and background are not included in the product. The model is clean and centred at the origin with real-world scale.","imageAlt":"3D Blueberries - 4 Variations","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/blueberries-4-variations","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/aWt5jnme5bYC4Ya1A9fgvXcv/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/blueberry_preview_00.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/aWt5jnme5bYC4Ya1A9fgvXcv/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/blueberry_preview_00.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/blueberries-4-variations","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"food","subcategorySlug":"fruit","categoryTitle":"Food","subcategoryTitle":"Fruit","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3785268/7403b0948c/blueberries-4-variations-3d-model-7403b0948c.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5155235","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5155235,"title":"Peach - Nectarine","price":33.2,"description":"You will receive nectarine models(1 x full, 2 x halves, 1 x quater) and a seed with 8k texture maps. It has organized non-overlapping uvs and a decent topology which supports further editing and a lot of detail. With the 3D model (formats: fbx, obj) there is a diffuse, roughness, sss, displacement, opacity and normal map.\n\n- Model Formats: OBJ / FBX\n- Model Details: Subdivision-ready / organized non-overlapping uvs\n- Texture Maps: Diffuse / Roughness / Normal / Displacement / SSS/ Opacity\n- Texture Resolution: 8192x8192px\n\nThe lights, cameras, and background are not included in the product. The model is clean and centred at the origin with real-world scale.","imageAlt":"3D model Peach - Nectarine","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/peach-nectarine","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/3hSgeF1bLJKEsYmhY4cfxPTo/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/nectarine_preview_0001.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/3hSgeF1bLJKEsYmhY4cfxPTo/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/nectarine_preview_0001.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/peach-nectarine","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"food","subcategorySlug":"fruit","categoryTitle":"Food","subcategoryTitle":"Fruit","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5155235/648294d456/peach-nectarine-3d-model-648294d456.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3161899","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3161899,"title":"Apollo 11 A7L Spacesuit Rigged","price":75.0,"description":"3D Apollo 11 A7L inpired astronaut spacesuit with Helmet, Torso Camera, Gloves and Boots modeled in high precision. this is a mix between several references i found. this model has been accurately recreated in 3d High poly to keep every details.\n\n**Including : **\n- Apollo Gloves\n- Apollo Helmet\n- Apollo Boots, Inner \u0026 Outer\n- Apollo Backpack\n- Accessories, hasselblad Camera, hoses.\n\nThis model is Rigged and Skinned as shown on the product preview pictures and video. ( no animation included, the video shows the Rig with a mixamo motion capture sequence ), Using **UDIM **UVs industry standard workflow.\n\nThe Quality you need : First of all, this model was based on a several pictures and close up of the real product to provide you the best quality in terms of texture references and proportions.\n\nThe entire model was textured with its accessories relying on references and actual products. Textures may need to be relocate after uncompressing the Texture file into your production folder. If you are using another software, you'll need to recreate a PBR metallic roughness based shader and connect the UDIM textures into it.\n\n**4K Textures**. (PBR Metallic Roughness, UDIM uvs ) compressed in the ZIP file\n\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED Rigify, Texture Packed\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED Mocap, Texture Packed\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, UNREAL 4 Mannequin RIGGED\n- Blender, UDIM Uvs, UNREAL 5 Mannequin RIGGED\n- ABC, UDIM Uvs\n- OBJ, UDIM Uvs\n- FBX, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED Mocap\n- FBX, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED UNREAL 4 Mannequin \n- FBX, UDIM Uvs, RIGGED UNREAL 5 Mannequin \n\n\nReselling Any parts, modified parts, baked Geometry or texture, or any ressources or modified ressources from this model in any form is not allowed. \n5 3d Print per license ( One buy = One License ) No mission patch in the textures.\n\nFor Blender Unpacked Textures files.\nOnce the textures.zip file is uncompressed, Open the Blend file and go to File \u003e External data \u003e find missing files \u003e and select the texture folder. Blender will reload automatically all textures.","imageAlt":"Apollo 11 A7L Spacesuit Rigged 3D model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/apollo-11-space-suit-rigged","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ptRH12ss6xpNnA4yyijabqLQ/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Apollo_SpaceSuit_Render_rigged.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ptRH12ss6xpNnA4yyijabqLQ/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Apollo_SpaceSuit_Render_rigged.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/apollo-11-space-suit-rigged","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"sci-fi-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Sci-Fi","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3161899/194f7735b0/apollo-11-a7l-spacesuit-rigged-3d-model-194f7735b0.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3310684","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3310684,"title":"AAA MODULAR SOLDIER PACK","price":169.99,"description":"UE4 version here: https://www.unrealengine.com/marketplace/en-US/product/modular-soldier-pack\nUNITY VERSION: https://u3d.as/2QLT\n**READ IT!!!**\n**differences cg trader and marketplace versions:**\n**Marketplace version is masthave if you using ue. **\nThere is showcase scene, smartmaterials, ready characters blueprints, correct physics assets, etc.\nCGtrader version: only .fbx, .blend, textures and. Psd with mask to change colors\n\nDescription:\nThe flexible and deep modularity of this pack helps you to create a big various squad of soldiers from different countries. There is a smart material system to help customize each soldier in a unique way by materials and flexible customization of meshes.\n\nThere are 19 ready color and camouflage preset textures, like real spec forces. So you can customize yourself, and easily pick up new camouflage patterns and colors by .psd files.\n\nThe character is divided into 7 sets: Face and arms, pants with boots, jacket, gloves, unloading (body armor, tactical belt, tactical groin, tactical shoulder pads), pouches(Pouches, drop pouches, radio, mags and etc) and a head gear (Helmet, glasses, nvg, cap, and other gear)\n\nHigh detail meshes and textures make this package ready for high-quality games and cinematics.\n\nVertex counts of characters: min ~20,000 verts, max ~65,000 verts (full gear)\nNumber of characters: 5 ready entire characters, 140 modular mesh pieces\n\n\n","imageAlt":"3D asset AAA MODULAR SOLDIER PACK","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/aaa-modular-soldier-pack","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/P8QX7K3DTJVKfeSNfEF2yvHR/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Main4.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/P8QX7K3DTJVKfeSNfEF2yvHR/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Main4.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/aaa-modular-soldier-pack","isCgtVerified":true,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":217,"name":".psd","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"man","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Man","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3310684/6b54965fc3/aaa-modular-soldier-pack-3d-model-6b54965fc3.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6316114","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6316114,"title":"Dragon","price":79.0,"description":"**Dreadthorn Dragon | Rigged \u0026 Animated 3D Model**\n\n- Formats: Blender Project file (with fully rigged armature \u0026 animations), Substance Painter (v7.1.1), Zbrush (v2023), animated FBX, OBJ\n- Software requirement: Blender (version 4.2 - higher version).\n- Render engine: Cycles \u0026 EEVEE\n- Polycount: 60828 polygons\n- Textures: 09 UDIM - 2048 resolution (BaseColor, Ambient Occlusion, Roughness, Normal Map, Displacement Map, Subsurface Scattering)  / (A high-resolution 4K texture set is included)\n- Model size: 35.3m x 22m x 4.97m\n- Addons requirement: No\n- Animations list: Idling, Crawling, Crawling Left, Crawling Right, Roar, Breathing Fire, Hit React, Take off, Landing, Flying, Flying Left, Flying Right, Gliding, Hovering.\n- Concept designed by me - HuyKhoi2407.\n- If you encounter any problems or errors with this product, please contact me, I am always happy to assist you. Sometimes I can reply a little late due to time zone difference, so please forgive me, and sorry if my English is not good.\n\n- _NOTE: The fire effects shown in the preview images and demo video are not included in this product, as fire simulations are always created uniquely for each animation and scene. Additionally, VDB files are extremely large, making them impractical to package, difficult for most standard computer setups to handle, and exceeding the storage limits of the marketplace. Therefore, they are not provided with this product_","imageAlt":"Dragon hydra 3D model animated low-poly","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/dragon-dc79f600-a6ed-4cf2-88e0-040056842c2a","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/igk9gimknsf617ofbsjyhu1e58qc/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/dragon%203d%20model.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/igk9gimknsf617ofbsjyhu1e58qc/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/dragon%203d%20model.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/dragon-dc79f600-a6ed-4cf2-88e0-040056842c2a","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false},{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","su