ects.\n\nWho Is This For?\n• Game developers\n• 3D artists and animators\n• AR/VR creators\n• Educators and students\n• Studios and indie teams\n• Anyone looking for a production-ready animal asset library\n\nStart Now","imageAlt":"ULTIMATE 3D ANIMAL PACK animated","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/mammal/ultimate-3d-animal-pack-70-percent-off-all-models-included","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/g96tbnurgou5w3d8hpvaaqnatail/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/%23ULTIMATE%203D%20ANIMAL%20PACK%20100%2B.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/g96tbnurgou5w3d8hpvaaqnatail/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/%23ULTIMATE%203D%20ANIMAL%20PACK%20100%2B.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/mammal/ultimate-3d-animal-pack-70-percent-off-all-models-included","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":201,"name":".fbm","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"mammal","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Mammal","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6381725/fc3c6f1e7e/ultimate-3d-animal-pack-3d-model-fc3c6f1e7e.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6674936","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6674936,"title":"Rocks bundle II","price":140.0,"description":"This pack include 9 of my others packages where you can find a ton of different rocks, cliffs and even small splinters in a differen styles for different biomes. All packages perfectly fit with any fantasy or fantastic environment. With this pack you can save 50% compared to buying packs separately. Totaly bundle keeps more then 390 different rocks and cliffs.","imageAlt":"3D model Rocks bundle II","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/various/various-models/rocks-bundle-ii","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cazu7uv4cz4o8n3z2r9ufrirn2hv/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/1920NEW_New.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cazu7uv4cz4o8n3z2r9ufrirn2hv/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/1920NEW_New.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/various/various-models/rocks-bundle-ii","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"various","subcategorySlug":"various-models","categoryTitle":"Various","subcategoryTitle":"Various models","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6674936/a66cf896e5/rocks-bundle-ii-3d-model-a66cf896e5.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6327075","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6327075,"title":"High-Quality Wyvern Dragons Pack","price":129.0,"description":"**High-Quality 3D Dragons Pack**\n- Number of models in this collection: 02 Dragons (More models may be updated in the future.)\n\n- To view detailed information and animations for each model, please click the link below:\n1. Dreadthorn Dragon: https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/dragon-dc79f600-a6ed-4cf2-88e0-040056842c2a\n2. Vyrethorn Dragon: https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/dragon-d91e97ed-01ce-4b04-a793-767b480b2238\n\n- Formats: Blender Project file (with fully rigged armature \u0026 animations), Substance Painter (v7.1.1), Zbrush (v2023), animated FBX, OBJ\n- Software requirement: Blender (version 4.2 - higher version).\n- Render engine: Cycles \u0026 EEVEE\n- Textures: Multiple-UDIM - 2048 resolution (BaseColor, Ambient Occlusion, Roughness, Normal Map, Displacement Map, Subsurface Scattering) / (A high-resolution 4K texture set is included)\n- Addons requirement: No\n- Animations list: Idling, Crawling, Crawling Left, Crawling Right, Roar, Breathing Fire, Hit React, Take off, Landing, Flying, Flying Left, Flying Right, Gliding, Hovering.\n- Concept designed by me - HuyKhoi2407.\n- If you encounter any problems or errors with this product, please contact me, I am always happy to assist you. Sometimes I can reply a little late due to time zone difference, so please forgive me, and sorry if my English is not good.\n\n","imageAlt":"High-Quality 3D Dragons animated realtime","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/high-quality-3d-dragons-fcacbfc7-7b22-42b0-8e7f-e6e0ccaab215","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/xj410mwrojlkywdr39y5l3gzbjjd/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/dragon%20hq%20collection.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/xj410mwrojlkywdr39y5l3gzbjjd/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/dragon%20hq%20collection.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/high-quality-3d-dragons-fcacbfc7-7b22-42b0-8e7f-e6e0ccaab215","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"dinosaur","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Dinosaur","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6327075/06a814d9b7/high-quality-3d-dragons-3d-model-06a814d9b7.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5389599","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5389599,"title":"Human Skeleton - Rigged","price":249.0,"description":"An artistically beautiful, detailed and accurate depiction of the very complex Human Skeletal System, which also includes Spine Ultimate - one of the best Spine model in the market which also includes all the important Spinal Ligaments.\n\nThis model is rigged and animation ready.\n\nFeatures:\n\n1.  The complex Skeletal System is organized in layers so you can easily hide or isolate major components. All major bones \u0026 ligaments correctly named in the scene.\n\n2. Detailed Spine correctly depicts the Cervical Vertebrae ( C1  C7 ), Thoracic Vertebrae ( T1 - T12 ),  Lumbar Vertebrae ( L1 - L5 ) and Intervertebral Discs.\n\n3. Detailed Spinal Ligament consisting of the Anterior Longitudinal Ligament, Posterior Longitudinal Ligament, Intertransverse Ligament, Facet Capsular Ligament, Interspinous Ligament, Supraspinous Ligament, Ligamentum Flavum and Nuchal Ligament.\n\n4. A transparent human model is included to give a sense of the skeleton's location, without cluttering the important details inside.\n\n5. All Spinal Ligaments are UV unwrapped \u0026 share a common 1024x1024 texture map. Materials are applied to the Skeleton and Human model. \n\n6. All the components and transparent Human Model are rigged ( using forward kinematics ) and ready for poses and animation.\n\n7. A sample animation is included inside the scene to demonstrate the possible poses and motions that can be achieved using the rig.\n\n8. A PDF document is included to explain how to correctly use the Model.\n\n9. Model contains mostly 4 sided polygons for efficiency and modeled to real world scale.\n\n10. Optimized and clean model topology that can be further subdivided  for high detailed rendering.*\n\n*The original model is smoothened using Subdivision, which renders exactly like the preview images, yet preserving the original low mesh density like the wireframe preview. User only needs to crank up the subdivision to get a high poly and detailed mesh for rendering, OR crank down the subdivision for a low poly mesh while animating. \n\n====================================================================================\n\nNo special plugins needed.\nJust load and animate!\n\nAll formats are tested in their respective 3D applications, re-worked if necessary to ensure compatibility.\n\nMotionCow is the publisher of high quality photorealistic 3D Models and we proudly stand behind all our products. Contact us if you need help with our models.\n\nMotionCow","imageAlt":"3D model Human Skeleton - Rigged","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/human-anatomy/human-skeleton-rigged-bfaa4f51-0006-44f8-9036-110cde219dbd","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/fUU1btgYvAUqP6BDzuC1JZxX/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/HD_Skeleton_Rigged.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/fUU1btgYvAUqP6BDzuC1JZxX/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/HD_Skeleton_Rigged.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/human-anatomy/human-skeleton-rigged-bfaa4f51-0006-44f8-9036-110cde219dbd","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":false,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"human-anatomy","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Anatomy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5389599/ff6fbc77ec/human-skeleton-rigged-3d-model-ff6fbc77ec.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6756672","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6756672,"title":"Business Lady Office Girls - Game Ready","price":149.99,"description":"\u003e **Business Lady**\n\n Game-ready girls characters with elegant fashion design. PBR textures, humanoid rig.\nSupports ARKit \u0026 Built-in/URP/HDRP. Seamless integration + compatibility. UE4 \u0026 UE5 projects.\n\n\n Easy to work with \n\nPerfect main / side character for your project\n\nCompatible with most assets in my store\n\n\n\u003e **Key Features**\n\n- 3 Hairstyles + 3 Bangs\n- Unique outfits\n- Removable clothes\n- Humanoid Rig (UE5)\n- Completely modular\n- A wonderful render scene\n- Apple ARKit Blendshapes\n- Adjustable body parts\n- Easy color change\n- Advanced materials! Tons of customization\n ࣪ \nIncluded: character, underwear, full-body, poses.\nNot included: customization systems, custom animations, locomotions, physics, bone simulation, LODs, environments from the video\n\n\n\u003e **Polycount** | The Character does not have LOD system\n\n\n- Business Lady 01\n- Faces 46476・ Tris 85997・ Verts 50320\n\n\n\n- Business Lady 02\n- Faces 36762・ Tris 72490・ Verts 41671\n\n\n\n- Business Lady 03\n- Faces 49593・ Tris 98244・ Verts 57834\n\n\n\n- Business Lady \n- Faces 51442・ Tris 102226・ Verts 59121\n\n\n\u003e **Rig** is based on the Epic Skeleton (UE5) with additional bones\n\n- The main bones hierarchy matches UE5 Quinn Mannequin.\n- It was made in Maya without plugins and does not have controls\n- You can apply physics with additional bones\n- The model is compatible with my previous UE5 releases.\n- I will update my previous UE4 releases to the UE5 skeleton over time.\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Tested with various animations**\n\n- Advanced Locomotion System v4\n- Standard 3rd person animations\n- Female Interactions Animations\n- Mocap Library\n- ARLS + Horse Animset\n- Succubus AnimSet\n- Valley of the Ancient\n- Close Combat: Swordsman\n- Lyra Starter Game\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Blendshapes**\n\n- Perfectly calibrated 52 Apple Blendshapes.\n- Tested with Live Link Face in Unreal Engine 5 and Face Capture in Unity.\n- Can be used for Live Stream facial animations\n- LiveLinkFace, FaceWare, Facial Mocap, VTuber Avatar, VRchat, MMD, etc.\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Different Outfits and Modularity**\n\n- The model is completely modular!\n- Remove or add any part. Or if you want, take clothes off completely\n- Body texture is censored. The uncensored texture is included\n- Adult parts are not modeled and do not have morphs or a rig. It’s a texture\n- To avoid body intersection through clothes, the body is sliced into pieces\n- Pieces that are beneath the clothes must be turned off or hidden\n- By doing that, you reduce the polycount!\n- Full-Body is included\n- Underwear is included\n- Bonus Idle animation is included\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Unreal Engine Project**\n\n\n- Supported version: 4.24+\n\n- Demo render scene with blueprint included!\n\n- Epic Skeleton rig with additional bones\n\n- For facial animations use Morph Targets\n\n- Advanced materials\n\n- Physics are not included. It’s advisable to use KawaiiPhysics plugin for the best-looking results.\n\n- Material Instances with MatID map for color change are included\n\n- 3rd person standard animations are included\n\n- Separated Meshes for Master Pose / Leader Component are included\n\n- Wind Simulation for Hair!\n\n\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\n\u003e **MatID Maps** ┆ Skin, Eyes, and Outfit Parts\n\n\n\n- A MatID map is used for changing colors of a BaseColor Map by sections\n- You can use the Advanced Shader to change the colors easily\n\n\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\n\u003e **4K Textures**\n\n\n- 7 Texture sets: Body, Head, Eyes, Lashes, Clothes, Hair, Cornea\n- Textures are packed for better optimization\n- Each set contains:\n- BaseColor, Normal, Roughness, Metallic, MetallicSmoothness, MaskMap, BloodMask, DirtMask,\n- Ambient Occlusion, and may include a MatID, Opacity and Emissive maps\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\n**FAQ**\n\n**Need help with the model, how to contact you?**\nFeel free to ask me any questions using the messaging system on CGTrader!\n\n\n\n**Can I create an NFT with your model or sell it as a VRchat avatar?**\nNo, it is prohibited to use my models for creating non-fungible tokens, or use in other blockchains. It is also prohibited to re-sell my models as a VRChat avatar, even if applying changes to them. It is also prohibited to sell images (.png, .jpg, .jpeg, etc.) of my models.\n\n\n\n**Can I use this model in Blender / Cinema4D / 3dsMax / etc.?**\nYes, you can. File formats such as .fbx can be imported anywhere. However, the rig and blendshapes are originally made in Maya and some software might not recognize them correctly. Unfortunately, I cannot give you support for this software because I do not have any experience with them. The only software that I support is Maya, Unreal Engine, and Unity.\n\nMy customers have reported to me that my models work in Blender.\n\n\n\n**Does the advanced material work without the Shader Graph?**\nNo, however, Shader Graph is included in URP/HDRP by default. For Built-in, it is necessary to install the package.\n\n\n**Can I request customization? Are you available for commissions?**\nYes, please send me a message.\n\n\n ≽^·⩊·^≼\n\n Thank you!\n\n﹌﹌﹌﹌﹌","imageAlt":"Business Lady Office Girls - Game Ready 3D asset","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/woman/business-lady-office-girls-game-ready","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/91jbmj5n6nfxwldalzwxupx41fif/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/cgtrader.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/91jbmj5n6nfxwldalzwxupx41fif/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/cgtrader.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/woman/business-lady-office-girls-game-ready","isCgtVerified":true,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":185,"name":".mat","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"woman","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Woman","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6756672/49a6e0dd78/business-lady-office-girls-game-ready-3d-model-49a6e0dd78.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"1988060","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":1988060,"title":"HORNS - 60 part IMM and VDM brush plus OBJs","price":25.0,"description":"**60 Zbrush High poly sculpt IMM \u0026 VDM brushes: 39 IMM horns; 9 VDM horns; 5 VDM frills; 7 VDM horn sockets spread across an IMM and a VDM brush.**\n\nMore highly detailed horns than you can throw an antler at! - you'll never have to make these again nor scramble around looking for the nearest set of horns to complete your creature with that missing \"something\". \n\nThe 39 Insert Meshes have been decimated as much as possible without sacrificing detail. Each Mesh ranges from about 150k triangles to a million, with most hovering around the 400k range. The 21 Vector Displacement brushes were created in a 500k triangle square each, though on the user side, only the underlying topology count matters - the amount the brush was created with is irrelevant. \n\nHere is a video demonstrating how I like to use it plus some tips: https://youtu.be/xnPrQ3nMjC0\n\nOptional downloads of FBX and OBJ files of all meshes included for those that need them, though recommended usage is in Zbrush. \nPlease note the demonstration heads are not included. These are untextured high poly sculpts.\n\nMake some ill things!\nMade in Zbrush 2019.0","imageAlt":"HORNS - 60 part IMM and VDM brush plus OBJs horns 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/horns-60-part-imm-and-vdm-brush","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qVYNZ1jQ9FU4BmtCYV4kqMH7/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Horns_thumbnail_landscape.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qVYNZ1jQ9FU4BmtCYV4kqMH7/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Horns_thumbnail_landscape.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/horns-60-part-imm-and-vdm-brush","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"fantasy-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Fantasy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/1988060/7f5cc30256/horns-60-part-imm-and-vdm-brush-plus-objs-3d-model-7f5cc30256.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3416697","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3416697,"title":"Strawberries","price":27.8,"description":"You will receive two photorealistic digital full and two half strawberrys with 8k texture maps.\nIt has been scanned  with 300+ photos and digitalized with a photogrammetry software.\nIt has organized non-overlapping uv`s and a decent topology which supports further editing and a lot of detail.\nWith the 3D model (formats: fbx, obj) there is a diffuse, roughness, displacement, masks and normal map.\n\n- Model Formats: OBJ / FBX\n- Model Details: Subdivision-ready / organized non-overlapping uv`s\n- Texture Maps: Diffuse / Roughness  / Normal / Displacement / Mask\n- Texture Resolution: 8192x8192px\n\nThe lights, cameras, and  background  are not included in the product.\nThe model is clean and centred at the origin with real-world scale.","imageAlt":"realistic 3D asset realtime Strawberry","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/strawberry-28b3a2c7-4b89-4abf-8eae-fc1521f4e358","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1eEbcD42iiJRxadSsHsrgxFT/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/strawberryPreview.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1eEbcD42iiJRxadSsHsrgxFT/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/strawberryPreview.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/food/fruit/strawberry-28b3a2c7-4b89-4abf-8eae-fc1521f4e358","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"food","subcategorySlug":"fruit","categoryTitle":"Food","subcategoryTitle":"Fruit","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3416697/fa37fab5ce/strawberries-3d-model-fa37fab5ce.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2546371","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2546371,"title":"Parisian buildings","price":119.0,"description":"This is a collection of 9 Parisian residential buildings.\n\nIndividually this items cost $226.\n\nLast updated 24.10.2021","imageAlt":"3D asset realtime Parisian buildings","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/parisian-buildings","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qeVRWUn1oi4xX5ZGuhRbvF5h/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/parisian-buildings-3d-model-max-obj-fbx-c4d-ma-blend.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qeVRWUn1oi4xX5ZGuhRbvF5h/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/parisian-buildings-3d-model-max-obj-fbx-c4d-ma-blend.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/parisian-buildings","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"house","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"House","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2546371/3e969c062e/parisian-buildings-3d-model-3e969c062e.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2260172","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2260172,"title":"Alien Statue Fanart","price":17.5,"description":"This is fully detailed statue of an Alien creature.\nThis figure is prepared to be printed on SLA and also FDM printers.\nIt's assmebled from 20 pieces - cut , keyed and hollowed.\nSeparate Folder called FDM is a model with no holes, for better printing results.\nModel on the pictures was printed on the form2 SLA printer.\nYou will find here files in formats like: stl, obj,  FBX.\nThis is only printable file and doesn't contain textures neither mtl.","imageAlt":"Alien Statue Fanart 3D printable model fanart","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-print-models/art/sculpture/alien-statue-fanart","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/U8eqWYXw9w3rQqnyPA5Z48iE/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/004thumb.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/U8eqWYXw9w3rQqnyPA5Z48iE/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/004thumb.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-print-models/art/sculpture/alien-statue-fanart","isCgtVerified":true,"types":{"printReady":true,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"art","subcategorySlug":"sculpture","categoryTitle":"Art \u0026 Design","subcategoryTitle":"Sculptures","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2260172/b78eac4f6d/alien-statue-fanart-3d-model-b78eac4f6d.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"956054","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":956054,"title":"Female Hand","price":29.0,"description":"-- GENERAL INFO --\n\n-This is a very useful, high quality and realistic female hand model.\n\n-All parts are interconnected with very clean topology.\n\n-The model was modeled in real-world scale with ideal proportions.\n\n-Unnecessary complex layer, material, texture, brush... no in the project.\n\n-From this topology you can easily to make more different kind of body.\n\n-You can use separately for other characters.\n\n-Final images rendered with cycles render, and images don't has any effect.\n\n-- FEATURES --\n\n-The mesh contains only quads.\n\n-Anatomically correct model.\n\n-Suitable proportions.\n\n-Quality UV map.\n\n-Quality high resolution textures.\n\n-Location : ( 0,0,0 ).\n\n-There is a rig system for all moves.\n\n-Created in Blender 4.0\n\n-- OBJECTS --\n\n-The whole model is modeled in a single object with clean topology\n\n//FemaleHand ---\u003e 2.911 verts\n\n-- TEXTURES --\n\n-First, painted the diffuse map on blender. And Subdermal, Epidermal, Backscatter maps combined on photoshop with diffse map. ( for less space, more quality ).\n\n-Created the Normal map with sculpt.\n\n//FemaleHand-Albedo.jpg ---\u003e 4096 x 4096\n\n//FemaleHand-Normal.jpg ---\u003e 4096 x 4096\n\n//FemaleHand-Bump.jpg ---\u003e 4096 x 4096","imageAlt":"3D model rigged Female Hand","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/human-anatomy/female-hands","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/rn8VMUpTmPCdk8H4yZyiJbCF/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/rn8VMUpTmPCdk8H4yZyiJbCF/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/human-anatomy/female-hands","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":189,"name":".ply","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"human-anatomy","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Anatomy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/956054/7ddaef2ccf/female-hand-3d-model-7ddaef2ccf.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5560555","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5560555,"title":"Fenris - Spaceship with Interior","price":274.99,"description":"Free Playable Demos: https://mega.nz/folder/xtFkGC5L#CLFPu_9PDMj70oZVQcFPyQ\n\n**1.2 Update for Unity version:**\n- URP support\n- Includes \"Hyperspace Effects\" Package for free (with ship demo integration)\n(To see new hyperspace effects see the above download link and download Fenris and HyperspaceEffects demos!)\n\n**Package includes:**\n- All the models and textures so you can import this asset into any 3d software (Plus a short text guide to help you assemble it and set up the materials)\n- Unity package with the interactive scene from the video including all the assets (models, textures, materials, sfx, scripts)\n- Unreal project\n\n**A large spaceship with fully detailed interior, animated landing gear and cargo ramp.** This versatile package is suitable for a vide variety of Sci-Fi games/experiences. It can be your hero ship with which you explore the galaxy, set dressing for a sci-fi level in which you do gameplay activities in the landed/derelict ship interior. Or use the ship as your backdrop for your animated story. The various interior rooms together with the customizability of materials and atmosphere offer countless gameplay opportunities.\n\n**The ship has 11 rooms across 3 decks, as follows:**\n- Cargo Hold with an animated ramp that serves as the main entrance.\n- Medbay\n- Brig with 2 prison cells and an office\n- Ready Room (combination of meeting room, kitchen, armory and workshop)\n- 2x Crew Quarters\n- Captain's Quarters\n- Engineering room\n- Airlock\n- Bathroom\n- The Main Deck Corridor with windows overlooking the Cargo Hold, and windows towards the exterior.\n- And of course, the Bridge with 4 seats.\n- Package also includes 4 animated sci-fi door models (multiple color schemes each) which are used all across the ship.\n\n**MATERIALS:** The majority of surfaces are textured using a single texture set. (a collection of opaque/transparent materials that reference the same base textures). This is to reduce package size and number of textures. A .PSD file is also included with which you can change the color scheme of the interior/exterior (Color changes can be applied everywhere or on a room-by-room basis. Or even on a panel by panel basis where mesh sub-ojects are separated and permit for separate material assignment)\n\n**Triangle count:**\nEntire scene, interior + exterior: 1,168,479 tris\nExterior only: 209,968 tris\n\n**Update Unity v1.1.1: **\n- The main trimsheet materials are now colored via shader (this cuts down on required diffuse textures needed to be loaded into build and memory, also allows for infinite color variations)\n- Replaced \"VattalusSpaceshipManager\" script with \"VattalusInteriorEnvManager\" [Improved script that shows/hides rooms based which is visible to the player]\n- Interactable sound effects now work differently: a temporary AudioSource is created instead of enabling/disabling already existing GOs\n- Added a toggle-able hologram to the bridge\n- Other smaller visual tweaks and upgrades\n\n**Update Unity v1.0.5: ** \n- Added an example turret model (Size L)and placed it on the 5 turret mounts across the ship. (no assosiated script for controlling the turret, though it can be added as the turret is properly separated for movement/animation)","imageAlt":"3D model Fenris - Spaceship with Interior","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/space/spaceship/fenris-spaceship-with-fully-modelled-interior","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/kqfprnn901e9dzsvkes6ultal0n2/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CGTrader_Thumb.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/kqfprnn901e9dzsvkes6ultal0n2/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CGTrader_Thumb.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/space/spaceship/fenris-spaceship-with-fully-modelled-interior","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":true},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":222,"name":".mp4","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":217,"name":".psd","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"space","subcategorySlug":"spaceship","categoryTitle":"Space","subcategoryTitle":"Spaceship","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5560555/ecd0dd77f5/fenris-spaceship-with-interior-3d-model-ecd0dd77f5.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6300310","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6300310,"title":"Casual Mens Clothing 3D Model Set - Hanging and Folded","price":28.0,"description":"This 3D clothing model set was created based on garments from our character 3D model series and is optimized for use in storefront and residential CG visualizations.\n\nOur character 3D model series\u003cbr\u003e\nhttps://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/tomnookpeo\n\nThis asset pack includes multiple mesh variations and a range of material color options, allowing you to mix and match models for a natural, non-repetitive look, even in large-scale clothing displays.\n\nDesigned with efficiency in mind, the model’s slim profile makes it ideal for use in space-conscious layouts or compact visualizations.\n\nAdditionally, It comes with 4K textures and Subdivision Surface (SDS)-ready geometry, making it perfectly suited for close-up shots.\n\n\n**File Formats:**\u003cbr\u003e\nCINEMA4D / Blender / FBX / OBJ\n\n**Renderers:**\u003cbr\u003e\nCorona renderer (.c4d) / Cycles (.blend) \n\n**Included Files:**\n- CM1_T-Shirt_G2.c4d\n- CM1_T-Shirt_G2.blend\n- CM1_T-Shirt_G2.fbx\n- CM1_T-Shirt_G2.obj\n- CM1_T-Shirt_G2.mtl\n\n- CM2_Sweater01.c4d\n- CM2_Sweater01.blend\n- CM2_Sweater01.fbx\n- CM2_Sweater01.obj\n- CM2_Sweater01.mtl\n\n- CM3_Shirt_B1.c4d\n- CM3_Shirt_B1.blend\n- CM3_Shirt_B1.fbx\n- CM3_Shirt_B1.obj\n- CM3_Shirt_B1.mtl\n\n- CM4_Cotton_Pants.c4d\n- CM4_Cotton_Pants.blend\n- CM4_Cotton_Pants.fbx\n- CM4_Cotton_Pants.obj\n- CM4_Cotton_Pants.mtl\n\n- CM5_Sweat_Pants.c4d\n- CM5_Sweat_Pants.blend\n- CM5_Sweat_Pants.fbx\n- CM5_Sweat_Pants.obj\n- CM5_Sweat_Pants.mtl\n\n- CM6_Sweater01_laid_flat.c4d\n- CM6_Sweater01_laid_flat.blend\n- CM6_Sweater01_laid_flat.fbx\n- CM6_Sweater01_laid_flat.obj\n- CM6_Sweater01_laid_flat.mtl\n\n- Wire_hanging_system.c4d\n- Wire_hanging_system.blend\n- Wire_hanging_system.fbx\n- Wire_hanging_system.obj\n- Wire_hanging_system.mtl\n\n- tex\n\n**Model Details:**\u003cbr\u003e\nCM1_T-Shirt_G2\n- Polygons : 16,320\n- Vertices : 16,467\n- Dimension (mm) : W530 x D88 x H721\n\nCM2_Sweater01\n- Polygons : 20,531\n- Vertices : 20,584\n- Dimension (mm) : W499 x D110 x H709\n\nCM3_Shirt_B1\n- Polygons : 33,243\n- Vertices : 34,491\n- Dimension (mm) : W589 x D147 x H815\n\nCM4_Cotton_Pants\n- Polygons : 15,038\n- Vertices : 15,095\n- Dimension (mm) : W432 x D68 x H1070\n\nCM5_Sweat_Pants\n- Polygons : 15,074\n- Vertices : 15,072\n- Dimension (mm) : W449 x D65 x H1060\n\nCM6_Sweater01_laid_flat\n- Polygons : 21,016 / 42,032 / 63048\n- Vertices : 21,201 / 42,402 / 63,603\n- Dimension (mm) : W294 x D339x H34~111\n\nW_Male_Hanger_W42\n- Polygons : 4,242\n- Vertices : 4,248\n- Dimension (mm) : W420 x D38 x H228\n\nW_Pant_Hanger_W36\n- Polygons : 4,824\n- Vertices : 4,762\n- Dimension (mm) : W360 x D22 x H187\n\nWire_hanging_system\n- Polygons : 16,296\n- Vertices : 16,992\n- Dimension (mm) : W45 x D945~ H1840 x 2500\n\n**Technical Features:**\n- Textures : YES(PBR 4K PNG)\n- Materials : YES\n- UV Mapping : YES(non-overlapping)\n- Subdivision-Ready : YES\n- Rigged : NO\n\n**Notes:**\n- For close-up rendering, the use of Subdivision Surface (SDS) is recommended.\n- Product images were rendered using Corona Renderer with SDS Level 1.\n- Please note that slight individual differences may exist in the model shape (within a few millimeters).\n- Commercial and personal use is allowed (credit is not required but always appreciated).\n- Redistribution or resale of this data is strictly prohibited.\n\n**View all Clothing models**\u003cbr\u003e\nhttps://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/tomnookclo\n\n**View all models**\u003cbr\u003e\nhttps://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models?author=tomnook3d","imageAlt":"Casual Mens Clothing 3D Model Set - Hanging and PBR","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/clothing/casual-mens-clothing-3d-model-set-hanging-and-folded","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/zoyomnl20wxl0t7xv6om0dm53635/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CM0_C.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/zoyomnl20wxl0t7xv6om0dm53635/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CM0_C.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/clothing/casual-mens-clothing-3d-model-set-hanging-and-folded","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"clothing","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Clothing","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6300310/390783cff2/casual-mens-clothing-3d-model-set-hanging-and-folded-3d-model-390783cff2.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4990464","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4990464,"title":"Optimus Gen 2 animated model robot  high detailed quality vray","price":99.0,"description":"Highly detailed model as much as possible. Full poroduction ready.  You can use rig from Mixamo for animation\n\nIntroducing our meticulously crafted Tesla Bot v2 3D model, a true testament to the fusion of technology and design, tailored for 3ds Max and rendered with V-Ray. This state-of-the-art humanoid robot model is inspired by the latest advancements in robotics and AI, designed with precise attention to detail to reflect the futuristic vision of Tesla. Reddy for animation!","imageAlt":"Optimus Gen 2 animated model robot high 3D asset 2","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/other/optimus-gen-2","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ahS7i5qjeYEzZsMEnYkxhDoF/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Optimus_Gen_2_.%20jpg.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/ahS7i5qjeYEzZsMEnYkxhDoF/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Optimus_Gen_2_.%20jpg.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/other/optimus-gen-2","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":false,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":2,"name":".3ds","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"electronics","subcategorySlug":"other","categoryTitle":"Electronics","subcategoryTitle":"Other","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4990464/6c8b6e9c71/optimus-gen-2-animated-model-robot-high-detailed-quality-vray-3d-model-6c8b6e9c71.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4906390","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4906390,"title":"Modular Classic Style American 20 House pack with creation tool","price":159.0,"description":"This is a high quality modular house pack with 20 fully furnished houses for Blender Eevee and Cycles. \n\nEverything is textured with CC0 (copyright free) textures and modeled by me.\n\nAll the lighting is baked for Eevee (both day and night) for high performance renders.\n\nAlso works for Cycles renders. \n\nYou will receive the files with everything included as displayed in the renders.\n\nEvery house has its own folder and exports.\n\nDoors and windows are animated. Slide timeline at the bottom to open doors and windows.\n\n**Series:**\n\n**This house pack also comes with my modular house creation tool!**\n\nThis house pack is part of a series of 20 custom houses which are developed and designed by me.\n\nThese houses can also be bought separately.\n\nIf you wish to see more information and details of every house. You can check out ‘’Modular Classic Style American House 1 to 20’’ on my store\n\nThere is also a free shed available to try out the quality.\n\n**Performance:**\n\nThis project is made with high quality modular parts which results in high performance and low memory usage. All parts are instanced too.\n\nI would still suggest 8gb of ram and 6gb of Vram\n\nAll interior lights are using material emission. For Eevee this light is baked in, meaning a very high performance at the cost of slightly less accurate lighting from interior light sources.\n\n\n**Fully modular and scene setup**\n\nThe entire house and kitchen is created using a modular setup:\n\nAll the origins are placed in such a way that parts rotate and connect well .\n\nDoors have their origins at their hinges.\n\nThe grid is 3.6x3.6x3 meters in Blender. If you want to use the grid while moving these parts: make sure to search for ‘’unit scale’’ on the left in Blender, and set it to 10. When you are done, set it back to 1.\n\nEvery part has both their object and data named. \n\n**Polygons (Numbers of the most complex house in the pack):**\n\n-\tObjects: 7505 (mostly instanced)\n-\tVerts: 4,474,866\n-\tFaces: 4,313,221\n-\tTris: 8,584,188\n\n**Exports:**\n\nThis exported file formats are exported with default settings from Blender 3.6\n-\tBlend\n-\tABC\n-\tDAE\n-\tFBX\n-\tGLB\n-\tOBJ\n-\tPLY\n-\tSTL\n-\tUSDC\n-\tX3D\n\nIt is possible to import this into a game engine too. But keep in mind that some materials might need some manual work to make it look similar to the renders.\n\nThese houses have a Royalty Free license. But Credit to Denniswoo1993 is always greatly appreciated!\n","imageAlt":"Modular Classic Style American 20 House pack 3D model 2","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/modular-classic-style-american-20-house-pack-with-creation-tool","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1DHLzXP2aGnnXCxnSLob23ZP/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1DHLzXP2aGnnXCxnSLob23ZP/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/modular-classic-style-american-20-house-pack-with-creation-tool","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"interior","subcategorySlug":"house-interior","categoryTitle":"Interior","subcategoryTitle":"House","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4906390/c4460344a6/modular-classic-style-american-20-house-pack-with-creation-tool-3d-model-c4460344a6.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4214254","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4214254,"title":"Casino Collection 3D ","price":149.0,"description":"--- Casino Collection 3D    ---\n\n\nRealistic Casino Equipment Collection 3D model PBR Game ready.\n\n--- Qualification ---\n\nThe model used PBR Maps. It can be used in both for game or realistic renders. Originally created with Blender v3.3 Model is in real-world scale .\n\n\nThis product contains all of my previous casino related product which is\n\n1. Blackjack Table\n2. Card Shuffler\n3. Craps Table\n4. Roulette Table\n5. Roulette Wheel\n6. Casino Chair\n7. Poker Chips\n8. Playing Cards\n\nWhich if you purchased them all individually it will cost : $238 . So you can saved $89  if you purchased  this collection\n  \n--- Real-world scale ---\n\nthe model based on Real-world scale of the object\n\n- BlackJack Table    ( height: 95.9 cm / width 218 cm / depth 137 cm )\n- Card Shuffler          ( height: 22.9 cm / width 16.8 cm / depth 43.9 cm )\n- Poker Table             ( height: 76 cm / width 241 cm / depth 115cm )\n- Craps Table             ( height: 81 cm / width 249 cm / depth 120 cm )\n- Roulette Table       ( height: 91 cm / width 244 cm / depth 122 cm )\n- Roulette Wheel     ( height: 32 cm / width 80 cm / depth 80 cm )\n- Casino Chair           ( height: 85.5 cm ( you can adjust the height to fit your table ) / width 61 cm / depth 54.5 cm )\n- Poker Chips            ( height: 0.35 cm / width 3.9 cm / depth 3.9 cm (1 Piece ))\n- Playing Cards         ( height: 0.024 cm / width 6.35 cm / depth 8.9 cm (1 Card ))\n\n--- Product details---\n\n- Low polygon model with UV mapped in FBX and OBJ formats and high polygon for texture baking.\n- BlackJack Table 3D model ( 8,222 Face, 14,841 Triangles, 7,703 Vertices )\n- Card Suffler 3D model ( 3,905 Face, 6,934 Triangles, 3,615 Vertices )\n- Poker Table Table 3D model ( 8,871 Face, 15,913 Triangles, 8,238 Vertices )\n- Craps Table 3D model ( 13,971 Face, 19,508 Triangles, 10,081 Vertices )\n- Roulette Table 3D model ( 7,672 Face, 14,023 Triangles, 7,346 Vertices )\n- Roulette Wheel 3D model (5,030 Face, 9,566 Triangles, 5,119 Vertices )\n- Casino Chair 3D model ( 3,370Face, 6,238 Triangles, 3,339 Vertices )\n- Poker Chips Table 3D model ( 672 Face, 1,280 Triangles, 642 Vertices )\n- Playing Cards 3D model ( 62 Face, 92 Triangles, 48 Vertices Per 1 Card )\n- Blender File ready for renders and can easily made modification if needed.\n- Fully textured and materials applied 4K and 2K PBR Texture \n\nThank you for checking out this product. If you liked it please cosider to check out my other models too just click on my username to see it.\n\n\nThank you !! :)\n","imageAlt":"realtime PBR Casino Collection 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/sports/game/casino-collection-3d","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/aLYwtWez3Puzn59mLZW7niX1/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CC_01-2.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/aLYwtWez3Puzn59mLZW7niX1/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CC_01-2.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/sports/game/casino-collection-3d","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"sports","subcategorySlug":"game","categoryTitle":"Sports","subcategoryTitle":"Game","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4214254/0aecc49d93/casino-collection-3d-3d-model-0aecc49d93.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5045489","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5045489,"title":"Generic Hybrid SUV","price":139.0,"description":"Generic Hybrid SUV\n\nModel for Subdivision.\nOriginally created with 3ds Max 2014, Vray version 3.6\nModel is ready to Render (Max and Blender files include materials, lights, camera)\nScene objects are organized by layers / groups\nModel is scaled to real-world size.\nUnits used:  centimeter  \n\n   GEOMETRY\nSubdivision Level 0\n     Polys 396 149\n     Verts 421 992\n\n   FILES\nMax 2014 version + textures  \nBlender 3.6 version + textures   \nFBX     base mesh (not smoothed)\nOBJ     base mesh (not smoothed)\n","imageAlt":"Generic Hybrid SUV 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/suv/generic-hybrid-suv","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cPiY9wPFAJ5dYTUFQo6vW1cG/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cPiY9wPFAJ5dYTUFQo6vW1cG/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/suv/generic-hybrid-suv","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"car","subcategorySlug":"suv","categoryTitle":"Car","subcategoryTitle":"SUV","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5045489/168b526f74/generic-hybrid-suv-3d-model-168b526f74.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3361328","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3361328,"title":"Moss Biome Ground Scatter - 3D AssetKit PBR","price":23.0,"description":"**Moss Biome Ground Scatter - 3D AssetKit PBR**\n\n**Description**\nThis asset kit contains 79 different variants of nature assets fitting into a mossy biome. All assets are as photorealistic as possible while still preserving managable polygon count. You are free to use them in your 3D scenes, VFX and Games, change them to your liking or kitbash and scatter them into every scene that comes to your mind.\nThe assets work in every 3D studio or game engine. If you work with the native Blender scene you will also find two Geometry nodes setups that you can utilize for quick scattering on meshes. \nThere is only a single material and PBR texture set per asset type. One for the dead wood, one for the stones, one for all of the moss, one per additional plant species and ground coverage. This makes it easy for you to change and manage things if necessary.\nEverything is ready to render with Blender Cycles and EEVEE. Of course you can use it with any renderer you prefer. The hill scatter example from the previs render is included as Blender scene and makes use of the two geometry node setups. Note: This example will not be included in the exchange format variants (FBX, OBJ, etc.)\nAs you can see in the wireframe renders the assets are fairly low poly for the level of detail. For import in Game Engines I have included seperate files with the meshes triangulated and located in the origin. (“*_TriangulatedAtOrigin”)\nAll textures are PBR based, you will find 8k and 4k textures with the assets. You will also find three HDR environments used in the previs renderings. \nAll textures are in PBR Metal/Roughness workflow and additional textures are included for Specular/Glossiness workflow.\nThe stones come with three texture sets (Granite, Granite_Lichen, Quartz_Lichen) that mix well.\nPlease have a look at the renderings and see if assets and wireframe suit your needs.\n\n**Scatter 5 Biomes available**\nThe Kit has preset Biomes for the addon Scatter 5 for Blender. The included .scatpack file you can install as a Scatter Package and use it like any other ScatPack.\n\n**-Content-**\n**Scenes:**\n\n- Moss_Biome_Ground (79 Assets, for 3D Studios )\n- Moss_Biome_Ground_TriangulatedAtOrigin (79 Assets, for instance based workflow or Game Engines)\n\n**Meshes:**\n\n- Moss Low Poly (5 Species, 2 Variations)\n- Moss High Poly (5 Species, 2 Variations)\n- Coverage: Humus, Leaves, Sticks, etc (6 Variations)\n- Fern: Deer Fern, Blechnum spicant (5 Variations)\n- Pilewort, Ficaria verna (9 Variations)\n- Sorrel: Wood Sorrel, Oxalis acetosella (9 Variations)\n- Wood Birch: Branches, dead (8 Variations)\n- Wood Birch: Trunks, dead (7 Variations)\n- Wood Birch: Trunks branched, dead (7 Variations)\n- Stones (5 Variations)\n- Stones, big (3 Variations)\n \n**Textures: 8k, 4k**\n\n- BaseColor / Albedo\n- Normal GL\n- Normal DX\n- Roughness - PBR Metal/Roughness Workflow\n- Glossiness - PBR Specular/Glossiness Workflow\n- Specular - PBR Specular/Glossiness Workflow\n- Masks for Opacity\n\n**Textures additional:**\n\n- Ground: Forest Ground\n- HDR Environment - 3 Variants\n\n\nEnjoy rendering!\n","imageAlt":"low-poly Moss Biome Ground Scatter - 3D AssetKit PBR","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/landscape/moss-biome-ground-scatter-3d-assetkit-pbr","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/Fuk1oy9JMYJ7TpqRRfNyY19N/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Thumb_BlenderMarket_06_CGT.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/Fuk1oy9JMYJ7TpqRRfNyY19N/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Thumb_BlenderMarket_06_CGT.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/landscape/moss-biome-ground-scatter-3d-assetkit-pbr","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"landscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Landscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3361328/96efdda0b2/moss-biome-ground-scatter-3d-assetkit-pbr-3d-model-96efdda0b2.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3835233","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3835233,"title":"Fiction creature","price":149.0,"description":"Models list:\n1. Dragon Wyvern (Dracoprimus)\n2. Mutant Alien Creature (Obscurux-X)\n3. Mutant Alien Worm (Letifermis)\n4. Golem Tortoise (Terrachelys)\n5. Alien Horse Creature (Equinovis)\n6. Alien Monster Fish (Cruciognatus)\n7. Kaiju Titan Creature (Megahexonys)\n8. Behemoth Alien Creature (Carnoceratus)\n9. Alien Butterfly Insect (Infernolucris)\n10. Alien Parasite Cocoon (Parasitegmus)\n11. Asian Serpent Dragon \n12. Godzilla\n13. Ancient Dragon\n_And will be further updated in the future._\n\n\n\n- Real-scale model.\n- 1 udim non-overlapping UV mapping.\n- Texture maps resolution: 4096x4096px (Substance Painter file attached for edit and export other resolutions).\n- Already has basic rigged and has animations like the preview video (.fbx and .blend files).\n- The rigged amature need Wiggle Bone add-ons for wiggle effect of some bones (You can download it free here: https://blender-addons.org/wiggle-bones-addon/ and it would be great if you donate to them) You need to install the add-on before open the animated Blender file.\n- Suitable for both realtime and raytracing render.\n- Preview videos and images rendered by Blender Eevee realtime render engine and Blender Cycle raytracing render engine.\n- Detailed information can be found in the site of each product.\n- If my product not as good as you expected, please send me a message for feedback so I can give you a warranty and improve the quality of the store.","imageAlt":"Fiction creature 3D model animated","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/fiction-creature-f9baa930-43c6-4d75-a80d-ba69d43ae9cf","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qjZtfLz4NLFnw162sBhFTxJf/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/fiction-creature-3d-model-6afb13b622.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qjZtfLz4NLFnw162sBhFTxJf/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/fiction-creature-3d-model-6afb13b622.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/fiction-creature-f9baa930-43c6-4d75-a80d-ba69d43ae9cf","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"fantasy-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Fantasy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3835233/6afb13b622/fiction-creature-3d-model-6afb13b622.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5130620","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5130620,"title":"2020 Freightliner M2 106 Box truck","price":105.0,"description":"**Freightliner Business Class M2 106 - straight truck 26ft and conventional cab 106 inches.**\n\n- Originally created with 3ds Max 2022.\n- 3D model created maximally close to a real truck and based on the dimensions from open sources.\n- Fully detailed truck cockpit.\n- Doors /Roll door/ Liftgate have an opening function.\n- The suspension and frame have been worked out.\n- PBR textures compatible on 3ds max, Blender, Cinema 4D and RGB Unreal engine with other engines and editors.\n- Middle Poly model. (Best compatibility for games and game engines.).\n- 3 colors from real trucks.\n- This realistic 3D model is perfect for your game and render or animation.\n- I drew all the dashboards and sensors myself in Photoshop.\n- Materials, objects, textures and groups have a unique name, so there will be no confusion.\n- PBR textures so you can easily tweak them for any render or engine.\n- Unit scale. mm/cm\n- Scale 1 to 1\n\n**_Texture resolution_**\n\n1. Daycab Body 4096X4096.\n2. Daycab Interior 4096X4096.\n3. Dashboard 4096X4096.\n4.  Lights 4096X4096.\n5. Frame 4096X4096.\n6. Glass 4096X4096.\n7. Box 4096X4096\n8. Interior Box 4096X4096.\n9. Bottom Box 4096X4096.\n10. Lights Box 4096X4096.\n11. Walkramp 4096X4096.\n12. Parts 4096X4096.\n13. Seat 4096X4096.\n14. Wheels 4096X4096.\n15. Liftgate 4096X4096.\n16. Cardboard box 4096X4096.\n17. Stikers 4096X4096.\n\n**_Maps._**\n\n1. 3ds max (Corona 8.2): Diffuse. Glossiness. Height. IOR Metallic. Normal. opacity.\n2. Unreal: BaseColor. OcclusionRoughnessMetallic. Normal. Emissive. Opacity.\n3. Blender: BaseColor. Emissive. Height. Metallic. Normal. Opacity. Roughness. (Use default textures)\n4. Cinema 4d: Uses the same textures as Blender.\n\n**_Files and archives._**\n\n1. FLM2_106DCBT_Blender. (Default textures).\n2. FLM2_106DCBT_Corona_Max_2020. (Corona textures).\n3. FLM2_106DCBT_Cinema4d. (Default textures).\n4. FLM2_106DCBT_Unreal_project. (Unreal textures)\n5. FLM2_106DCBT_BLEND_FBX. (Default textures).\n6. FLM2_106DCBT_BLEND_OBJ. (Default textures).\n7. FLM2_106DCBT_Textures_Default (Textures are compatible with Blender, Cinema4d).\n8. FLM2_106DCBT_Textures_Corona.\n9. FLM2_106DCBT_Textures_Unreal.\n\n- Quads and tris. No NGONS.\n- Tris 198928. \n- This is digital 3d model.\n- **This is not toy**.","imageAlt":"3D asset 2020 Freightliner M2 106 Box truck","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/2020-freightliner-m2-106-box-truck","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/thx3EKJ39wjAEU4wWRo7Zo6V/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/SG_1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/thx3EKJ39wjAEU4wWRo7Zo6V/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/SG_1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/2020-freightliner-m2-106-box-truck","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"vehicle","subcategorySlug":"truck","categoryTitle":"Vehicle","subcategoryTitle":"Truck","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5130620/1da950a9d5/2020-freightliner-m2-106-box-truck-3d-model-1da950a9d5.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5295952","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5295952,"title":"Apple M4 iPad Pro and Pencil Pro - 2024 - 11 and 13 INCH","price":16.99,"description":"**Apple M4 iPad Pro \u0026 Pencil Pro - 2024 - 11 and 13 INCH - 2 Colors**\n\nThis Model is intended as a high quality resource for photo realistic vizualisation.\nIncluding both sizes, 11 and 13 INCH, as well as both colors, Space Black and Silver. Also including Apple Pencil Pro.\n\n1:1 Scale, base model created in Rhino (included)\n\nComes fully textured and ready to render for:\n\n**- Cinema 4D 2024 + Redshift**\nNative high quality Redshift materials, custom textures and a basic stage.\n\n**- Blender 4.0.2**\nNative high quality materials, custom textures and a basic stage. Mainly created for use with Cycles.\n\nFurther formats that come without textures:\n\n\n- **FBX**\n- **OBJ** \n- **STP (NURBS)**\n- **RHINO 6 (NURBS)**\n\n\nMore info:\n- C4D and BLEND files allow easy modification of all materials\n- Properly sorted and grouped\n- Unit: mm\n\nEnjoy!","imageAlt":"3D model Apple M4 iPad Pro and Pencil Pro - 2024 - 11 3","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/computer/apple-m4-ipad-pro-and-pencil-pro-2024-11-and-13-inch","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/2EmxyorPygFYwwe3pFdhxCLs/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Aplpe_iPad%20Pro%202024_PERSPECTIVE%2001A.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/2EmxyorPygFYwwe3pFdhxCLs/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Aplpe_iPad%20Pro%202024_PERSPECTIVE%2001A.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/computer/apple-m4-ipad-pro-and-pencil-pro-2024-11-and-13-inch","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":13,"name":".3dm","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":72,"name":".stp","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"electronics","subcategorySlug":"computer","categoryTitle":"Electronics","subcategoryTitle":"Computer","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5295952/6e25d2ac1a/apple-m4-ipad-pro-and-pencil-pro-2024-11-and-13-inch-3d-model-6e25d2ac1a.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4867936","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4867936,"title":"Pirelli PZero PZ4","price":49.0,"description":"80% of the beauty of a car is in its wheels, and tires are an integral part of the wheel. This is a highly accurate Pirelli PZero PZ4 3d model that will help improve the look of your car.\n\n\n● MODEL\n\nObjects count - 2 polygonal object.\n\nExcellent detail and high geometry accuracy.\n\nContains only quads and tris.\n\n Coordinates of the location of the model in space (0, 0, 0).\n\n Model is built to real-world scale.\n\n Moderate mesh density.\n\n● POLYCOUNTS\n\n Polygons: 412148.\n\n Vertices: 424660.\n\n● TEXTURES\n\n Format - PNG\n\n Count - 8\n\n Textures are made in two versions. Clean and dirty.\n\n Textures have 8k resolution\n\n Textures are collected in a separate archive.\n\n● UV COORDINATES\n\nThe model is completely unwrapped.\n\n● FILE FORMATS\n\n Blender\n \n 3ds Max  2018 (FStorm 1.5.3g)\n\n 3ds Max  2018 (Corona 9)\n\n 3ds Max  2018 (Scanline Renderer)\n\n FBX\n\n OBJ\n       \n● GENERAL\n \nModeled in 3ds max.\n\n Preview images are rendered with FStorm render.\n\n\nIf you have any questions or problems with the model, please contact me.\n\nGood renders to  you!\n\n\n","imageAlt":"3D model Pirelli PZero PZ4","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/sport-car/pirelli-pzero-pz4","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/XiJeX973ipANpmShKL8zixox/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/preview.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/XiJeX973ipANpmShKL8zixox/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/preview.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/sport-car/pirelli-pzero-pz4","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"car","subcategorySlug":"sport-car","categoryTitle":"Car","subcategoryTitle":"Sport","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4867936/81fc025cfd/pirelli-pzero-pz4-3d-model-81fc025cfd.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5241569","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5241569,"title":"Japanese City - Midtown Environment","price":249.0,"description":"A massive japanese city environment ready to be used in your renders and other work.\n\nIncludes over 60 buildings and 10+ highrises as well as 50+ road pieces and hundreds of props used to decorate the scene from the street level to the rooftops.\n\nAs the scene is relatively large at 1km x 600m, it's adviced to have a decent computer to open the assets.\n\nIncluded are PBR material textures, but due to performance reasons the scene is supplied with albedo \u0026 normals only. All of the other tetxures are available to be assigned to the scene easily due to easily identifiable naming system.\n\nUnpack the \"Texture\" folder to the same folder as you have the 3D files so the assets will load correctly.\n\nRenders rendered realtime in Unreal engine 5.0 using included assets.\n\nFor unreal engine optimized scene with Lumen \u0026 Extremely performat LODs, please see here: https://www.unrealengine.com/marketplace/en-US/product/1e32264c6b4d4c25be08e27eed731bbd","imageAlt":"Japanese City - Midtown Environment 3D asset","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/japanese-city-midtown-environment","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/NHRVY7vn7JagrFA7fPXckd3w/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/HighresScreenshot00024.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/NHRVY7vn7JagrFA7fPXckd3w/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/HighresScreenshot00024.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/japanese-city-midtown-environment","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"cityscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Cityscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5241569/ea33665bdd/japanese-city-midtown-environment-3d-model-ea33665bdd.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6478597","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6478597,"title":"Broken Concrete Rubble Pack - 21 Assets PBR Game Ready","price":19.0,"description":"This pack includes **21 high-quality broken concrete rubble assets** designed for post-apocalyptic, construction, or destruction scenes. You’ll find piles, slabs, blocks, and scattered debris that can be freely combined to create unique ruined environments.\n\n**Looking for more?**\nIf you need concrete mixed with other debris, or modular rubble piles specifically designed to fit inner/outer corners and straight walls, check out my expanded pack here:\nhttps://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/industrial-exterior/modular-concrete-debris-pack-58-assets-pbr-game-ready\n\n**Features**\n21 assets: rubble piles, broken slabs, concrete fragments, scattered debris.\nOptimized topology: ~3–5k tris per asset, ~44k tris total.\nClean UVs: non-overlapping, ready for baking or texture adjustments.\nSingle material setup: all assets share one PBR material with 4 texture maps (BaseColor, Normal, Roughness, Metallic).\nPBR textures (PNG, 4K): BaseColor, Normal, Roughness, Metallic (packed in a separate archive).\nFile formats included: .blend, .fbx, .glb, .obj + .mtl.\nEngine ready: works with Unreal Engine, Unity, and any PBR-compatible renderer.\n\n**Usage**\nPerfect for game environments, cinematics, visualizations, and kitbashing destruction scenes. Assets can be used individually or combined to build large rubble compositions.","imageAlt":"realtime Broken Concrete Rubble Pack - 21 Assets PBR Game","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/industrial-exterior/broken-concrete-rubble-pack-21-assets-pbr-game-ready","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/z43od5ao90isx13ys43fpztn0fgb/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/broken_concrete_1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/z43od5ao90isx13ys43fpztn0fgb/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/broken_concrete_1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/industrial-exterior/broken-concrete-rubble-pack-21-assets-pbr-game-ready","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"industrial-exterior","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Industrial","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6478597/578cf8ffa5/broken-concrete-rubble-pack-21-assets-pbr-game-ready-3d-model-578cf8ffa5.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5580530","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5580530,"title":"Eiffel Tower High detailed 3D model","price":349.0,"description":"Ready to render in Blender Cycles\n\nModeled with real dimensions\n\nThe model consists mainly of baked textures and a few shaders. The colors of the entire framework construction can easily be adjusted in one node. And also the baked textures of the framework can be changed globally by a shader for a faster render preview.\n\nThe objects are named and grouped logically.\n\nFurther information can be found at the end of the picture series.\n\nThe Blender format is 44,5 Mb and the texture folder 2,29 Gb.\n\nFor the exchange formats there are two versions each. Once the complete eiffel tower and a version that still needs array and mirror generators to keep the file small. An explanation is of course included.\n\nFor obj and fbx files, please rename the \"textures\" folder to \"tex\".\n","imageAlt":"Eiffel Tower High detailed 3D model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/architectural/architectural-street/eiffel-tower-high-detailed-3d-model","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/88fw8hi3cbpo1kbp7c9cufssqdmr/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Eiffel-Tower-3d-model-1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/88fw8hi3cbpo1kbp7c9cufssqdmr/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Eiffel-Tower-3d-model-1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/architectural/architectural-street/eiffel-tower-high-detailed-3d-model","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"architectural","subcategorySlug":"architectural-street","categoryTitle":"Architectural","subcategoryTitle":"Street","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5580530/daa38865cf/eiffel-tower-high-detailed-3d-model-3d-model-daa38865cf.jpg","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4512121","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4512121,"title":"Saltwater Crocodile Animated ","price":89.99,"description":"This model was made in blender 4.0 ,it comes with 8k textures for the body and 4k for the rest (all are in jpg), 2 uvs/materials for body and head , 4 skin variants counting the one in the preview ,a moss texture with no alpha , that you can mix with all the variants , and a blend file with the textures applied and a multires modifier(it doesnt come with the rig) .\n\nIt comes with 43 Animations (all animations are loopeable , and are in root), you can check the animations in the video above\n-Walk Front,Right,Left,Backwards (4 Anims)\n-Stand Start\n-4 Idle Anims\n-2 Atack Anims\n-3 Roar Anims\n-Tail Atack Left \u0026 Right ( 2 Anims)\n-Hit Anim\n-3 Death Anims\n-Stand End/ Lay Start\n-2 Laying Idle Anims\n-Laying Atack\n-Swim Front,Right,Left,Up,Down (5 Anims)\n-2 Swim Animations\n-Swim Atack\n-Swim Idle\n-Swim Sprint\n-Swim Hit\n-JumpOutOfWater\n-SwimDeath\n-Spin Left,Right ( 2 Anims)\n\nComes with fbx,obj,mtl and stl formats ,it also has 1 substance painter file where you can create more variants or recolors too , is recomendable to have a good pc or just open the ssp file and choose efficency mode in the task maneger for substance painter , if you have problems with that send me a msg so i see what i can do\n\nThis model has already been tested it in Unreal Engine and unity and the animations work fine ,with that said if you have compatibility issues when importing animations to other softwares apart of those leave it at the comments so i can fix it \n\n(theres a fbx for unreal is just an scaled version of the mesh only compatible with unreal) \n\nI probably add some extra things to this model ,more info coming soon ,hope you like it :D","imageAlt":"3D asset Saltwater Crocodile Animated","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/reptile/saltwater-crocodile-animated-w-skin-variants","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/QhQDQyooPZF2NAeYGUYzzaAH/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/render14.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/QhQDQyooPZF2NAeYGUYzzaAH/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/render14.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/reptile/saltwater-crocodile-animated-w-skin-variants","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"reptile","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Reptile","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4512121/9400683641/saltwater-crocodile-animated-3d-model-9400683641.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4285126","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4285126,"title":"Animated Falcon","price":149.0,"description":"Rigged and animated high detailed falcon. Clean topology and high res 4K textures.\nDifferent 4K bitmaps including diffuse, specular, glossiness, opacity and displacement, perfect for extreme close-up shots. The model has edge-loops based topology with rational polygon count.\n\n\n**SOFTWARE**\n\n- 3ds Max – Standard \u0026 Vray\n- Maya – Standard \u0026 Arnold\n- Cinema4D – Standard\n- Blender – Cycles Render\n- Alembic\n- FBX\n- OBJ (Static Geometry, UV´s, Textures)\n\n\n**TEXTURES / SHADERS**\n\n- \t4K textures (Color, Specular Color, Specular Level, Glossiness, Displacement, Bump, Opacity/Transparency)\n- \tPBR Materials\n\n**POLY COUNT** \n\n\t\t  Faces / Verts\n\n- \t\t   5511 / 4068\n\n**SCENE SETUP**\n\n Frames\n\n- 00\t\tNeutral Pose\n- 20\t\tWings Folded\n- 30-47\t\tFlight Loop\n- 47-220\tExtended Flight\n","imageAlt":"Animated Falcon 3D model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/bird/animated-falcon","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/AksoP3x6dv7T1cfAxjYsYQtz/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Falcon_00_Thumb.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/AksoP3x6dv7T1cfAxjYsYQtz/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Falcon_00_Thumb.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/bird/animated-falcon","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"bird","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Bird","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4285126/92929de446/animated-falcon-3d-model-92929de446.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2927694","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2927694,"title":"Environment Pack","price":50.0,"description":"Its a collection of all my environment models. Every model is available as obj, FBX and Maya file with 8k textures The models have about 100 000 faces The cover images was rendered with vray, all other images was rendered with Viewport 2.0\n\nMountain Snow \nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps. Files: -Two OBJ files: subdivision level 1 | 25 600 Faces subdivision level 2 | 102 400 Faces Textures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse, Glossiness, Heigth, Normal Maya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an ASCII File\n\nMountain Summer and Winter Textures \nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps. Files: -Two OBJ files: subdivision level 1 | 25 600 Faces subdivision level 2 | 102 400 Faces Textures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse (winter and Summer), Heigth, Normal Maya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an ASCII File\n\nMountain Lake Summer and Winter Textures \nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps. Files: -Two OBJ files: subdivision level 1 | 25 600 Faces subdivision level 2 | 102 080 Faces Textures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse (winter and Summer), Normal, Specular The textures are located in the Mountain_Lake_Maya_Textures.zip under Maya/sourceimages The water texture is only a basic noise in Maya. So it isnt included as an extra Texture Maya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an Maya binary file\n\nMountain with Summer and winter textures \nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps. Files: OBJ and FBX File 102400 faces, 103041 Vertices Textures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse (winter and Summer), Normal, The textures are located in the Mountain_SummerWinter_PUBLIC_Textures-and-Maya.zip under sourceimages Maya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an Maya ASCII File\n\nMountain Winter and Summer \nLow-poly 3D model Low-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps. Files: -Two OBJ/FBX files: subdivision level 1 | 25 281 Faces subdivision level 2 | 101 124 Faces Textures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse, Specular, Normal The textures are located in the Mountain_Snow_and_Summer.zip There is a Folder which is called sourceimages There you can find all textures Maya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the Rendersetup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an ASCII File\n\nVolcano with Summer and Winter Textures\nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps.\nFiles:OBJ and FBX File LOD1 Faces: 25600 Vertices: 25921 LOD2 Faces: 102400 Vertices: 103041\nTextures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse (winter and Summer), Normal, Emission, Heigth, Roughness\nThe textures are located in the zipFile Volcano_MAYA under 01_Maya/sourceimages\nMaya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an Maya ASCII File\nThe cover Images was rendered and composed with a Backgroundimage. The Mountains in the Background are only duplicates of the mainmountain. The other pictures was rendered with viewport 2.0\n\nDesert \nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps.\nFiles:OBJ file: 56620 Faces\nTextures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse, Normal,\nThe textures are located in the Desert_MAFile.zip under Maya/sourceimages\nMaya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an Maya ASCII file\nThe 2 cover pictures are renderings and composed. The other pictures was rendered with maya viewport 2.0\n\n2x Rocky Desert \nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps.\nFiles: OBJ and FBX File LOD1 Faces: 25600 Vertices: 25921 LOD2 Faces: 102400 Vertices: 103041\nTextures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse, Normal (for every LOD), Heigth (for every LOD), Roughness\nMaya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an Maya ASCII File\n\nDesert Mountain \nLow-poly 3d model ready for Virtual Reality (VR), Augmented Reality (AR), games and other real-time apps.\nFiles: OBJ and FBX File LOD1 Faces: 25600 Vertices: 25921 LOD2 Faces: 102400 Vertices: 103041\nTextures: PNG (.png)- 8192x8192 Diffuse, Normal (for every LOD), Heigth (for every LOD), Roughness\n Maya Scene File The Maya Scene file was clearly named, and the setup was done for Vieport 2.0 with DirectX Shader. It was done in Maya 2017 and saved as an Maya ASCII File\n\n\nI hope you like it, please leave a like! Thanks\n","imageAlt":"3D asset Environment Pack","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/environment-pack-fd9e7471-dfcd-44ba-9c20-197259ead1fd","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/45YfjhXezvinmHaLWrKhyzGG/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/environment-pack-3d-model-obj-fbx-ma-mel.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/45YfjhXezvinmHaLWrKhyzGG/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/environment-pack-3d-model-obj-fbx-ma-mel.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/environment-pack-fd9e7471-dfcd-44ba-9c20-197259ead1fd","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"landscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Landscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2927694/fef13fa4c0/environment-pack-3d-model-fef13fa4c0.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6850056","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6850056,"title":"M4A1 AR15 Assault Rifle Modular Customizable","price":99.0,"description":"**Game-ready 3D model** inspired by the M4A1 Assault Rifle, with fully detailed geometry and textures. \n\nThis model is **not intended for 3D printing** and is a game-ready 3D asset inspired by real-world designs, created solely for use in **games and AR/VR projects**. It is optimized as a low-poly model with PBR textures, suitable for Unity, Unreal Engine, digital films, game modding, and other interactive projects.\n\n**This asset is a visually realistic 3D model created exclusively for use in games and similar interactive digital projects (including AR/VR). It is intended for visual representation only and is not designed to function as a real weapon, simulate real mechanical behavior, or replicate exact real-world dimensions, proportions, internal structures, or engineering specifications.**\n\nThe asset includes **3 unique texture sets** for each individual part, representing different **wear levels**: original, low, and high. Each part also features **3 marking variations**: original, no markings, and fictional custom markings. Additionally, there are **4 color variations** available for specific components — the magazine, flash hider, pistol grip, and stock.\n\nThis assembly is unique due to its **modularity, allowing parts to be replaced or integrated into other projects**. Full compatibility with M4A1 components from other authors cannot be guaranteed, but it is fully compatible with my own components.\n\nThis asset is sold **exclusively under the rules of this platform and cannot be distributed or resold in any other form**. It is licensed under a **Royalty Free License (no AI)**. Please review the license details carefully before purchasing. All purchased content cannot be redistributed, sublicensed, or shared with others for use in other projects, regardless of modifications.\n\n\n**Technical Info:**  \n\nFormats:\n\n- FBX\n- OBJ\n- Blend (3.6.1)\n\nTextures:\n\n- PBR (AO, Roughness, Metallic, Base Color, Normal Map (DirectX \u0026 OpenGL)) .png\n- Unity (Albedo, Normal Maps, Metallic \u0026 Smoothness) .png\n- Unreal (Albedo, Occlusion-Roughness-Metallic, Normal) .png\n\nAdditional Technical Information:\n\n- No rigging (model is prepared for rigging and subsequent animation)\n- No animation\n- Not intended for 3D printing\n- Scale and overlapping of hidden parts are used to improve optimization and texture quality without affecting the visible appearance of the model.\n- Some verification status errors on CGTrader may occur, but the model matches the description and is a fully checked, game-ready product without any artifacts.\n- Substance Painter files are not included\n\n**Parts info:**\n\n- M4A1_low_receiver : Tris - 17472 / 4K / TD - 115 \n- M4A1_firing_mechanism_group : Tris -14304 / 2K / TD - 110\n- ammo_556_FMJ : Tris -1276 / 1K / TD - 190\n- m4a1_barrel_370mm : Tris - 2356 / 2K / TD - 92\n- m4a1_barrel_508_457_406_mm : Tris - 2164 / 2K / TD - 82\n- m4a1_barrel_305_260_mm : Tris - 2188 / 2K / TD - 100\n- M4A1_Charging_Handle : Tris - 2516 / 2K / TD - 150\n- M4A1_flash_hider_A2 : Tris - 1742 / 2K / TD - 200\n- M4A1_gasblock_MK12 : Tris - 1910 / 2K / TD - 230\n- M4A1_gasblock_front_sigh : Tris - 7662 / 2K / TD - 150\n- M4A1_pistol_grip_A2 : Tris - 3336 / 4K / TD - 210\n- M4A1_handhuard_carbine : Tris - 24768 / 4K / TD - 130\n- M4A1_handguard_KAC_RIS_7 : Tris - 12568 / 4K / TD - 125\n- M4A1_iron_sight_A2 : Tris - 9124 / 4K / TD - 226\n- M4A1_magazine_stanag30 : Tris - 9290 / 4K / TD - 141\n- M4A1_Rearsight_Carry_Handle : Tris - 9192 / 4K / TD - 180\n- M4A1_stock_M4SS : Tris - 6290 / 4K / TD - 140\n- M4A1_AR_carbine_buffer_tube : Tris - 4434 / 2K / TD - 100\n- M4A1_upper_receiver : Tris - 9652 / 4K / TD - 145\n\n- The original wear shows the texture and asset as initially intended. The low wear reduces the visible wear without removing it completely, and the high wear increases wear to a realistically high level. Wear reflects not only scratches but also other mechanical damage, dirt, dust, and other effects typical for firearms.\n- Original branding and markings appear as intended, the no-branding version has all markings removed, and the custom fictional version includes logos and names fully created by me and entirely unique.\n\n**After importing the model and the textures into the target engine you have to follow the official engine documentation on how to set the material up!**","imageAlt":"3D asset M4A1 AR15 Assault Rifle Modular","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/m4a1-ar15-assault-rifle-modular-customizable","