-models/architectural/decoration/statue-of-liberty-31dd8030-8ec1-4c1a-a105-4bed106780d2","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"architectural","subcategorySlug":"decoration","categoryTitle":"Architectural","subcategoryTitle":"Decoration","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4068650/a2ce258441/statue-of-liberty-3d-model-a2ce258441.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2790394","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2790394,"title":"Riyadh - 3D City Model","price":499.0,"description":"- **TRY BEFORE YOU BUY**\n    - **Message us to get a FREE sample scene of this product!**\n    - Download an overview sample - **www.each.city/sample**\n\n-------------------------------------------\n- **WHAT IS INCLUDED**\n    - DETAILS\n        - Scene size: **Entire area**  —  refer to promo images for scene extents\n        - Units: **Meters**  —  real-world scale\n        - Updated: **February 2024**  —  want the latest? Ask before you pay\n    - KEY BENEFITS\n        - **24/7 customer support**  —  reach out to us anytime for pre-sale inquiries or after-sale support\n        - **Extensive file format support**  —  3ds Max (native), fbx, obj, dae, c4d, skp, 3dm, rvt, blend, etc., or ask for more before payment\n        - **Georeferencing**  —  either Web Mercator, Transverse Mercator, or original CRS. If a specific CRS is essential, ask before you pay\n        - **Any scene size or crop to an area-of-interest**  —  for best performance and format compatibility, inquire before paying\n        - **Buildings, land-use areas, roads and railways split by type** —  layers / named objects\n        - **Detailed landmarks with regular updates and improvements** — available annually or upon pre-purchase inquiry\n        - **Realistic and detailed surface texture**  —  1-meter resolution satellite imagery\n        - **Flat surface, easy for detailing and geometry edits** — topography terrain available at an additional cost. Message us for a quote\n        - **Realistic low-poly vegetation**  —  individual trees in max and fbx formats, additional formats upon request before you pay\n        - **Product is ready to render out-of-the-box**  —  3ds Max + Corona Render\n    - PRESENTATION IMAGES\n        - **4K high-resolution renders**  —  refer to images for level of detail and scene size\n        - **Produced in 3ds Max**  —  other software requires its rendering settings\n    - MATERIALS\n        - **Trees, vegetation, land-use and airport surface with the textures assigned**\n        - **Buildings are UV mapped, split by material IDs, and no textures assigned**\n\n-------------------------------------------\n- **CUSTOMIZE \u0026 SAVE**\n    - TERMS \u0026 CONDITIONS\n        - **Only applies to new customers who placed an order through the HIRE ME option**\n        - **Fully customizable model based on the options listed below**\n        - **Fast turnaround, flexible pricing and discounts**\n    - SCENE SIZE\n        - **Full city extents up to 100 x 100 km**  —  or crop to an area of interest for better format compability and scene performance\n        - **Extended area up to 1000 x 1000 km**  —  or any size options or slice to tiles\n    - DATA AUTHENTICITY\n        - **100% real buildings coverage**  —  unlike other sellers, we don’t use AI generated building footprints\n        - **Combining multiple sources**  —  you may povide us with any dataset to include in the model\n    - GEOREFERENCING\n        - **Coordinate Reference Systems (CRS)** - available options\n            - **Web Mercator**  —  specified by true scale latitude\n            - **Transverse Mercator**  —  defined by central meridian\n            - **Original CRS**  —  local or optimal for this area\n        - **Geolocation**  —  allows you to precisely position 3D content at any specified latitude and longitude\n    - TOPOGRAPHY TERRAIN\n        - **Up to 1-meter accuracy digital terrain model (DTM)**  —  quad mesh\n        - **Multiple terrain LODs**  —  triangle mesh optimized for the best polycount / details balance\n        - **Buildings and roads placed on the optimized terrain**\n        - **Separate land surface and water bodies**\n        - **High-resolution satellite or surface texture**  —  up to 0.2 meter accuracy\n        - **Contour lines**  —  3D splines, up to 1-meter interval\n    - MANUAL MODELING\n        - **Buildings and structures**  —  LOD2 and LOD3\n        - **Elevated highways** — interchanges, bridges and flyovers\n    - TEXTURING\n        - **High-resolution surface texture**  —  satellite image up to 0.2 meter accuracy\n        - **Streets and roads with markings texture**  —  UV mapped along the center line\n        - **Procedural textures assigned to all buildings**  —  LOD1 only\n        - **Realistic textures on individual buildings**  —  LOD2 and LOD3\n    - TREES \u0026 FORESTS\n        - **Individual trees**  —  real trees from OSM data\n        - **Procedural forests**  —  based on distribution areas, convertible to individual trees\n    - OTHER EXTRAS\n        - **Individual buildings and streets**  —  separate objects with address and/or name\n        - **Administrative boundaries of all levels**  —  named polygons or outlines\n        - **Road and railway splines**  —   for traffic animation, etc.\n        - **Public transport stops**  —  individual named objects\n    - FILE FORMATS\n        - **max**  —  Autodesk 3ds Max\n        - **fbx, obj, dae, 3ds**  —  Exchange Formats\n        - **uproject, uasset**  —  Unreal Engine\n        - **glb, gltf**  —  Games, Web, AR/VR\n        - **unitypackage**  —  Unity 3D\n        - **3dm**  —  Rhino 3D\n        - **skp**  —  SketchUp\n        - **rvt**  —  Autodesk Revit\n        - **c4d**  —  Cinema4D\n        - **blend**  —  Blender\n        - **ma, mb**  —  Autodesk Maya\n        - **dwg, dxf**  —  Autodesk AutoCAD\n        - **stl**  —  3D Print\n\n-------------------------------------------\n- **NOTICE**\n    - Options within the CUSTOMIZE \u0026 SAVE section are exclusively available through the HIRE ME option. Flexible pricing applies","imageAlt":"Riyadh - 3D City Model game-ready","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/riyadh","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wEgrxunfCcnwtzaAVnSe5ZKP/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/00_.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wEgrxunfCcnwtzaAVnSe5ZKP/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/00_.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/riyadh","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":4,"name":".dwg","is_native":false},{"id":25,"name":".dae","is_native":false},{"id":7,"name":".dxf","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":13,"name":".3dm","is_native":false},{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":141,"name":".rfa","is_native":false},{"id":14,"name":".skp","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":2,"name":".3ds","is_native":false},{"id":199,"name":".ls10","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"cityscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Cityscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2790394/d87127ed60/riyadh-3d-city-model-3d-model-d87127ed60.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5584879","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5584879,"title":"Mercedes Benz Sprinter L2H2 RWD HQ Interior 2025","price":259.0,"description":"Mercedes Benz Sprinter L2H2 RWD HQ Interior 2025\n\nCreator 3D Team model\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nWhy choose our models?\n+ Everything is ready to render. Just click on the render button and you'll get  picture like in preview image!\n+ High quality exterior; \n+ High quality interior; \n+ Doesnt need any additional plugins;\n+ The textures are included;\n+ Suitable for close-up rendering;\n+ All objects are intelligently separated and named; \n+ All materials are correctly named;\n+ You can easily change or apply new materials, color etc;\n+ The model have good topology;\n+ The model have real dimensions. Real world scaled. Set to origin(0,0,0 xyz axis);\n+ Suitable for animation and high quality photorealistic visualization;\n+ Rendering studio scene with all lighting, cameras, materials, environment setups is included;\n+ HDR Maps are included;\n \n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nMain features \n Origanally created with Autodesk Maya 2018 SP3;\n Rendered with  VRay Next 4.3\n Only Maya mb studio format contains V-Ray materials, lightnin setup, environment. \n Other Fbx, C4d, 3ds, Obj, max, xsi, lwo come with default materials.\n Default materials based on Phong shader.\n Correct render might be required to change path to HDRI maps and other texture at your computer.\n\n Use studio mb version for render like in preview image.\n \n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThank you for buying this product. We look forward to continuously dealing with you.\n Creator 3D team!!!","imageAlt":"Mercedes Benz Sprinter L2H2 RWD HQ Interior 2025 3D model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/other/mercedes-benz-sprinter-l2h2-rwd-hq-interior-2025","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/SeveuWcy2ryfEW96cJWFvkot/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Mercedes%20Benz%20Sprinter%20Panel%20Van%20L2H2%20RWD%20HQInterior%202024_01.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/SeveuWcy2ryfEW96cJWFvkot/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Mercedes%20Benz%20Sprinter%20Panel%20Van%20L2H2%20RWD%20HQInterior%202024_01.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/other/mercedes-benz-sprinter-l2h2-rwd-hq-interior-2025","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":true},{"id":2,"name":".3ds","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":8,"name":".lwo","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":15,"name":".hrc","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"vehicle","subcategorySlug":"other","categoryTitle":"Vehicle","subcategoryTitle":"Other","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5584879/ab6c620512/mercedes-benz-sprinter-l2h2-rwd-hq-interior-2025-3d-model-ab6c620512.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2545043","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2545043,"title":"Semi truck with white trailer","price":30.0,"description":"Unbranded mid-poly 3d truck  model. Designed for Architectural visualisations and other cgi works. Ready for usage inside 3dsMax, Cinema 4D and Blender.\n\nAvaliable formats:\n\n- .max (3ds Max 2015 + Vray Next)\n- .max (3ds Max 2015 + Corona)\n- .c4d (Cinema 4D R17 + Advance Renderer)\n- .c4d (Cinema 4D R17 + Vray)\n- .blend (Blender 2.80 + Cycles)\n- .fbx","imageAlt":"Semi truck with white trailer 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/car/semi-truck-with-white-trailer","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/viEubRH7VNm4yb3gdGhrdWxw/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/tr2x_027-3d-model.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/viEubRH7VNm4yb3gdGhrdWxw/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/tr2x_027-3d-model.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/car/semi-truck-with-white-trailer","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"car","subcategorySlug":"car","categoryTitle":"Car","subcategoryTitle":"Standard","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2545043/a937e9758d/semi-truck-with-white-trailer-3d-model-a937e9758d.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6199872","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6199872,"title":"Volvo XC90 2025 with interior","price":99.0,"description":"Detailed exterior and interior.\n\nDoors and trunk can be opened.\n\n3ds max 2014 and vray 3,5 scene with lighting and rendering setup included.\n\nBlender scene with model and materials only.\n\nC4d scene with model only and very simple materials only.\n\nExported formats with simple materials: obj and fbx (both in two resolutions). Please note that after import exchange formats like obj or fbx to your software, model may need addinational work like changing materials, adding textures or adding subdivision surface.\n\npolycount:\n\nuncallopsed - 460 000 poly,\n\ncallopsed (obj, fbx hi-version): 3 800 000 poly / 7 400 000 tris","imageAlt":"3D Volvo XC90 2025","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/suv/volvo-xc90-2025-49411adb-3b56-4dfa-b999-1edfb96561c5","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/p3ilrwou2fdqk7dkt3szkd2h4vr3/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/00a.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/p3ilrwou2fdqk7dkt3szkd2h4vr3/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/00a.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/suv/volvo-xc90-2025-49411adb-3b56-4dfa-b999-1edfb96561c5","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"car","subcategorySlug":"suv","categoryTitle":"Car","subcategoryTitle":"SUV","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6199872/fdd0c0b84c/volvo-xc90-2025-with-interior-3d-model-fdd0c0b84c.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6957218","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6957218,"title":"Cartoon City","price":489.0,"description":"**KEY HIGHLIGHTS**  \n\nA huge animated city built from over 600 unique city assets, city characters pack (1400 assets), day/night cycle, character and vehicle movement system.           \n\n### **KEY FEATURES**  \n\n- **Demo Scene** - the city you see in the images and video       \n- **City Characters Pack:** 300 prepared 3D characters of various ages, body types, and skin tones, 1100+ clothing assets, customization tool, movement controller, animations, facial expressions, 100+ props, animals, icons. More detailed description: https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/human-anatomy/city-characters         \n- **Over 600 Unique City Assets:** pack includes over 600 unique assets for building the city: buildings of various themes, purposes, and sizes, infrastructure, landscape, public spaces, props, landmarks, banners, and sports facilities. It also includes 60 vehicles: watercraft (liner, yachts, boats), trains (regular and high-speed), cars, special vehicles, buses, and trucks. One asset can consist of several meshes      \n- **Day-Night City**     \n- **Urban Traffic Movement System.** Traffic move along curves     \n- **Urban Character Movement System.** Characters move along curves       \n- **Animals:** over 30 animated animals      \n- **2D Icons.** All assets have icons      \n- **Works on URP, HDRP, and Built-in (Unity)**. Separate files for versions 2021+ and 6000+     \n- **Designed for performance:** optimized meshes, minimal textures and simple shaders – runs smoothly on mobile, VR/AR, PC and consoles      \n- **Wide range of file formats**        \n- **Free updates and technical support** available in our Discord Community    \n\n### **DEMO SCENE**      \nThe demo scene represents a huge city consisting of several districts:      \nRegular, China-Town, Futuristic, Ecological, Suburban,\nand interesting areas and landmarks:\nObservatory, Park, Beach, Ferris Wheel, Roller Coasters, Water Park, Museum, Zoo, Skate Park, Yacht Marina, Factory, and much more.      \nThe pack uses our standard road modules, allowing you to combine this pack with other cities.     \nBuildings do not have interiors. Interiors for the city buildings are planned as a separate pack.     \nBuildings have separate meshes for creating evening lighting from the windows.     \nThe city covers an area of 1,500 square meters.       \n\n\n### **FILES**       \nYou’ll be able to download formats such as Unity Package, UE, Blender, C4D, Maya, 3DSMax, FBX, OBJ, GLTF, and STL.      \n\n### **COMPATIBILITY**  \n\n- Blender 3.6+   \n- Unity 2021.3+    \n- Unity 6000+      \n- Unreal Engine 4.20+   \n- Unreal Engine 5.0+   \n- Godot Engine 3.4+   \n\n### **TECHNICAL INFO**  \n\nGeometry: 2070 unique assets, 2,865K triangles (entire pack)    \nGeometry City: 660 unique assets, 1,315K triangles    \nGeometry Characters: 1410 unique assets, 1,550K triangles    \nCharacter Polygons: ~5.6K    \nScale: Real-world size     \nMaterials: 57 total    \nTextures: 51 total    \nRig: Humanoid (Mixamo-compatible)    \nAnimations: Yes    \nCollision: Yes    \n\n### **SUPPORT**   \n\nFree updates and technical support: https://discord.com/invite/jxrQM8hXnd  \n\nWe would love to hear from you: support@ithappystudios.com    \nWe aim to respond within 24 hours.  \n\n*Leave a review to help us improve and expand this character pack further! Your projects are the reason we create 3D models. We genuinely care about how you use our work, and we'd love to hear your thoughts on the pack.*  \n\n---  \n\n### **FOLLOW US**  \n\nNew packs coming out, updates, promotions, tutorials:  \nDISCORD - https://discord.com/invite/jxrQM8hXnd  \nYOUTUBE - https://www.youtube.com/@ithappystudios","imageAlt":"3D model animated Cartoon City","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/cartoon-city-bd838fd0-70be-400a-879c-39d4c12bc7c6","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/keuj0kcxv4ojvpx28i93rqyiff65/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CGT_Cartoon%20City%20Preview.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/keuj0kcxv4ojvpx28i93rqyiff65/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CGT_Cartoon%20City%20Preview.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/cartoon-city-bd838fd0-70be-400a-879c-39d4c12bc7c6","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":true},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"cityscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Cityscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6957218/1dadcee3fd/cartoon-city-3d-model-1dadcee3fd.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4035866","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4035866,"title":"Amusement Park","price":89.0,"description":"Amusement Park features 327 unique low-poly 3D models designed for creating lively amusement park scenes. The pack includes a ready-to-use demo scene and offers a wide variety of rides, decorations, and props. Perfect for games, VR/AR experiences, advertising, and 3D printing. All models are optimized for game engines and maintain a consistent, stylized art style.\n\n---  \n\n### **KEY FEATURES**  \n\n- **327 unique assets** that offer limitless possibilities for creating unique locations. You can arrange landscapes, buildings, and structures in a way that makes the location interesting and exciting.    \n- **The Demo Scene:** Ready for use in your projects, saving you valuable time. You can use it or create your own unique environment.  \n- **Multi-purpose Usage:** Ideal for games, animations, VR/AR interior design apps, advertising, and 3D printing.  \n- **Consistent Art Style:** Almost all of our asset packs are stylistically compatible.\n- **No Need to Create Unique Unwraps:** A universal PNG texture is used, significantly reducing memory usage.     \nhttps://ithappystudios.com/blog/uv-unwrapping-how-to-do-it-easily-and-quickly/     \n\n### **COMPATIBLE 3D MODEL PACKS**  \nThese packs will look great together:   \nCute Characters - https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/anatomy/characters-5-07      \nCreative Characters - https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/anatomy/creative-characters     \nCity - https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/tile-pack-city-3d-low-poly    \nMegacity - https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/megacity   \n\n### **PACK CONTENT**  \n\n- **Demo Scene**     \n- **327 Low-Poly 3D Models:**    \n  - **Landscape (x20):** Mountain, hill, plain, ground, water, stones, etc.    \n  - **Buildings (x70):** Castle, café, stage, bridge, stairs, circus tent, marquee, arch, stall, coffee shop, ice cream shop, monument, fountain.    \n  - **Amusement (x24):** Pirate ship, roller coaster, Ferris wheel, catapult, loop, pendulum, airplanes, chains, mugs, trampoline, horses, electric cars, balloon, rocket, dinosaurs.    \n  - **Props (x184):** Candy cart, lamppost, gate, fence, umbrella, chair, table, barrel, vase, parapet, bench, lanterns, decorations, etc.    \n  - **Vegetation (x29):** Tree, palm tree, bush, decorative bush.   \n\n\n### **FILES**       \nYou’ll be able to download formats such as Unity Package, UE, Blender, C4D, Maya, 3DSMax, FBX, OBJ, GLTF, and STL.      \n\n**COMPATIBILITY**  \nThe pack works starting from Blender version 3.3 and all later versions.  \n- Unity Engine 2021.3+    \n- Unreal Engine 4.20+   \n- Godot Engine 3.4+   \n- Roblox    \n\n### **TECHNICAL INFO**  \n\n- **Polygon Count:** 392K triangles all pack  \n- **Scale:** Real-world-size  \n- **Materials:** All models use 2 materials (color, emission)  \n- **Textures:** All models use 1 texture (as a color palette). \n  - Resolution: 1024 px.  \n\n### **SUPPORT**  \nFree updates and technical support: https://discord.com/invite/jxrQM8hXnd  \nWe would love to hear from you: support@ithappystudios.com    \nWe aim to respond within 24 hours.  \n\n*Leave a review to help us improve and expand this pack further! Your projects are the reason we create 3D models. We genuinely care about how you use our work, and we'd love to hear your thoughts on the pack.*  \n\n---  \n\n### **FOLLOW US**  \nNew packs coming out, updates, promotions, tutorials:  \nDISCORD - https://discord.com/invite/jxrQM8hXnd  \nYOUTUBE - https://www.youtube.com/@ithappystudios","imageAlt":"Amusement Park 3D model animated","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/amusement-park-1-8ae9b4e3-ca2b-4ef9-a9df-17ece66d9505","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/hlihvskce99jd02maky5yrlor0ao/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Amusement%20Park%20Preview.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/hlihvskce99jd02maky5yrlor0ao/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Amusement%20Park%20Preview.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/cityscape/amusement-park-1-8ae9b4e3-ca2b-4ef9-a9df-17ece66d9505","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":true},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"cityscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Cityscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4035866/4d7053317e/amusement-park-3d-model-4d7053317e.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5521813","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5521813,"title":"Apple iPhone 16 Pro 2024 - 4 Colors - HQ 3D Model","price":17.99,"description":"**Apple iPhone 16 Pro - 4 Colors - 2024**\n\nThis Model is intended as a high quality resource for photo realistic vizualisation.\nIncluding all 4 current colorways: Desert Titanium, Natural Titanium, White Titanium and Black Titanium,.\n\n1:1 Scale, base model created in Rhino (included)\n\nComes fully textured and ready to render for:\n\n**- Cinema 4D 2024 + Redshift**\nNative high quality Redshift materials, custom textures and a basic stage.\n\n**- Blender 4.2.0**\nNative high quality materials, custom textures and a basic stage. Mainly created for use with Cycles.\n\nFurther formats that come without textures:\n\n\n- **FBX**\n- **OBJ** \n- **STP (NURBS)**\n- **RHINO 6 (NURBS)**\n\n\nMore info:\n- C4D and BLEND files allow easy modification of all materials\n- Properly sorted and grouped\n- Unit: mm\n\nEnjoy!","imageAlt":"Apple iPhone 16 Pro 2024 - 4 Colors - HQ 3D","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/phone/apple-iphone-16-pro-2024-4-colors-hq-3d-model","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cPj2rZMp9WFgGJza7rBTMKx4/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/APPLE_iPhone%2016%20Pro_HERO%2001.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cPj2rZMp9WFgGJza7rBTMKx4/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/APPLE_iPhone%2016%20Pro_HERO%2001.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/phone/apple-iphone-16-pro-2024-4-colors-hq-3d-model","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":72,"name":".stp","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":13,"name":".3dm","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"electronics","subcategorySlug":"phone","categoryTitle":"Electronics","subcategoryTitle":"Phone","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5521813/ceb1970948/apple-iphone-16-pro-2024-4-colors-hq-3d-model-3d-model-ceb1970948.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"1840787","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":1840787,"title":"Base Meshes Character Starter Kit","price":20.0,"description":"**Includes 23 the most basic character meshes set and advanced  rigged for Blender to help increase your productivity! A good base mesh allows you to save time with good proportions, clean topology and clean paint weight.**\n\n**Update Log V2.9:**\n\n- Fix Rig UI didn't display on Blender Version 4.x. File on folder \"Blender4x\n\nFeatures:\n- Full advanced rigged for 8 Character at Blender\n- 3 variation male character (superhero, basic \u0026 anime style)\n- 3 variation female character (superhero, basic \u0026 anime style)\n- 2 Nendoroid style character\n- 13 difference part (3 foot, 6 hand, 1 Nendoroid head, 2 Nendoroid hand \u0026 1 Nendoroid foot)\n- 100% quads, clean topology, subdivision ready\n- Symmetrical with the origin point at the center of the grid floor (ready for mirroring)\n- Low polygon count (good for games and retopologizing after sculpting)\n\n**Tutorial Change Meshes inside the zip file**\n\nNote: Models are not have shape key apply.","imageAlt":"3D asset rigged Base Meshes Character Starter Kit","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/other/base-meshs-character-starter-kit","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/GuazDtdX6wqSuwYCf23QjZU5/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Cover.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/GuazDtdX6wqSuwYCf23QjZU5/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Cover.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/other/base-meshs-character-starter-kit","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":119,"name":".py","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"other","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Other","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/1840787/555593ce03/base-meshes-character-starter-kit-3d-model-555593ce03.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3095409","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3095409,"title":"Hot air balloon model","price":49.0,"description":"- model of Hot air balloon with detailed basket and 6 different liveries (psd files included)\n- every object has material's name, you can easily change or apply materials\n\n.\n.\n.\n\nmax format:\nRar archive contains:\n1. 3ds max 2011 with vray materials, which you can see in preview images studio renders. Carpaint colour can be slightly different. Lighting and render setup included but render results can be different because photoshop was used to correct contrast, brightness, saturation etc..\n\n2. 3ds max 2011 with simple standard materials scanline\nJust put into your scene and render!\nIn each scene model is provided with mesh smooth modifier on stack on objects that need it. Mesh smooth is set 1 or 2 for renders. \n.\n\n.blend format:\nBlender 2.9.1 with Cycles/Eevee materials, which you can see in preview images in outdoor renders. Render scene not included.\n.\n\n.obj format:\nRar archive contains two versions of model:\n1. Exported without collapsing after mesh smooth. Low or med poly mesh which you can see in preview images, good if you need to edit model.\n2. Exported after appllying mesh smooth. Just import, apply materials and render\nSimple materials, textures may have to be added manually.\n.\n\n.lwo, .c4d format:\nRar archive contains model exported without collapsing after mesh smooth. Low or med poly mesh which you can see in preview images, good if you need to edit model.\nSimple materials, textures may have to be added manually. In Cinema 4D some elements may have to be optimized.\n.\n\n.fbx and 3ds format:\n\nRar archive contains model exported after appllying mesh smooth. Just import, apply materials and render.\n\nSimple materials, textures may have to be added manually.\n.\n\n.stl format:\nRar archive contains model in two resolutions. Geometry only.\n.\n.\n\nPolycount:\n\nwithout meshsmooth max,obj,lwo,c4d, blend: 680 000 polygons\n\ncollapsed fbx,3ds,obj: 2 80 000 faces/  1 600 000 polygons","imageAlt":"Hot air balloon model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/aircraft/other/hot-air-balloon-model-ebe61fcf-d93c-4cb0-9a74-54f6216c5127","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/kAfEtWZLGz3pQCmCHbfetUZn/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/HotAirBaloon_00a.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/kAfEtWZLGz3pQCmCHbfetUZn/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/HotAirBaloon_00a.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/aircraft/other/hot-air-balloon-model-ebe61fcf-d93c-4cb0-9a74-54f6216c5127","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":8,"name":".lwo","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":2,"name":".3ds","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"aircraft","subcategorySlug":"other","categoryTitle":"Aircraft","subcategoryTitle":"Other","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3095409/913b41b60b/hot-air-balloon-model-3d-model-913b41b60b.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3110098","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3110098,"title":"control panel full pack","price":39.0,"description":"- Complete control panel that includes 8 models.\n- Packages number one and two are also available.\n- Models are based on actual model references.\n- Includes formats OBJ , FBX, max2018\n- The main body has a texture with 4K resolution\n- The models have very clean and accurate polygons\n- Models have subdivisions. I put a different save for you that also has a modifier.\n- Models and materials prepared for 3dsmax software and Vray rendering engine.\n- Contact me for help and troubleshooting.","imageAlt":"3D model control panel full pack","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/other/control-panel-full-pack","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/uSCQvC74Pzk71oH9VTBh8Jvt/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/625x625cgtraderr.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/uSCQvC74Pzk71oH9VTBh8Jvt/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/625x625cgtraderr.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/electronics/other/control-panel-full-pack","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"electronics","subcategorySlug":"other","categoryTitle":"Electronics","subcategoryTitle":"Other","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3110098/b06c6b8e66/control-panel-full-pack-3d-model-b06c6b8e66.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2645777","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2645777,"title":"Cyberpunk Samurai Character","price":29.99,"description":"Fully rigged and game ready Cyberpunk Samurai character.\n\n**Features:**\n\n- Fully compatible with Epic skeleton and Epic's starter animation pack.\n- Live Link Face support with fully working Morph Targets / Blendshapes.\n- Separated character parts (arm, bag, hair, hand, head, helmet, jacket, leg \u0026 torso,).\n- Includes assault rifle \u0026 katana weapon.\n- Customizable clothes \u0026 helmet color.\n\nRigged: Yes\n\nRigged to Epic skeleton: Yes\n\nIf rigged to the Epic skeleton, IK bones are included: Yes\n\nAnimated: No\n\nNumber of characters: 1 in 9 parts\n\nVertex counts of characters: 22,587\n\nNumber of Materials and Material Instances: 5\n\nNumber of Textures: 18\n\nTexture Resolutions:\n\n- 2K Assault Rifle Texture (Base Color, Normal \u0026 OcclusionRoughnessMetallic)\n- 4K Body Texture (Base Color, Normal, OcclusionRoughnessMetallic, Emissive \u0026 Mask)\n- 2K Hair Texture (Base Color \u0026 Normal)\n- 4K Head Texture (Base Color, Normal, OcclusionRoughnessMetallic, Emissive \u0026 Mask)\n- 2K Katana (Base Color, Normal \u0026 OcclusionRoughnessMetallic)\n\nSupported Development Platforms: Windows\nSupported Software: Blender \u0026 Unreal Engine","imageAlt":"Cyberpunk Samurai Character 3D model rigged","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/cyberpunk-samurai-b8e855bc-ec2b-4c32-93be-53504b645557","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/KfyujWZMf9EcJ4ZKk6nhRsAs/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Preview1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/KfyujWZMf9EcJ4ZKk6nhRsAs/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Preview1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/sci-fi-character/cyberpunk-samurai-b8e855bc-ec2b-4c32-93be-53504b645557","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":185,"name":".mat","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"sci-fi-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Sci-Fi","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2645777/7363c59b8e/cyberpunk-samurai-character-3d-model-7363c59b8e.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4133465","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4133465,"title":"Trash Kit - 3D AssetKit","price":29.0,"description":"**Trash Kit - 3D AssetKit**\n\n\nRealistic trash needs variety. With this AssetKit package over 700 single assets are at your disposal to get just that - Photorealistic Trash, Garbage, Rubble, you name it.\n\nThe assets are usable in any 3D Package and are as optimized as possible while preserving managable polygon count and shape. You are free to use them in your 3D scenes, VFX and Games, change them to your liking or kitbash and scatter them in every way that comes to your mind.\n\nYou are free to pick from 18 different categories from tiny cigarettes and dry grass to large props containing multiple sub-assets. Each category contains between 8 and 61 props so you have enough material even when filling up vast spaces. \n\nManual set dressing offers the most control and is fun with these assets. However nobody wants to scatter everything by hand, therefore Trash Biomes are available for the Blender Addon GeoScatter, which is amazing for professional scatterers. If you want to scatter with Blender On-Board-Tools - no problem, I got you covered too. There is a Geometry NodesSetup included that might be helpful for you. Find the GeoNodes tutorial at the end of the asset video.\n\nEverything is ready to render with Blender Cycles and EEVEE. Of course you can use it with any renderer you prefer. The urban environment example scene from the video will be included in case you want to try out the assets there.\n\nAs you can see in the wireframe renders the assets are fairly low poly for the level of detail. For import in Game Engines I have included seperate files with the meshes triangulated and located in the origin. (“*_TriangulatedAtOrigin”, FBX Pack)\n\nAll textures are PBR based and HighRes. You will also find two HDR environments used in the previs renderings included. Textures are in PBR Metal/Roughness workflow.\n\nPlease have a look at the renderings and see if assets and wireframe suit your needs.\n\n\n\n**Blender GeoScatter Addon - Biomes Available**\n\nThe Kit has preset Biomes for the amazing Blender addon GeoScatter. Add the \"TrashKit.blend\" to your Blender Asset Libraries in the Preferences. Now from GeoScatter you can install the included .scatpack file like any other ScatPack.\n\n\n**-Content-**\n\n**Scenes:**\n-     TrashKit ( 715 Assets )\n-     TrashKit_TriangulatedAtOrigin ( for instance based workflow or Game Engines)\n\n**Meshes:**\n-     Base_Trash_Assets (61 Variations)\n-     Grass_Assets (16 Variations)\n-     Rubble_Assets (31 Variations)\n-     Cans (Beverage and Food) (65 Variations)\n-     Cans_Paint_Assets (48 Variations)\n-     Bottles_Assets (43 Variations)\n-     Generic_Trash_Assets (83 Variations)\n-     Wood_Splinter_Assets (34 Variations)\n-     Buckets_Assets (32 Variations)\n-     Bags_Assets (32 Variations)\n-     Boxes_Assets (74 Variations)\n-     Smokables_Assets (40 Variations)\n-     Barrels_Assets (38 Variations)\n-     Tires_Assets (10 Variations)\n-     Prefabs_Medium_Assets (53 Variations)\n-     Prefabs_Large_Assets (9 Variations)\n-     Prefabs_SmallTrash_Assets (6 Variations)\n-     Additional_Assets (42 Variations)\n\n**Textures:**\n-     BaseColor / Albedo\n-     Normal GL\n-     Normal DX\n-     Roughness - PBR Metal/Roughness Workflow\n-     Metallic - wherever necessary\n-     Masks for Opacity\n\n**Textures additional:**\n\n-     Example scene textures\n-     HDR Environment - 2 Variants\n\n**Blender Utility:**\n\n-     Geometry Nodes Setup “TrashKit_GeoNodes”. A Tutorial you will find in the Trashkit Video\n\n\nEnjoy rendering!\n\n","imageAlt":"VR / AR ready Trash Kit - 3D AssetKit","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/various/various-models/trashkit-3d-assetkit","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/BAHg92eWqthCe1wd4ozztNAu/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Garbage_CGT.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/BAHg92eWqthCe1wd4ozztNAu/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Garbage_CGT.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/various/various-models/trashkit-3d-assetkit","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"various","subcategorySlug":"various-models","categoryTitle":"Various","subcategoryTitle":"Various models","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4133465/cd2fa9b34e/trash-kit-3d-assetkit-3d-model-cd2fa9b34e.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2309077","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2309077,"title":"ARMS - 33 Creature arms OBJs and Zbrush IMM","price":20.0,"description":"**33 High poly sculpts: Arms ZBrush subtool \u0026 IMM Brush.**\n\nSuper timesaver and idea generator - quickly spice up 3D sculpting/designing/concepting, or even augment and change existing sculpts.  Included is a Zbrush insert mesh brush housing all of the arms, a Zbrush master file with all the arms as separate subtools ,  FBX and OBJ files. These are untextured high poly sculpts. \n\nAll have been decimated as much as possible without sacrificing detail.\n\nHere is a video demonstrating how I like to use it:  https://youtu.be/e3WZJtJg698\n\nI learnt quite a bit making this one, and am very happy to finally release it!\n\nMade with Zbrush 2020.1. Please note the example biped/humanoid creatures are not included - this pack is 33 high quality arms. \n\n#arms #creature #character #characterdesign #creaturedesign #kitbash #nails #limbs #claws #hands #fingers #sculpt","imageAlt":"3D model ARMS - 33 Creature arms OBJs and Zbrush","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/arms-33-creature-arms-zbrush-imm","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wCKoFPW47BvjSnrUD9N7B7Fh/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/ARMS_producthutmbnail_square.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wCKoFPW47BvjSnrUD9N7B7Fh/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/ARMS_producthutmbnail_square.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/arms-33-creature-arms-zbrush-imm","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"fantasy-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Fantasy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2309077/61bd13f03b/arms-33-creature-arms-objs-and-zbrush-imm-3d-model-61bd13f03b.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6021323","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6021323,"title":"Mega Pack 203 Medical Equipment High Quality","price":199.0,"description":"**NOTE: I've recently received inquiries from several customers regarding missing download files. This could be due to an error or the files being too large. Please contact me to receive the missing files. Thank you.\n\n**Mega Pack 203 Medical Equipment High Quality: It took us more than 800 hours to complete these 3D models. I truly hope they’ll serve you well — and that you’ll feel great about the $299 investment.**\n- Actual value over $4000 if purchased individually – only $299 for the complete bundle!\n\n- This is a high-quality 3D model designed for professional use in visualization, animation, and design workflows. Built with clean quad-based topology and optimized for subdivision, this model provides detailed geometry suitable for close-up renders and high-end projects.\n ******\n- Hello, I’m Frezzy, founder of Cgivn Studio. Since 2013, we’ve been creating professional 3D models to serve a wide range of creative and commercial needs.\n- We’re on an exciting journey to create 100,000 high-quality 3D models and more, and we’re picking up speed.\n- Every 3D model you use from us directly supports the creation of the next – helping us build better, more accessible, and more cost-effective assets for you in the future.\n\n**LIST MODELS:**\n- 36 Models Diagnostic Equipment\n- 16 Models Medical Supplies\n- 13 Models Miscellaneous Equipment\n- 10 Models Ophthalmic Equipment\n- 33 Models Patient Care Equipment\n- 10 Models Rehabilitation Equipment\n- 5 Models Sterilization and Hygiene Equipment\n- 9 Models Storage and Organization Equipment\n- 14 Models Surgical Equipment\n- 21 Models Transport and Mobility Equipment\n- 36 Models Treatment Equipment\n\n**FEATURE HIGHLIGHTS:**\n- High-quality polygonal model created by experienced 3D artists\n- Clean, subdivision-ready geometry with optimized resolution\n- Scene setup in 3ds Max with V-Ray – matches preview render results\n- Objects are logically named and well-organized for easy scene management\n- No name conflicts when importing multiple models\n- No cleaning required – simply import and start rendering\n- No special plugin needed to open or use the model\n- Preview images are rendered using the included V-Ray scene setup (lighting and camera setup not included in exported files).\n\n**FILE FORMATS INCLUDED:**\n- 3ds Max 2018 + V-Ray 5 – Native format\n- 3ds Max 2018 – Standard materials\n- FBX\n- OBJ\n- Maya 2018\n- Cinema 4D R12\n- Blender 2.91\n\n**HELP \u0026 TIPS:**\n- Can’t extract the file? Try using the latest version of WinRAR\n- Want smoother surfaces? Apply a subdivision modifier (e.g., TurboSmooth in 3ds Max)\n- Using older software versions? Import via FBX or OBJ\n- Cinema 4D users: Use HyperNURBS (Catmull-Clark) to apply subdivision\n- Feel free to contact us if you run into any issues — we're here to help!\n- Thank you for supporting and using Cgivn Products and services","imageAlt":"3D model Mega Pack 203 Medical Equipment High Quality","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/mega-pack-203-medical-equipment-high-quality","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cm5uq31fzzns3oi0oali9v05szzh/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/000_Mega%20Pack%20203%20Medical%20Equipment%203D%20Models_1200x900.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/cm5uq31fzzns3oi0oali9v05szzh/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/000_Mega%20Pack%20203%20Medical%20Equipment%203D%20Models_1200x900.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/mega-pack-203-medical-equipment-high-quality","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"science","subcategorySlug":"medical","categoryTitle":"Science","subcategoryTitle":"Medical","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6021323/83309c196b/mega-pack-203-medical-equipment-high-quality-3d-model-83309c196b.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5272212","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5272212,"title":"Mercedes eActros 600 with trailer","price":159.0,"description":"- detailed exterior and cabin interior\n\n- cabin doors can be opened\n\n- every object has material's name, you can easily change or apply materials,\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\nmax format:\n\nRar archive contains:\n\n1. 3ds max 2014 with vray materials, which you can see in preview images studio renders. Carpaint colour can be slightly different. Lighting and render setup included but render results can be different because photoshop was used to correct contrast, brightness, saturation etc.. but Photoshop CS6 macro file (.atn) for post production is also included.\n\n2. 3ds max 2014 with simple standard materials scanline\n\nJust put into your scene and render!\n\nIn each scene model is provided with mesh smooth modifier on stack on objects that need it. Mesh smooth is set 1 or 2 for renders. Exterior and wheels are in different layers.\n\n.\n\n.blend format:\n\nBlender 3.4 with Cycles/Eevee materials, which you can see in preview images in outdoor renders. Render scene not included, only car model.\n\n.\n\n.obj .fbx format:\n\nRar archive contains two versions of model:\n\n1. Exported without collapsing after mesh smooth. Low or med poly mesh which you can see in preview images, good if you need to edit model.\n\n2. Exported after appllying mesh smooth. Just import, apply materials and render\n\nSimple materials, textures may have to be added manually.\n\n.\n\n.c4d format:\n\nRar archive contains model exported without collapsing after mesh smooth. Low or med poly mesh which you can see in preview images, good if you need to edit model.\n\nSimple materials, textures may have to be added manually.\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n\n\n\nPolycount (semi-truck):\n\nwithout meshsmooth max,obj,c4d: 800 000 polygons\n\ncollapsed fbx,obj: 9 600 000 faces/ 4 900 000 polygons\n\nPolycount (trailer):\n\nwithout meshsmooth max,obj,c4d: 260 000 polygons\n\ncollapsed fbx,obj: 1 600 000 faces/ 800 000 polygons","imageAlt":"3D Mercedes eActros 600 with trailer","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/mercedes-eactros-600-with-trailer","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/9aJLCkpYN1ooNybXAFXXhdcS/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Mercedes_eActros_00a.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/9aJLCkpYN1ooNybXAFXXhdcS/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Mercedes_eActros_00a.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/mercedes-eactros-600-with-trailer","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"vehicle","subcategorySlug":"truck","categoryTitle":"Vehicle","subcategoryTitle":"Truck","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5272212/6c35730887/mercedes-eactros-600-with-trailer-3d-model-6c35730887.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6820082","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6820082,"title":"Steam Ship Collection","price":79.0,"description":"A collection of 8 Steam ship vessels based on European vessels of the late 19th and early 20th century.\n \nAll models are original and have been built in Blender strictly using quad polygons and have been built to a real world metric scale.\nThe Materials used on the models are basic and are only native to the .Blend file.\nThe ships do not have any interiors modeled and the models have no UV Maps.\nEach model include a .Blend file .OBJ and .FBX file.\n\nPLEASE NOTE:    NO textures and UV mapping are used on these models. \n\nThanks very much for looking. \n","imageAlt":"3D Steam Ship Collection","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/watercraft/historic-watercraft/steam-ship-collection-7314ff33-3ac2-4a51-a2f5-6cc55723e585","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/lqmfsckfwmxpw1yefvtg9xobek5g/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/shippic10.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/lqmfsckfwmxpw1yefvtg9xobek5g/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/shippic10.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/watercraft/historic-watercraft/steam-ship-collection-7314ff33-3ac2-4a51-a2f5-6cc55723e585","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"watercraft","subcategorySlug":"historic-watercraft","categoryTitle":"Watercraft","subcategoryTitle":"Historic","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6820082/252f3c689b/steam-ship-collection-3d-model-252f3c689b.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6432773","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6432773,"title":"SR - Starships PACK","price":125.0,"description":"**Attention:** THOSE MODELS ARE NOT INTENDED FOR 3D PRINTING, NO Stl files included. This package contains 8 Original Spacecrafts.\n\n1 **SF Cruiser SR2** Polycount: Polys: 10.632 tris: 22.104\n\n1 **SF Dreadnought SR3** Polycount: Polys: 14.473 tris: 28.558\n\n1 **SF Frigate SR4** Polycount: Polys: 7.160 tris: 13.752\n\n1 **SF Destroyer SR5** Polycount: Polys: 13.263 tris: 25.794\n\n1 **SF Cargo SR6** Polycount: Polys: 6.745 tris: 12.654\n\n1 **SF Battleship SR7** Polycount: Polys: 12.342 tris: 24.186\n\n1 **SF Fighter SR8** Polycount: Polys: 3.176 tris: 5.998\n\n1 **SF Bomber SR9** Polycount: Polys: 4.160 tris: 7.700\n\n**Included:**\n\n8 Models in 3D Max 2014 _(Those versions comes with a basic albedo material, you will have to configure this PBR material according to the Render engine you are going to use)._\n\n8 Models in .FBX format (multi format) with no linked elements, this is because not all softwares such as Blender, Maya, 3D Max, Lightwave, Unity, Unreal and others do not interpret the linked elements in the same way, you will have to link these elements with your preferred software.\n\n8 Models in .FBX format With Linked elements (multi format).\n\n8 Models in .OBJ format (multi format).\n\n_These files/format can be imported into the vast majority of your favorite Softwares (Best recommended is FBX Format): 3Ds MAX / Maya / Lightwave / Cinema 4D / Blender / Daz 3D / Sketchup / Unity / Unreal Engine, and more (Depending on the software you use, you will have to reconfigure the materials.)_\n\n**Weapons:** Laser turrets are separated parts, properly linked. Missile included (see previews)\n\n**Textures included:**\n\n3 color variations / **PBR Materials** (see previews)\n\n2048x2048 / 4096x4096 maps, Albedo maps / Diffuse maps / Normal maps / Glow (Emission) maps / Roughness maps / Metallic maps / AO maps\n\n**Weapons** have 2048x2048 Maps\n\n**1 Texture colors mask** included (each ones), you can use these mask to create infinite color combinations.\n\n**Included 4096x4096 / 2048x2048 PSD files**, you can customize colors, add your own logos, remove or add dirts,add your own decals \u0026 more. The previews images was done with **Marmoset Toolbag**, files included.","imageAlt":"3D model PBR SR - Starships PACK","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/space/spaceship/sr-starships-pack","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gri