ter\n\nEnjoy and have a nice day!","imageAlt":"New Balance 9060 3D asset","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/clothing/new-balance-9060","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/2gxz0mopql402pj11xdkxvlxzb8h/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/CGT_PREVIEW.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/2gxz0mopql402pj11xdkxvlxzb8h/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/CGT_PREVIEW.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/clothing/new-balance-9060","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":25,"name":".dae","is_native":false},{"id":104,"name":".abc","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":189,"name":".ply","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":2,"name":".3ds","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"clothing","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Clothing","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6597441/4ee8a75563/new-balance-9060-3d-model-4ee8a75563.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2566055","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2566055,"title":"Plants collection 357","price":19.0,"description":"High quality 3d models Plants collection 357\nA unique collection of plants can be used for exterior and interiors\n\nFormats\n\n3ds max 2013  V-ray 4.0  Corona render 4.0  Default Scanline\n\nFBX           V-ray      Corona render      Default Scanline\n\nOBJ           Standard materials\n\nCinema4D   Standard\n\nBlender Cycles\n","imageAlt":"3D model Plants collection 357","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/plant/pot-plant/plants-collection-357","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/rTbYNAWErpovdenPqkYS29Pf/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/plant_357_01.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/rTbYNAWErpovdenPqkYS29Pf/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/plant_357_01.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/plant/pot-plant/plants-collection-357","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"plant","subcategorySlug":"pot-plant","categoryTitle":"Plant","subcategoryTitle":"Pot Plant","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2566055/b400944f96/plants-collection-357-3d-model-b400944f96.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":true,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"1862971","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":1862971,"title":"Background Birds Pigeon Flock Updated V5 -Animated - Low Poly","price":30.0,"description":"This asset contains a simplified and animated flock of Low Poly pigeons. Intended for efficient use in film or visualization as a perfect background detail to bring your scene to life and add a sense of scale. It contains Diffuse, Glossiness, Roughness, Alpha and Translucency. All 1024*1024px textures . \n\n**Used in the Steam saga A Whisper In The Twilight**\n\nAnimation:\nIn 1200 frames the flock circles the space in an irregular path, each bird with subtle variations, loopable. \n25 Bones per bird.\n\nAssets:\nThere are 7 birds containing 220 faces (374 tris) each. \nPathControl (parent). Also contains a flight path preview mesh.\nBirdsComponent (child). Stationary until contrained to parent.\n\nSubdivision smoothing: \nMaya use Catmull-Clark UV smoothing method. \nBlender, do not smooth UVs\n\nTested and working in Blender, Maya, 3DS max, Unity, Unreal Engine, Cinema 4D. \n\nGame Engines:\nTwo files are provided. BirdsLoopedForGames.fbx 370 frames, PathCtrlLoopedForGames.fbx 1200 frames. The birds ctrl should be made a child of the paths ctrl in your software. \nUnity 2020 Package included (update coming soon). \nUnreal 5, use unique bone-names fbx.\nGLTF coming soon...","imageAlt":"3D asset Background Birds Pigeon Flock Updated V5 4","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/bird/background-birds-pigeon-flock","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/6h11MgWA4hZrWcLnXzwQTqZp/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/background-birds-pigeon-flock-3d-model-low-poly-animated-rigged-fbx-abc.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/6h11MgWA4hZrWcLnXzwQTqZp/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/background-birds-pigeon-flock-3d-model-low-poly-animated-rigged-fbx-abc.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/bird/background-birds-pigeon-flock","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"bird","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Bird","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/1862971/d2e2c28551/background-birds-pigeon-flock-updated-v5-animated-low-poly-3d-model-d2e2c28551.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4707691","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4707691,"title":"Neroli Orange Blossom 3D Model Low Poly","price":19.8,"description":"Update (August 2025)\nEnhanced with normal maps, a roughness map, and refined models.\n\nThank you all for your support! Based on customer feedback requesting more visible bump detail on the flower petals (which was very subtle in the original version), this model has been updated with:\n\n1. Three unique normal maps for the petals, to add variation and enhance close-up realism.\n\n2. A new roughness map for improved surface detail and more accurate shading.\n\n3. Readjusted and refined 3D models across all formats (Blend, FBX, OBJ, glTF), with small artifacts corrected for better quality and compatibility.\n\n(See updated previews rendered in Blender 4.1 with Cycles.)\n\nI hope you enjoy this update! If you have any questions or need assistance with the model, please feel free to contact me—I’m always happy to help.\n\n- Neroli (Orange Blossom) with branches and buds\n- Real world size \n- Created with Blender\n- Textures baked (4K) : base color, normal map\n- UVW mapping\n- Preview rendered with cycles (no post-processing)\n- Blend file including low poly meshes with modifiers (subdiv, solidify \u0026 displace) and simple animations (flowers waggling)\n- The HDRI used in the blend file is \"forest\" , which can be found in blender file path (\\datafiles\\studiolights\\world)\n\n- CREDIT: the leaf textures are modifications of the textures downloaded from Polyhaven","imageAlt":"animated Neroli Orange Blossom 3D Model Low","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/plant/flower/neroli-orange-blossom-3d-model-low-poly","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/jih5s79ub4h3mo5vp3c32fsz7om9/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/neroli_1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/jih5s79ub4h3mo5vp3c32fsz7om9/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/neroli_1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/plant/flower/neroli-orange-blossom-3d-model-low-poly","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":false,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"plant","subcategorySlug":"flower","categoryTitle":"Plant","subcategoryTitle":"Flower","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4707691/51ea35ab83/neroli-orange-blossom-3d-model-low-poly-3d-model-51ea35ab83.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"4895706","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":4895706,"title":"Assault rifles SMG Sniper Rifles DMR  BIG weapon gun pack","price":630.0,"description":"High quality low-poly model  - created as close as possible to the original with exact dimensions, with highly detailed PBR textures(including textures for Unity and UE5 game engines).Game ready model for **PBR game engines, renderers, first Person Shooters, VR games, and your other projects.**\n\n**The modularity and uniqueness of this assembly lies in the fact that all minor parts such as the stock,  flashhider, buffer tube, handguard, pistol grip, silencer, scope, Tactical devices , weaponlight,  vertical grip and magazine have a unique separate texture atlas. You can easily replace one of the parts with another, even leaving only one receiver.**\n\n**And also you can easily replace all suitable modules from one model to another if they are suitable in terms of parameters (butts, tactical grips, pistol grips, silencers, sights, tactical devices**\n\n**additional information and screenshots, see the page of the corresponding model**\n\n**ASSAULT RIFLE**\n1. Tactical Modular assault rifle Mk47 mutant ar-15 modul / tris 55 800 and 28 116 verts / 9 texture atlases / 79 separate parts\n2. Tactical modular assault rifle DS Arms SA 58 FAL / tris 65 658 and 33 782 verts / 11 texture atlases / 85 separate parts\n3. Tactical modular assault rifle Colt M4A1 Custom / tris 62 293 and 31 125 verts / 10 texture atlases / 71 separate parts\n4. Tactical modular assault rifle Rifle Dynamics 704 AK system / 64 815 and 33 098 verts / 10 texture atlases / 63 separate parts\n5. Tactical modular assault rifle FN SCAR-H mk 17 / tris 66 636 and 33 902 verts. / 11 texture atlases / 82 separate parts\n6. Tactical modular assault rifle FN SCAR-L mk 16 / tris 66 158 and 33 659 verts / 12 texture atlases / 82 separate parts\n\n**SNIPER RIFLE**\n1. Tactical Modular sniper rifle HK G28 patrol / tris 59 750 and 30 131 verts/ 10 texture atlases / 57 separate parts\n2. Tactical modular sniper rifle HK G28 / 76 010 and 38 410 verts. / 13 texture atlases / 75 separate parts\n3. Tactical modular sniper rifle MK 18 Mjolnir /tris 72 264 and 36 736 verts / 13 texture atlases / 62 separate parts\n4. Tactical modular sniper rifle Knights Armament SR 25 / tris 58 975 and 29 784 verts. / 13 texture atlases / 60 separate parts\n5. Tactical modular sniper rifle Remington R11 RSASS / tris 58 453 and 29 758 verts. / 13 texture atlases / 57 separate parts\n6. Tactical modular sniper rifle Barrett M107A1 / tris 52 036 and 26 378 verts. / 5 texture atlases / 79 separate parts\n\n**SMG**\n1. Tactical Modular SMG CZ Scorpion EVO 3 A1 / tris 38 032 and 19 197 verts. / 8 texture atlases / 50 separate parts\n2. Tactical SMG TDI Kriss Vector gen2 / tris 44 636 and 23 150 verts. / 8 texture atlases / 53 separate parts\n3. Tactical SMG HK MP7A2 / tris 27 111 and 13 726 verts. / 8 texture atlases / 54 separate parts\n4. Tactical modular custom SMG Sig Sauer MPX / tris 53 383 and 27 046 verts / 14 texture atlases / 60 separate parts\n5. Tactical Modular SMG Brugger and Thomet MP9 / tris 36 106 and 18 318 verts./ 7 texture atlases / 37 separate parts","imageAlt":"Assault rifles SMG Sniper Rifles DMR BIG weapon 3D model 1","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/assault-rifles-smg-sniper-rifles-dmr-big-weapon-gun-pack","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/jUVudrJLHVbB9qXbADgfELay/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/tttaaa.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/jUVudrJLHVbB9qXbADgfELay/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/tttaaa.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-model-packs/assault-rifles-smg-sniper-rifles-dmr-big-weapon-gun-pack","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[],"categorySlug":"military","subcategorySlug":"gun","categoryTitle":"Military","subcategoryTitle":"Gun","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/4895706/80be8d92eb/assault-rifles-smg-sniper-rifles-dmr-big-weapon-gun-pack-3d-model-80be8d92eb.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3280251","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3280251,"title":"Dragon Wyvern","price":45.0,"description":"**DRAGON WYVERN 3D MODEL**\n- Big Update 12/04/2024: New body ratio, better rig and textures, add more animations. \n- Concept designed by HuyKhoi2407.\n- Model scale: 32 meter length and 46 meter wing span.\n- Already basic rigged (WyvernDragon_rigged-no-animation.blend and other animated .blend files) and has animations like the preview video.\n- Animations list: Idling (looped), Crawling (looped), Flying (looped), Take off, Landing, Hit React (looped), Breathing fire (looped), Bite Attack (looped) (.fbx and.blend formats inside DragonWyvern_animated-FBX-Blender.zip files).\n- 1 UDIM non-overlapping UV mapping.\n- Texture maps resolution: 4096x4096 (include Substance Painter file for export other resolutions and modify detail).\n- Polycount: 32660 poly quad mesh (multi-subdivision levels Zbrush file attached).\n- Suitable for both raytracing render and real-time render.\n- The demo animation video and images rendered by Cycles 256 samples (Blender 3.6).\n- If my product not as good as you expected, please send me a message for feedback so I can give you a warranty and improve the quality of the store.\n\n\u003e \nMy new Dragon with more advanced features: \nFin Dragon: https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animals/dinosaur/dragon-d91e97ed-01ce-4b04-a793-767b480b2238\nDreadthorn Dragon: https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/dragon-dc79f600-a6ed-4cf2-88e0-040056842c2a\n","imageAlt":"3D asset Dragon Wyvern","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/wyvern-dragon-fa00f0f2-484c-4c9e-8b22-339818b07057","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/YDSBph61Mi5Xjxu8u9f1EbG4/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/thumb.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/YDSBph61Mi5Xjxu8u9f1EbG4/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/thumb.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/wyvern-dragon-fa00f0f2-484c-4c9e-8b22-339818b07057","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false},{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":127,"name":".usdz","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"fantasy-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Fantasy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3280251/9bacc62c40/dragon-wyvern-3d-model-9bacc62c40.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5169549","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5169549,"title":"Adventure Characters Pack - Survival Survivor RPG Shooter Action","price":349.0,"description":"Time to plunge into the atmosphere of Adventure!\n\nA lot of work has been put into this character package - we have implemented an exceptional number of nice features that you will surely enjoy!Lots of skins, amazing modularity, corrective blendshapes to simulate muscles, several body types (male and female), the ability to exchange clothes between characters, a bunch of accessories and weapons, a demo scene created from scratch with a lot of props for your game, cinematic scene, Control Rig, etc. …we’ll tell you more below :) As always, we are happy to invite you to our Discord channel - there we answer questions and help in working with models. Link: https://discord.gg/Dfh9yqR4tg\n\nAsset pack includes:\n\n- Unreal projects (5.0+), uncensored\n- Unity project (2021.3.35f1), uncensored\n- FBX files - two versions, with full and optimized body parts\n- Textures packages\n\n**How to open an Unreal/Unity project: download all archives with the project and unpack any of them. The contents of the rest will be automatically collected into one folder.**\n\nThis is the first of two Adventure style packages. It includes:\n\n1. Thomas is a basic adventure character.\n2. Christopher is a thug and a bully!\n3. Eva is a sweet basic adventure girl.\n4. Victoria is an urban option. Her bow will help you out more than once!\n5. Jane is a winter option for fighting blizzards.\n\n**Description:**\n\n- Lots of high quality skins - each character includes Basic, Adventure, Survival, Horror skins and several themed ones.\n- Love for details - you can look at individual parts of characters for a long time, such as watches, amulets, hairstyles, etc.\n- Characters have their own set of weapons - pistol, bow, axe, knife, ice pick, as well as a list of accessories\n- Excellent modularity - a lot of layers of clothing allow you to choose the look you want\n- All clothes, hairstyles and accessories are compatible between characters (including top and bottom clothing compatibility) without clipping and other typical problems - create unique combinations!\nNote: to combine some parts of clothing, the use of blendshapes is required (included)\n- Demoscene is included. It contains a lot of high-quality props - we are sure they will be useful in your game!\n- Cinematic scene included - learn the basics of creating cinematic videos with our project!\n- Corrective blendshapes to simulate muscle work - now use extreme animations without any problems. We were the first to use this system on the market and it has greatly improved the quality of animations - we hope you like it!\n- Adjust the size of chest and hips for female characters\n- Adjustable size men's proportions: base, thin, muscular, fat\n- Control Rig is included in the project - animating and changing poses is now easy!\n- Characters include customized IK Rig files - this will make copying animations easier\n- The characters have a full body and underwear. Please remember that using a full body with clothing is not recommended to avoid mesh crossing\n- The project includes high quality render scenes with biomes (five additional maps). Make sure the Settings - \"Engine Scalability Settings\" and \"Material Quality Level\" are set to the highest quality.\n- The blueprint character_name_All_Parts includes all character parts and weapons.\n- Advanced material setup based on blueprints.\n- Convenient switching of clothing parts via Construction Script.\n- Fully customized physics of the characters. Simulation of hair, clothes, body are included.\n- You can also change the color of skin, eyes, clothes, accessories and hair.\n- Shaders contain fine tuning based on blueprints. SSS, micronormal masks, etc - all inclusive and ready to go!\n- The package includes starting animations, but we recommend using the ALC4 or Lyra animations - you will immediately see the difference :)\n- 52 calibrated facial blendshapes for cinematic cutscenes, compatible with Live Link Face, Faceware and more.\n- Customized Live Link Face - just connect your iPhone and bring your character to life! (may require calibration depending on your face shape)\n- Instances and ID Masks of materials are configured, so you can easily control a lot of material parameters.\n- Want to see models in action? Just press Play and the scene will come to life! You will be able to see demonstrations of animations, skins, blendshapes, modularity, ragdolls, all accessories - all this in a carefully designed environment of the demoscene. Press F in Play-Selected Viewport to quickly change characters.\n- Full compatibility with Epic Skeleton. This is an advanced version of the UE5 skeleton with all additional bones\n\n**ADDITIONAL FEATURES FOR UNITY PACKAGES:**\n\n- The packages include a Third Person Character Controller, so you can play and test animations right from the box.\n- Fully customized combinations of character. Just use one of the prepared prefabs by dragging and dropping it onto the stage!\n- Instances and ID Masks of materials are configured, so you can easily control a lot of material parameters.\n- The demo video shows the work of the Magica Cloth 2 plugin for hair and clothing physics. You can get a project with it by sending us your purchase receipt for this plugin via email or Discord https://discord.gg/nUQ7TmQgCZ. The Unity Chan script is working in project by default.\n- Shaders contain fine tuning, package included HDRP, URP, Built-In Shader.\n- Demo and cinematic scenes are included. It contains a lot of high-quality props - we are sure they will be useful in your game!\n\n**Important notes for Unity:**\n\n- If you want to assemble several projects into one, please follow these instructions https://docs.google.com/document/d/1luQtDAbcw-JFFuHXV-evYBl9C7hCrt6HLAk2s2F668I/edit?usp=sharing\n- This package included HDRP, URP, Built-In Shader, to use this character in Built-In or URP you need swap shader following this Tutorial https://bit.ly/3WSdGiY\n- For better image quality in other render pipelines (not HDRP), individual lighting and camera settings are required for your project. Please follow this tutorial https://bit.ly/3WSdGiY for more info\n- You need to create new High Definition Render Pipeline (HDRP 7.5.1+) project template then import character on Unity HUB (or transfer model to a project with a configured HDRP) to avoid get shader errors. If you want to work in a different pipeline, please follow the instructions above.\n- The demo video and screenshots show the work of HDRP pipeline.\n- Unity does not support the exchange of assets between projects by default.\nWe recommend using the free Skinned Mesh Transfer plugin to share assets between multiple projects. Follow our tutorial https://youtu.be/y1GaTiyj0oQ for more information.\n\nModels height: 185 cms male, 175 cms female\n\n**Polycount:**\n\n- Thomas: 79176\n- Christopher: 79010\n- Eva: 83855\n- Victoria: 64833\n- Jane: 101174\n\nWeapons:\n\n- Bow: 22340\n- Pistol: 19306\n- Knife: 2705\n- Axe: 834\n- Ice pick: 3708\n\n- Source .fbx, .maya files with meshes on quads, textures for various programs - after purchasing any of our products, you can request additional files and any help on working with them by mail help.davidgrette@gmail.com. It's free!\n- Characters are made from the scratch, without the use of Daz models, scanning method and others\n- Low poly, game-ready, rigged, PBR textures\n- Additional bones list https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tVSJDuzOsrMfeDaohh-_l9z0RcmKEz7tv8TmGR6GK80/edit?usp=sharing\n\nWe would be grateful if you take our survey - it will help us make useful content in the future! Link: https://bit.ly/3ERm4Y1\n\nThank you, David Grette team \n\nSupport mail: help.davidgrette@gmail.com\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/u7MCTmDqmU","imageAlt":"3D asset Adventure Characters Pack - Survival Survivor 3","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/adventure-characters-pack-survival-survivor-rpg-shooter-action","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/GE69L2zYn8faHNTFQCQGkasK/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/cover%20cgtrader%20pack1.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/GE69L2zYn8faHNTFQCQGkasK/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/cover%20cgtrader%20pack1.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/adventure-characters-pack-survival-survivor-rpg-shooter-action","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":228,"name":".json","is_native":false},{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":185,"name":".mat","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":212,"name":".svg","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":217,"name":".psd","is_native":false},{"id":231,"name":".yaml","is_native":false},{"id":222,"name":".mp4","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"man","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Man","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5169549/2f6cf0a952/adventure-characters-pack-survival-survivor-rpg-shooter-action-3d-model-2f6cf0a952.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3883836","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3883836,"title":"Complete Male Anatomy","price":129.0,"description":"**Complete Male Anatomy**\n\nThe Complete Male Anatomy is a high quality, photo real models that will enhance detail and realism to any of your rendering projects. The model has a fully textured, detailed design allows for close-up renders, and was originally modeled in 3ds Max and rendered with V-Ray\n\nFeatures: \n- No errors or missing files\n- High-quality polygonal model\n- No N-GONS Faces \n- This model is created in polygon quad \u0026 tri with good edge flow, So you can edit and change it according to your requirements.\n- Correctly scaled accurate representation of the original object. \n- HDR Light Map is included if necessary .\n- PBR textures are included.\n- The scene is well arranged (proper layer and group)\n- Objects, materials, and textures are named.\n- Full organic details are given to describe them.\n- Complete and accurate modeling\n- Up to 8k-size textures.\n\n******************************************************************\n\n\u003e Details:\n\nUnits in all formats : CM\n\nDimension: 68cm x 27cm x 173cm\n\n- Body skin---------------------Polys:15947-------Verts: 15949-------Dimension :68x26x171\n- Eye anatomy----------------Polys:51191---------Verts: 51915--------Dimension :6x11x8\n- (Included: Eyeballs- Nasolacrimal duct- Lacrimal glands -Muscles-Nervous)\t\n- Ear anatomy----------------Polys:14137---------Verts: 14668--------Dimension :7x3x8\n- (Included: External acoustic meatus- Eustachian tube- Tympanic membrane- Cochlea- Stapes- Malleus- Incus- Vestibule)\n- Skeletons + Ligaments-----Polys:262884-------Verts: 265428-------Dimension :66x24x170\n- Muscular system -----------Polys:209701-------Verts: 217522-------Dimension :65x23x170\n- Veins and arteries----------Polys:135675-------Verts: 136826-------Dimension :66x24x170\n- Nervous system-------------Polys:185886-------Verts: 190494-------Dimension :66x24x170\n- (Included: Spinal cord- membrane –Nervous vessels)\n- Lymphatic system----------Polys:41006-------Verts: 42630-------Dimension :54x18x140\n- (Included: Spleen- Thymus- Thyroid- Lymph nodes - Lymphatic vessels)\n- Brain anatomy--------------Polys:39159-------Verts: 39486-------Dimension :11x15x15\n- (Included: membrane- Midbrain-Base- Cerebellum- Cerebrum- Putamen- Hippocampus- Dentate gyrus)\n- Heart anatomy--------------Polys:11029-------Verts: 11017-------Dimension :9x9x9\n- (Included: Pulmonary vein- Aorta- Pulmonary artery- Mitral valve- Tricuspic valve)\n- Lungs with Bronchus-------Polys:15386-------Verts: 15721-------Dimension :23x15x24\n- Larynx with Trachea--------Polys:19902-------Verts: 19982-------Dimension :3.5x7x17\n- Diaphragm--------------------Polys:1294---------Verts: 1289-------Dimension :21x12x12\n- Kidneys-------------------------Polys:13256--------Verts: 13482------Dimension :14x5x22\n- Bladder-------------------------Polys:4805---------Verts: 4819--------Dimension :6x8x10\n- Oral cavity---------------------Polys:13278--------Verts: 13632------Dimension :7x10x6\n- Liver-----------------------------Polys:1308----------Verts: 1310-------Dimension :14x10x9\n- Stomach-----------------------Polys:9020----------Verts: 9066-------Dimension :11x8x12\n- Pancreas------------------------Polys:14978-------Verts: 15269------Dimension :11x5x6\n- Large Intestine----------------Polys:4233---------Verts: 4234--------Dimension :20x14x32\n- Small intestine----------------Polys:7612---------Verts: 7626--------Dimension :14x15x15\n- Male reproductive sys.------Polys:30397-------Verts: 30633-------Dimension :11x5x6\n- Boxers-------------------------Polys:718----------Verts: 766----------Dimension :36x25x30\n- Hair----------------------------Polys:21211-------Verts: 39955-------Dimension :17x21x20\n_________________\n\n\u003e Complete Male Anatomy \n\n- Polys:\t987215\n- Verts:\t1023917\n\n\nPolygon: Quad and Tri (Subdivision-ready) no Ngons\n******************************************************************\n\n\u003e Formats:\n- 3Ds Max 2021 _V-Ray\n- Blender 4.2\n- 3Ds Max 2014 _V-Ray\n- 3Ds Max 2014 _Scanline\n- 3Ds Max 2011 _Scanline\n- 3Ds Max 2011 _V-Ray\n- Maya 2016_V-Ray\n- Maya 2016_Default\n- Cinema 4D R15 _V-Ray\n- Cinema 4D R15 _Standard\n- FBX\n- OBJ\n- GLB\n\nEvery model has been checked with the appropriate software\n\n******************************************************************\n\n\u003e Textures:\n- Name---------------------Size -------Format-------QTY\n- Body skin -------------- 4096--------PNG---------8\n- Head skin---------------4096--------PNG---------8\n- Skin---------------4096--------PNG---------8\n- Hair-----------------------4096--------PNG---------9\n- Scalp---------------------4096--------PNG---------9\n- Boxers--------------------4096--------PNG--------8\n- Eyeball--------------------4096--------PNG--------8\n- Eyelash--------------------4096--------PNG-------9\n- Veins and Arteries----- 1024--------PNG--------8\t\n- Head neck muscles---- 8192--------PNG-------8\n- Upper limb muscles--- 8192--------PNG-------8\n- lower limb muscles---- 8192--------PNG-------8\n- Trunk muscles---------- 8192--------PNG-------8\n- Skull----------------------- 8192--------PNG-------8\n- Upper limb skeleton-- 8192---------PNG-------8\n- lower limb skeleto---- 8192---------PNG-------8\n- Chest skeleton--------- 8192---------PNG-------8\n- Spine skeleton--------- 8192---------PNG-------8\t\n- Pelvis skeleton--------- 8192---------PNG-------8\n- Lymphatic--------------- 2048--------PNG-------8\n- Nervous------------------ 1024--------PNG--------8\n- Brain--------------------- 8192--------PNG--------8\n- Oral cavity---------------2048--------PNG--------8\n- Heart anatomy---------8192--------PNG--------8\n- Stomach-----------------4096--------PNG--------8\n- Liver-----------------------4096--------PNG--------8\n- Pancreas Spleen--------4096--------PNG--------8\n- Small Intestine----------4096--------PNG--------8\n- Large Intestine----------4096--------PNG--------8\n- Bladder------------------ 4096--------PNG--------8\n- Male Reproductive---- 4096--------PNG--------8\n- Kidney-------------------- 4096--------PNG--------8\n\nIncluded: Diffuse/Base - Glossiness/Roughness- Normal- Specular/Metallic- AO -Opacity\n\nIf you have any questions concerning the product or you need further support please contact via support ticket.","imageAlt":"3D asset Complete Male Anatomy","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/science/medical/complete-human-anatomy","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":false,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/su8ryk1wfhqmws8go5eou9yrjcse/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/sig.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/su8ryk1wfhqmws8go5eou9yrjcse/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/sig.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/science/medical/complete-human-anatomy","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":120,"name":".mel","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":117,"name":".gltf","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"science","subcategorySlug":"medical","categoryTitle":"Science","subcategoryTitle":"Medical","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3883836/afdd302c99/complete-male-anatomy-3d-model-afdd302c99.webp","saleOffDiscount":0,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5514323","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5514323,"title":"African Village","price":39.0,"description":"\nThis meticulously crafted asset pack brings to life an authentic African village with a variety of hand-made structures and props. The pack features both intricate architectural elements and smaller environment details to recreate traditional rural settlements.\n\nNumber of Unique Meshes: 236\nVertex Count: 500–10k\nNumber of Materials: 2\nNumber of Material Instances: 25\nNumber of Textures: 75\nTexture Resolutions: 2k–4k","imageAlt":"3D asset low-poly African Village","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/historic-exterior/african-village-9cd3e58e-5be6-4e78-b977-1226458c4ec5","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/C4kJVrhtnAyDDP3jojbnS4q6/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/cgtrader.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/C4kJVrhtnAyDDP3jojbnS4q6/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/cgtrader.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/historic-exterior/african-village-9cd3e58e-5be6-4e78-b977-1226458c4ec5","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":51,"name":".stl","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"historic-exterior","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Historic","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5514323/fbdb2c7c10/african-village-3d-model-fbdb2c7c10.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"3906424","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":3906424,"title":"Spartan Hoplite - Game Ready","price":45.0,"description":"-Product name: Spartan Hoplite\n\nAncient Greek Warrior, wearing not so practical armor for showing his abs!\n\n+Low poly, game ready, rigged, PBR textures. Include body mesh. UE4 supported.\n\nTotal tris counts: 140,117\n+Unit: centimeters. Model Height: 184cm\n\n+FBX folders contain premade combined fbx for Full Armor, Half Armor, Full meshes. And \"Modular\" folder for individual parts\n\n+Full modeled.\n\n+UE4 project with playable blueprint and cloth physics.\n\n+.blend file. Blender 3.2. Fully rigged with Auto Rig Pro plugin.\n\n+3Ds Max and Maya scene with UE4 skeleton setup.\n\n+PBR textures (Metallic-Roughness) 2048X2048 and 4096x4096. DirectX Normal Maps. .TGA format.\n\nTextures can be found in this folder: RyanReos_SpartanHoplite\\Assets\\Textures\n\n\n+Include Marmoset files with material and studio lighting setup.\n+Include Zbrush .ztl file for full character model and weapon!\n\n+Screenshots folder for more preview images (Warning: Nudity Content)\n\n**Enter the code easylovers for 30% off any purchase of my products.**\n\nVisit my Patreon here for more images and character models: patreon.com/RyanReos.\nThank you for supporting my works!\n\nRyan Reos.","imageAlt":"3D asset Spartan Hoplite - Game Ready","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/spartan-hoplite-game-ready","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/CnxWSKYMzJXBsPrgnduham2Z/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/THUMBSpartan.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/CnxWSKYMzJXBsPrgnduham2Z/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/THUMBSpartan.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/spartan-hoplite-game-ready","isCgtVerified":true,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":true},{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false},{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":false},{"id":137,"name":".tbscene","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"fantasy-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Fantasy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/3906424/d375b9be24/spartan-hoplite-game-ready-3d-model-d375b9be24.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5683350","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5683350,"title":"2024 FIAT DUCATO  L3H2 Detailed interior","price":49.0,"description":"FIAT DUCATO  LWB (Long WheelBase) L3H2 medium roof height.\n\nThe 3D model matches the dimensions of the actual vans but is not an accurate CAD engineering model. This should be taken into account if you work in industrial design.\n\nFacelift (2024–present) See other models FIAT DUCATO (L1H1, L1H2, L2H2, L3H2, L4H2, L4H3...) on my profile. \nThe Fiat Ducato is a light commercial vehicle officially developed by Stellantis and produced since 1981. \nFiat Ducato is a practical, reliable and functional commercial vehicle. The volume of the cargo compartment reaches up to 17 m³.\nThe carrying capacity of the van is 1.9 tons. Third generation (2006–present) Facelift (2024–present)\n\nDimensions: 5998 mm (length) x 2524 mm (height) x 2050 mm.\n\nPolys: 418168 Verts: 450104\n\nModel features:\n\nDetailed exterior. Detailed interior. Detailed cargo area.\n\nEach object has a material name, you can easily change or apply materials.\n\nIt is easy to separate sub-objects from the object into separate elements.\n\nAll objects are georeferenced to a point with zero coordinates.\n\nIn the model are applied simple Materials that do not require textures.\n\nThe preview is obtained using the Corona renderer and with these materials.\n\nUse files with extension (.FBX) to import this model into other graphic editors, if they support importing (.FBX) files.\n\n\nFormats:\n\n1) max (2014 + Corona 1.7),\n\n2) max (2014 + VRay 3.6),\n\n3) fbx (2013 Corona),\n\n4) fbx (2013 VRay),\n\n5) obj,\n\n6) blend 2.92(materials require customization)\n\nRender: Corona, VRay\n\nHappy renders! See other models on my profile.\n","imageAlt":"2024 FIAT DUCATO L3H2 Detailed 3D model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/2024-fiat-ducato-l3h2-detailed-interior","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/nezxytvyoj98rw2pv5q302possy8/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/000.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/nezxytvyoj98rw2pv5q302possy8/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/000.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/vehicle/truck/2024-fiat-ducato-l3h2-detailed-interior","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"vehicle","subcategorySlug":"truck","categoryTitle":"Vehicle","subcategoryTitle":"Truck","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5683350/ee8865a12c/2024-fiat-ducato-l3h2-detailed-interior-3d-model-ee8865a12c.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6821100","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6821100,"title":"Archexteriors vol 47 - Garden Scenes","price":149.0,"description":"This collection contains 6 ready-to-render scenes of small, charming gardens. From urban patios to cozy suburban retreats, each environment features fire pit lounges, alfresco dining setups, BBQ stations, and covered outdoor living rooms.\nThe scenes showcase modern minimalist decking, romantic cottage gardens with flowering perennials, and resort-inspired spaces with atmospheric lighting. Every composition balances functional hardscaping with lush, layered vegetation.\nDesigned for maximum flexibility, the collection provides diverse camera angles and lighting conditions suitable for residential visualization, landscape architecture presentations, and outdoor furniture marketing. \n\n- Prepared for 3ds Max (Corona, V-Ray), Blender (Cycles), Cinema 4D (V-Ray, Redshift), FBX and OBJ.\n- **Cinema 4D (V-Ray, Redshift) - only 3d models are available.**\n- Recommended system specification: this product was tested on amd ryzen 9 with 64 GB of ram and should work on platforms with similar specifications.\n \n\nThe files are packed into 7zip format, you need to follow these steps to extract them properly:\n1. Download all files to one folder\n2. Use WinRAR or 7-zip for unpacking.\n3. Unpack only the first file from each archive (the file with .001 extension). The rest of the files will be unpacked automatically.","imageAlt":"Archexteriors vol 47 - Garden Scenes 3D model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/landscape/archexteriors-vol-47-garden-scenes","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qly0c5oukudga9qxqweljy51n2xj/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/render2.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qly0c5oukudga9qxqweljy51n2xj/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/render2.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/landscape/archexteriors-vol-47-garden-scenes","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":false,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":false}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":17,"name":".max","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":6,"name":".c4d","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":216,"name":".jpg","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"landscape","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Landscape","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6821100/b54698dc8b/archexteriors-vol-47-garden-scenes-3d-model-b54698dc8b.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2916133","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2916133,"title":"US Soldier GAME READY","price":39.99,"description":"**Low Poly**  model of US SOF Soldier with PBR textures. **Only 2 UV!** (2 4k maps pbr)\n\n**5 different variations** of clothing and armor camouflage. You can combine them in different ways. (As a result, you can create about **10 unique camouflages**) \nAll pouches, grenades, nvg, helmet cover \u0026 etc are separate objects. They can be turned off, **creating a variety**. Also pnv has two positions.There is a basic rig.\nFBX files. Blend files. \nPBR TEXTURES INCLUDE BASECOLOR, ROUGHNESS, METALIC, NORMAL, OPACITY (in basecolor A channel)\n\nTOTAL: VERTS: 74K, FACES: 70K, TRIS:140K.\n\nCLOTHING ONLY (PANTS, JACKET, GLOVES, BALACLAVA) VERTS: 10K, FACES: 9K, TRIS:20K.\n\nVEST ONLY (ARMOR VEST, UNLOADING, POUCHES, BELT, BACKPACK) VERTS: 25K, FACES: 24K, TRIS:45K.\n\nTACTICAL HELMET ONLY (NVG, helmet, HEADPHONES) VERTS: 16K, FACES: 15K, TRIS:30K.\n\nETC\n\n","imageAlt":"3D model US Soldier GAME READY","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/us-sof-soldier-game-ready-3d-model","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qLYoL7mxgkCu9y8tnJg7YoXc/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Main.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/qLYoL7mxgkCu9y8tnJg7YoXc/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Main.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/us-sof-soldier-game-ready-3d-model","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"man","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Man","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2916133/d2b7eea58f/us-soldier-game-ready-3d-model-d2b7eea58f.webp","saleOffDiscount":30,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"2650443","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":2650443,"title":"Sci-Fi Industrial Base - Unreal project","price":75.0,"description":"The full Unreal project of Sci-Fi Industrial Base pack allows you to build lush Sci-Fi environments using many of our game ready prefabs to construct your world.\nWith our high quality assets you can build a AAA Sci-Fi scene. Also, we provide a pre built demo scene to showcase the pack and to help you get started.\nPack contents:\n600 Game ready assets\n2-4k texture resolutions\n1  Demo scene","imageAlt":"3D model Sci-Fi Industrial Base - Unreal project","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/sci-fi-exterior/sci-fi-industrial-base-unreal-project","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1p3EissucvifSSHJnVFwdZrc/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/Preview01.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/1p3EissucvifSSHJnVFwdZrc/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/Preview01.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/exterior/sci-fi-exterior/sci-fi-industrial-base-unreal-project","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":false,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":true},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"exterior","subcategorySlug":"sci-fi-exterior","categoryTitle":"Exterior","subcategoryTitle":"Sci-fi","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/2650443/85f9f2346a/sci-fi-industrial-base-unreal-project-3d-model-85f9f2346a.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"6623038","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":6623038,"title":"Hydra Dragon","price":79.0,"description":"**Hydra Three-headed Dragon**\n- Formats: Blender Project file (with fully rigged armature \u0026 animations), Substance Painter (v7.1.1), Zbrush (v2023), animated FBX, OBJ\n- Polycount: 90762 polygons\n- Textures: 8 Materials, 4096 resolution (Base Color, Ambient Occlusion, Roughness, Normal Map, Subsurface Scattering, Displacement)\n- Model size: 38.5m wingspan x 30m length x 8m height\n- Addons requirement: No\n- Fully rigged without any addons or plugins (Blender)\n- Animations list:  Idling, Take Off, Landing, Roar, Hit React, Flying, Flying Left, Flying Right, Gliding, Hovering, Crawling, Crawling Left, Crawling Right.\n- Concept designed by me - HuyKhoi2407.\n\n\u003e The Hellfire Hydra is a rare, mutated dragon. It possesses three heads, each with an independent mind, unique personality, and distinct combat instinct. While the heads often argue and clash in thought, they achieve near-perfect coordination in battle and hunting, unleashing unpredictable and highly effective attacks. Known as one of the most lethal dragon variants ever recorded, the Hellfire Hydra appears only rarely — yet every sighting leaves behind a legacy of devastation and a reputation that echoes through generations of fearful legends.","imageAlt":"Hydra Dragon 3D model","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/hydra-dragon","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/hecqp70k0ic2swaibhai26bvwxbw/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/0000.00_00_01_26.Still001.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/hecqp70k0ic2swaibhai26bvwxbw/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/0000.00_00_01_26.Still001.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/animal/dinosaur/hydra-dragon","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":true,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":219,"name":".exr","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":55,"name":".ztl","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"animal","subcategorySlug":"dinosaur","categoryTitle":"Animals","subcategoryTitle":"Dinosaur","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/6623038/01dd78224d/hydra-dragon-3d-model-01dd78224d.webp","saleOffDiscount":40,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5709879","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5709879,"title":"Inquisitor - RPG Dark Fantasy Modular Female and Male Characters","price":119.99,"description":"\u003e **Inquisitor  - Game Ready** \n is a part of Dark Fantasy Medieval Collection. They come with many customization options, advanced shaders, ARKit blendshapes, UE5 Rig, and many color options. Compatible with other of my models, and perfectly suits any game needs. Many different Hairstyles, 2 Clothes options: full and lingerie.\n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Key Features**\n\n-          Low-poly\n-          Completely modular\n-          Fully Rigged\n-          Apple Blendshapes\n-          Adjustable body parts\n-          Easy Color Change\n-          Plenty of unique hairstyles\n-          Advanced materials! Tons of customization\n-          Male and Female variant\n-          Weapon is included\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Polycount** |  The Character does not have LOD system\n\n\n-          Inquisitor Boy\n-          Faces 15713・ Tris 30690・ Verts 17009\n\n\n\n-          Inquisitor Boy in Underwear\n-          Faces 36672・ Tris 70216・ Verts 40781\n\n\n\n-          Inquisitor Girl\n-          Faces 36965 ・ Tris 70540・ Verts 40417\n\n\n\n-          Inquisitor Girl in Underwear\n-          Faces 17732 ・ Tris 32442 ・ Verts 20022\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Rig** is based on the Epic Skeleton (UE5) with additional bones\n\n-          The main bones hierarchy has remained untouched\n-          It was made in Maya without plugins and does not have controls\n-          You can apply physics to different parts\n-          The model is compatible with my previous releases as soon it shares the same skeleton.\n-          I will update my previous releases to the UE5 skeleton over time.\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Tested with various animations**\n\n-          Advanced Locomotion System v4\n-          Standard 3rd person animations\n-          Female Interactions Animations\n-          Mocap Library\n-          ARLS + Horse Animset\n-          Succubus AnimSet\n-          Valley of the Ancient\n-          Close Combat: Swordsman\n-          Lyra Starter Game\n-          Game Animation Sample\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Blendshapes**\n\n-          Perfectly calibrated 52 Apple Blendshapes.\n-           Tested with Live Link Face in Unreal Engine 5 and Face Capture in Unity.\n-          Can be used for Live Stream facial animations\n-          LiveLinkFace, FaceWare, Facial Mocap, VTuber Avatar, VRchat, MMD, etc.\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e  **Different Outfits and Modularity**\n\n-          The model is completely modular!\n-          Remove or add any part. Or if you want, take clothes off completely\n-          Body texture is censored. The uncensored texture is included\n-          Adult parts are not modeled and do not have morphs or a rig. It’s a texture\n-          To avoid body intersection through clothes, the body is sliced into pieces\n-          Pieces that are beneath the clothes must be turned off or hidden\n-          By doing that, you reduce the polycount!\n-          Full-Body is included\n-          Weapon is included\n\n\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\u003e **Unreal Engine Project**\n\n\n-          Supported version: 4.24+\n\n-          Demo render scene with blueprint included!\n\n-          Epic Skeleton rig with additional bones\n\n-          For facial animations use Morph Targets\n\n-          Advanced materials\n\n-          Physics are not included by default. It’s advisable to use KawaiiPhysics plugin for the best-looking results. Exclusively for this character in Unreal Engine 5, I've prepared a bonus ALS Community + KawaiiPhysics project, which you can request after purchase. To avoid clothes intersection, limiters are included. \n\n-          Material Instances with MatID map for color change are included\n\n-          3rd person standard animations are included\n\n-          Separated Meshes for Master Pose / Leader Component are included\n\n-          Wind Simulation for Hair!\n\n\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\n\u003e **MatID Maps** ┆ Skin, Eyes, and Outfit Parts\n\n\n\n-          A MatID map is used for changing colors of a BaseColor Map by sections\n-          You can use the Advanced Shader to change the colors easily\n\n\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\n\u003e **4K Textures**\n\n\n-          8 Texture sets: Body, Head, Eyes, Lashes, Clothes, Straight Hair, Wavy Hair, Weapon\n-          Textures are packed for better optimization\n-          Each set contains:\n-          BaseColor, Normal, Roughness, Metallic, MetallicSmoothness, MaskMap,\n-          Ambient Occlusion, and may include a MatID, Opacity and Emissive maps\n\n\n ࣪ \n\n ࣪ \n\n\n**FAQ**\n\n**Need help with the model, how to contact you?**\nFeel free to ask me any questions using the messaging system on CGTrader!\n\n\n\n**Can I create an NFT with your model or sell it as a VRchat avatar?**\nNo, it is prohibited to use my models for creating non-fungible tokens, or use in other blockchains. It is also prohibited to re-sell my models as a VRChat avatar, even if applying changes to them. It is also prohibited to sell images (.png, .jpg, .jpeg, etc.) of my models.\n\n\n\n**Can I use this model in Blender / Cinema4D / 3dsMax / etc.?**\nYes, you can. File formats such as .fbx can be imported anywhere. However, the rig and blendshapes are originally made in Maya and some software might not recognize them correctly. Unfortunately, I cannot give you support for this software because I do not have any experience with them. The only software that I support is Maya, Unreal Engine, and Unity.\n\nMy customers have reported to me that my models work in Blender.\n\n\n\n**Does the advanced material work without the Shader Graph?**\nNo, however, Shader Graph is included in URP/HDRP by default. For Built-in, it is necessary to install the package.\n\n**Can I request customization? Are you available for commissions?**\nUnfortunately, I am unavailable for any kind of commission.\n\n\n   ≽^·⩊·^≼\n\n Thank you!\n\n﹌﹌﹌﹌﹌","imageAlt":"3D model Inquisitor - RPG Dark Fantasy Modular Female 2","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/inquisitor-rpg-dark-fantasy-modular-female-and-male-characters","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wnqTimMjympmyAB2yYbB8v7m/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/cgtrader.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/wnqTimMjympmyAB2yYbB8v7m/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/cgtrader.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/fantasy-character/inquisitor-rpg-dark-fantasy-modular-female-and-male-characters","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":83,"name":".unitypackage","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":185,"name":".mat","is_native":false},{"id":100,"name":".pdf","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_native":false},{"id":null,"name":null,"is_native":false},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":101,"name":".spp","is_native":false}],"categorySlug":"character","subcategorySlug":"fantasy-character","categoryTitle":"Character","subcategoryTitle":"Fantasy","schemaImageUrl":"https://img-new.cgtrader.com/items/5709879/780a4b0082/inquisitor-rpg-dark-fantasy-modular-female-and-male-characters-3d-model-780a4b0082.webp","saleOffDiscount":50,"eligibleForSubscription":false,"subscriptionSubscribed":false,"subscriptionPotential":false}},{"id":"5210340","type":"listingItem","attributes":{"id":5210340,"title":"Volvo EX30 2025 with interior","price":99.0,"description":"Detailed exterior and interior. Doors and trunk can be opened.\n\n3ds max 2014 and vray 3,5 scene with lighting and rendering setup included.\n\nBlender scene with model and materials only.\n\nC4d scene with model only and very simple materials only.\n\nExported formats with simple materials: obj and fbx (both in two resolutions). Please note that after import exchange formats like obj or fbx to your software, model may need addinational work like changing materials, adding textures or adding subdivision surface.\n\npolycount:\n\nuncallopsed - 450 000 poly,\n\ncallopsed (obj, fbx hi-version): 2 100 000 poly / 4 100 000 tris","imageAlt":"3D model Volvo EX30 2024 with interior","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/suv/volvo-ex30-2024-with-interior","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/aT4VfhCMJTaP8sDo4KuyQW4Z/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/00a.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/aT4VfhCMJTaP8sDo4KuyQW4Z/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/00a.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/car/suv/volvo-ex30-2024-with-interior","