and ready to anim\n\nUnits: cm\n\n-unreal section\n\n*adapted\nto unreal engine skeleton ready to use ,this package include unreal\nfile contained this models and work perfectly with third person template\nwith standard unreal animation bp and skeleton.\n\n*facial blend\nshape work perfect in unreal engine (Tongue ,lips ,brow ,blink , nose\nFlank,cheek , mouth ...) more than 125 morph controller\n\n*you can control every think with material (multi material setting)\n\n-maya 2022+ section\n\n*rigged with body and face controller ready to manually animate\n\n*blend shape work perfectly\n\n*Hight quality standard material for rendering (you cans use any render engine )\n\n-Blender:\n\nfull rigged with facial and ready to render\n\nyou can find all texture to use them for other software Hope you like it!\n\nTo look at all my collection, just click on my user name to see complete gallery.","imageAlt":"rigged Cinematic Surgeon Model Fully Rigged for Animation","url":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/cinematic-surgeon-model-fully-rigged-for-animation-games","isCLDApplicable":false,"isSaleOffApplicable":true,"gaAttributes":{},"primaryImage":{"gridFallbackUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/vtKDTJgpHham2ZF77gET6wce/a26e47dab5f2d22c43d6c5ce4b4b46ecc30c70918878397cba1a10c1e35d7bfc/cg.jpg","gridUrl":"https://media.cgtrader.com/variants/vtKDTJgpHham2ZF77gET6wce/78add9c2f02fbd73a43ffb3970be38683c5f15eff6ca849dc78c644f4ff9ce1b/cg.webp","isAdultContent":false},"modelInfo":{"modelUrl":"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/character/man/cinematic-surgeon-model-fully-rigged-for-animation-games","isCgtVerified":false,"types":{"printReady":false,"animated":false,"pbr":true,"rigged":true,"lowPoly":true}},"metaverseFormatsList":[{"id":11,"name":".ma","is_native":true},{"id":12,"name":".obj","is_native":false},{"id":21,"name":".blend","is_native":false},{"id":96,"name":".uasset","is_native":false},{"id":5,"name":".fbx","is_native":false},{"id":215,"name":".png","is_nati